RADAR_LOAD("2025-11",[{"id":"10.1002/cphc.202500225","t":"Screening Janus‐2H‐WSSe with Adsorbed Transition Metals as Efficient Catalyst for Nitrogen Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cphc.202500225","s":"ChemPhysChem","d":"2025-11-30","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) provides a promising strategy for effective nitrogen fixation under mild conditions. Herein, structural stability and NRR catalytic activity of 29 transition metal (TM, Sc‐Hg) atoms adsorbed Janus 2H‐WSSe monolayers are studied using the first‐principles calculations. Six screened TM@S/Se‐WSSe (TM = Os, Re) and TM@Se‐WSSe (TM = Ir, Mo) systems are considered promising single‐atom catalysts (SACs) due to low limiting potential (−0.36 to −0.73 V) and high Faradaic efficiency (FE > 90.61%). High catalytic activity arises from the donation and back‐donation mechanisms between the empty/unoccupied TM‐ d orbitals and the bonding/antibonding N 2 ‐ p orbitals, which significantly promote the activation of N 2 and the charge transfer in the subsequent hydrogenation reactions. In addition, the catalytic activity trend of the screened TM@WSSe syste","au":["Huifang Wu","Haifeng Zhang","Linrui Zhao","Yukai An"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"筛选吸附过渡金属的 Janus‐2H‐WSSe 作为高效的氮还原反应催化剂","zb":"研究对象为29种过渡金属（TM，Sc-Hg）原子吸附的 Janus 2H-WSSe 单层。通过第一性原理计算研究了这些TM@S/Se-WSSe（TM = Os, Re）和TM@Se-WSSe（TM = Ir, Mo）体系的结构稳定性和氮还原反应（NRR）催化活性。筛选出的六个体系（TM@S/Se-WSSe和TM@Se-WSSe）由于低极限电位（-0.36至-0.73 V）和高法拉第效率（FE > 90.61%）被认为是具有潜力的单原子催化剂（SACs）。高催化活性源于TM-d轨道与N-2p轨道之间的电子捐赠和反向捐赠机制，这显著促进了N2的活化和后续氢化反应中的电荷转移。此外，通过四个描述符（ΔG*NH2, ΔG*N, ΔG*NNH, 和φ）分析了筛选出的TM@WSSe体系的催化活性趋势。通过单独调节ΔG*NH2或ΔG*NNH可以实现高活性。其中，ΔG*N = -1.38 eV和φ = 6","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.33961/jecst.2025.00360","t":"Effects of Electroless Deposition Conditions on the Hydrogen Generation Kinetics of Co-Fe-P Catalysts via Hydrolysis of Ammonia Borane Solution","u":"https://doi.org/10.33961/jecst.2025.00360","s":"Journal of Electrochemical Science and Technology","d":"2025-11-30","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This study investigates the fabrication and optimization of Co-Fe-P catalysts on Cu foam using electroless deposition, focusing on their hydrogen generation efficiency. Deposition times were varied from 1 to 10 minutes, resulting in spherical Co-Fe-P particles growing from sub-micron to several microns in size. The optimal hydrogen generation rate of 27.66 ml/min was achieved with a 5-minute deposition. Extending the deposition to 10 minutes led to particle aggregation, reducing the efficiency per unit weight. The impact of bath temperatures from 30°C to 60°C was also assessed, with temperatures of 50°C and above promoting the development of larger 3D structures and increasing Fe and P contents (~9.3 wt.% and 10 wt.%). This enhanced hydrogen generation, peaking again at 27.66 ml/min. NaOH concentrations were varied from 0.5 M to 0.9 M, showing that concentrations over 0.8 M improved cata","au":["ChangMyeon Lee","SeKwon Oh"],"o":"回填","zt":"电镀条件对 Co-Fe-P 催化剂通过氨硼烷溶液水解产生氢气的动力学影响","zb":"研究了在 Cu 泡沫上使用电镀法制备的 Co-Fe-P 催化剂的制备和优化，重点关注其氢气产生效率。沉积时间从 1 到 10 分钟变化，导致球形 Co-Fe-P 颗粒从亚微米到几微米大小。5 分钟沉积时获得最佳氢气产生速率 27.66 ml/min。将沉积时间延长到 10 分钟导致颗粒聚集，降低了单位重量的效率。评估了从 30°C 到 60°C 的浴温影响，50°C 及以上的温度促进了更大的 3D 结构的形成，并增加了 Fe 和 P 含量 (~9.3 wt.% 和 10 wt.%)，从而提高了氢气产生，峰值再次达到 27.66 ml/min。NaOH 浓度从 0.5 M 到 0.9 M 变化，显示浓度超过 0.8 M 改善了催化剂形貌和性能，将氢气产生提高到 10.03 ml/min。在测试的基材中，Cu 泡沫上的 Co-Fe-P 表现出最高的氢气产生速率，这是由于更好的催化剂分布和表面积","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及Fe/铁体系","pp":"Preprints.org"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202511164","t":"Entropy‐Engineered HEO/Fe, N‐CNT Bioanode via Flash Joule Heating: Accelerated Electron Harvesting and Directed Geobacter Enrichment for High‐Power Microbial Fuel Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202511164","s":"Small","d":"2025-11-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Extracellular electron transfer (EET) at the microbe‐anode interface remains a critical bottleneck in microbial fuel cells (MFCs). While high‐entropy oxides (HEOs) show promise for enhancing anode kinetics, conventional synthesis methods yield poor interfacial integration and fail to elucidate entropy‐driven EET mechanisms. Herein, an entropy‐engineered bioanode fabricated via ultrafast flash Joule heating (FJH) is reported, which uniformly anchors HEO nanoparticles (Fe─Co─Ni─Cr─Mn─O) onto vertically aligned Fe, N‐doped carbon nanotubes grown on carbon cloth (HEO/Fe, N‐CNTs/CC). This design synergizes CNT conductivity with HEO pseudocapacitance, achieving a record power density of 3.76 W m −2 , surpassing the state‐of‐the‐art HEO anode by 9.6% and bare carbon cloth by 2.2‐fold. The entropy‐broadened conduction bands and strengthened cytochrome adsorption (ΔE ads = −3.20 eV) redu","au":["Zheng Zhang","Yunfeng Qiu","Yuhang Wang","Miao Yu","Zhuo Ma","Ruiwen Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"熵工程 HEO/Fe, N-CNT 生物阴极通过闪焦热：加速电子收集和定向地杆菌富集用于高功率微生物燃料电池","zb":"研究对象为微生物燃料电池（MFCs）中的细胞外电子转移（EET）。关键方法为通过超快闪焦热（FJH）制备熵工程生物阴极，将 HEO 纳米颗粒（Fe─Co─Ni─Cr─Mn─O）均匀锚定在垂直排列的 Fe, N-掺杂碳纳米管（CNTs）上生长在碳布（CC）上（HEO/Fe, N-CNTs/CC）。主要结果为该设计结合了 CNT 导电性和 HEO 假电容，实现记录功率密度 3.76 W m −2 ，超过 HEO 阴极 9.6%，超过裸碳布 2.2 倍。DFT 计算揭示熵扩展的导带和增强的细胞色素吸附（ΔE ads = −3.20 eV）减少电子隧穿距离到 2.47 Å。此外，阴极促进地杆菌富集（71% 生物膜丰度）和核黄素分泌，促进直接和介导的 EET 途径。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.7868/s3034560x25090115","t":"Growth characteristics, phase composition and optical properties of Ti–Sc–O thin films synthesized by atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.7868/s3034560x25090115","s":"Журнал неорганической химии / Russian Journal of Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2025-11-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Ti–Sc–O thin films were synthesized at 300°C by atomic layer deposition (ALD) via alternating between the reaction cycles with metal precursors and HO as co-reactant. By varying the cycle ratio, the materials of [Sc]/([Ti] + [Sc]) = 13, 25, 44, 64, 82% were obtained. The films were examined via spectral and single wave null ellipsometry, X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy, scanning electron microscopy and X-ray diffraction. The formation of the material was demonstrated to be substrate-inhibited and to occur within the “temperature window” of ALD. As a result of Ti2p and Sc2p XPS spectra analysis, the oxidation states of the metals are Ti and Sc. At low Sc concentrations (up to [Sc]/([Ti] + [Sc]) = 25%) the film crystallization into anatase phase observed for individual TiO film is suppressed. In the range of [Sc]/([Ti] + [Sc]) = 44–100% the materials of various cubic crystal structure typ","au":["D.E. Petukhova"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zb":"通过原子层沉积在300°C下合成Ti–Sc–O薄膜，通过调节循环比获得不同Sc含量的薄膜。研究发现Sc浓度低于25%时抑制了金红石相结晶，高于44%时形成立方结构。薄膜的光学参数随组分变化，适用于光电子学领域。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202509772","t":"Integrating Multiple Functional Components into Active Ensembles by Atomic Layer Deposition for Efficient Hydrogen Conversion and CO Tolerance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202509772","s":"Small","d":"2025-11-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract The hydrogen oxidation reaction (HOR) at the anode of proton exchange membrane fuel cells (PEMFC) is hindered by the massive use of precious Pt catalyst. While atomically dispersed Pt sites can mitigate CO adsorption, their HOR performance remains inherently constrained by the inevitable active site deactivation induced by trace CO poisoning. Here, a stepwise atomic layer deposition strategy is developed to construct WPtRu trimetallic ensembles (WPtRu‐NC), aiming for the rational design of atomic synergistic geometries and electronic configurations. The WPtRu‐NC catalyst shows remarkable HOR mass activity, which is 19 times higher than that of commercial Pt/C. It also achieves a high power density of 1.5 W cm −2 at 0.6 V and good CO tolerance in PEMFC. X‐ray adsorption spectroscopy, in situ Raman spectroscopy, and theoretical calculations indicate that Pt atoms serve as the acti","au":["Jiaye Qiu","Zhongyao Zhang","Mansheng Liao","Yuan Zhang","Ruiwen Qi","Jun Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"将多种功能组分集成到活性体系中通过原子层沉积实现高效的氢转化和CO耐受性","zb":"研究对象为氢氧化反应（HOR）在质子交换膜燃料电池（PEMFC）阳极的催化。采用原子层沉积策略制备了WPtRu三金属体系（WPtRu‐NC），关键方法是原子层沉积制备催化剂，并使用X射线吸附光谱、原位拉曼光谱和理论计算进行表征。结果显示WPtRu‐NC催化剂的HOR质量活性比商业Pt/C高19倍，在0.6 V时达到1.5 W cm −2的功率密度，并具有良好的CO耐受性。Pt原子作为催化HOR的活性位点，Ru原子促进水分解并增强Pt位点的CO氧化，W原子作为Pt和Ru的锚定点，促进其在长期HOR电解过程中的稳定性。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料、原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta07969a","t":"Lithium hydride synergy with Fe/N-co-doped porous carbon for efficient ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta07969a","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-11-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The LiH/Fe–N–C catalyst exhibits efficient ammonia synthesis under mild conditions, highlighting the crucial role of the synergistic interaction between nitrogen vacancies and Fe–H species in promoting dinitrogen activation and hydrogenation.","au":["Yefei Wang","Fei Chang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"LiH与Fe/N共掺杂多孔碳协同高效合成氨","zb":"LiH/Fe–N–C催化剂在温和条件下高效合成氨。研究强调了氮空位与Fe–H物种间的协同作用，促进了二氮的活化与氢化。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料"},{"id":"10.3103/s1061386225700256","t":"Effect of Microstructural, Optical, and Magnetic Properties of Mn–Ni Substituted Ferrite Nanoparticles for Induction Heating Application","u":"https://doi.org/10.3103/s1061386225700256","s":"International Journal of Self-Propagating High-Temperature Synthesis","d":"2025-11-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"In this study, MnxNi1–xFe2O4 (x = 0 to 1) nanoparticles (MNPs) were prepared by a sol–gel auto-combustion route. The X-ray diffraction (XRD) analysis, Fourier transform infrared (FT-IR) spectroscopy, transmission electron microscopy (TEM), and vibrating sample magnetometer (VSM) measurements are used to investigate the effect of Mn substitution on the structure and magnetic properties of the samples. The XRD patterns confirmed that all the samples show a cubic spinel structure; further, the spinel structure of ferrite is validated by FTIR. As Mn2+ ion concentration increases, the peak of the Fe–O bond moves to a lower frequency at tetrahedral sites. Transmission electron microscopy (TEM) analysis depicted particle sizes ranging from 47.70 ± 2.6 to 56.74 ± 3.1 nm with increasing Mn2+ substitution. The saturation magnetization (Ms) increased from 26.21 to 34.95 emu/g, while the coercivity ","au":["M. B. Shelar","K. M. Patil","S. S. Phalake","M. S. Lad","S. K. Nalugade","V. R. Chavan"],"o":"回填","why":["Induction Heating"],"zt":"Mn–Ni取代铁氧体纳米粒子的微观结构、光学和磁性能对感应加热应用的影响","zb":"通过溶胶-凝胶自燃烧法制备了MnxNi1–xFe2O4纳米颗粒，研究了Mn取代对结构和磁性的影响。随着Mn2+浓度增加，饱和磁化强度从26.21增加到34.95 emu/g，优化后的Mn0.2Ni0.8Fe2O4纳米颗粒在交流磁场中表现出优异的自加热特性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.20517/energyz.2025.02","t":"Advances in high-temperature shock technology for structural engineering of electrode materials: a review","u":"https://doi.org/10.20517/energyz.2025.02","s":"Energy Z","d":"2025-11-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Precise control of structure is critical for improving electrochemical performance of electrode materials. Developing effective strategies for structural engineering has therefore become a central pursuit in advancing energy storage and conversion systems. In this aspect, high-temperature shock (HTS) technology has emerged as a powerful tool for engineering electrode materials with precise structural control. By utilizing ultrafast Joule heating to create extreme thermal gradients, HTS enables the rapid synthesis of materials in non-equilibrium states, providing new possibilities for their design. This review focuses on how HTS can be used to achieve designed structural features such as size modulation, defect engineering, phase transformation, and interfacial optimization. Specifically, the unique HTS strategy promotes the creation of nanoscale materials with superior electrochemical pr","au":["Xian-Sen Tao","Fulu Chu","Shaokai Wang","Xiaoyu Fang","Jingyi Zhang","Junwei Meng"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"高温冲击技术用于电极材料结构工程进展综述","zb":"高温冲击（HTS）技术作为一种精确控制结构的方法，被用于电极材料的结构工程。通过利用超快焦耳热产生极端热梯度，HTS能够在非平衡状态下快速合成材料。HTS可以实现尺寸调制、缺陷工程、相变和界面优化等结构特征。HTS促进了纳米级材料的创建，改善了电荷存储和传输，稳定了复杂相如高熵合金，并实现了复杂的界面工程，从而提高了电化学性能和耐久性。HTS在锂和钠离子电池、燃料电池电催化剂优化和水分解效率提升等方面具有巨大潜力。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1038/s41467-025-65627-w","t":"The Effect of Applied Potential on the Li-mediated Nitrogen Reduction Reaction Performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-025-65627-w","s":"Nature Communications","d":"2025-11-27","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The Li-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) has been proposed as one of the most promising ambient production routes for green ammonia. However, the effect of the applied potential ( E we ) on the reaction performance and the properties of the solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) remain poorly understood. Herein, we combine potential controlled experiments using a reliable Li x FePO 4 based reference electrode with post-mortem SEI characterization techniques, wherein we observe both an increase in the LiF concentration in the SEI, originating from LiTFSI decomposition, and the Faradaic efficiency (FE NH3 ) with an increasing E we . The transition from a predominantly organic SEI at low E we (−3.2 V SHE ) to a LiF-enriched layer at higher E we indicates the existence of kinetic barriers for the SEI formation reactions. Moreover, thicker and denser SEI structures observed a","au":["Boaz Izelaar","Pranav Karanth","Arash Toghraei","Santosh K. Pal","Nandalal Girichandran","Mark Weijers"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrogen Reduction Reaction"],"zt":"施加电位对 Li 介导的氮还原反应性能的影响","zb":"Li 介导的氮还原反应 (Li-NRR) 已被提出作为绿色氨最有前景的室温水产生路线之一。然而，施加电位 ( E we ) 对反应性能和固体电解质界面 (SEI) 的影响仍然知之甚少。在此，我们结合使用可靠的 Li x FePO 4 基参考电极的电位控制实验和原位 SEI 表征技术，观察到 SEI 中 LiF 浓度增加，源于 LiTFSI 分解，以及随着 E we 增加 FE NH3 。在低 E we (−3.2 V SHE ) 时以有机 SEI 为主的转变到在高 E we 时富 LiF 的层，表明 SEI 形成反应存在动力学障碍。此外，在高 E we 下观察到的更厚、更致密的 SEI 结构通过改善反应物物种之间的质量传输调节增强了 Li-NRR。然而，这些更厚、更致密的 SEI 形貌由于动态 SEI 厚化和解体导致电流不稳定。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202509526","t":"Tuning the Selectivity for High Yield Ammonia Production in Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction using Sulfur and Nitrogen‐Rich Carbon Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202509526","s":"Small","d":"2025-11-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrocatalytic nitrate (NO 3 − ) reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) offers a promising pathway for synthesizing value‐added ammonia (NH 3 ) while removing NO 3 − pollutants. However, this reaction is hindered by NO 3 − adsorption and slow kinetics involving multiple proton and electron transfer steps. In pursuit of an efficient catalyst, a sulfur and nitrogen‐rich carbon catalyst, SNC 700, with a cuboidal morphology is presented for selective electrochemical NO 3 − reduction to NH 3 . The SNC 700 catalyst exhibited a higher NH 3 Faradaic efficiency (F.E.) of 97.83% and an extremely low F.E. of nitrite (NO 2 − , ≈ 0.69%) compared to the counterpart NC 700 catalyst (F.E. NH3 42.85%, F.E. NO2‐ 9.92%) at a potential of −0.6 V vs. RHE. Complementary insights from in‐situ Raman spectroscopy and microelectrochemical studies revealed the reaction pathway, highlighting a rapid reduction ","au":["Akansha Chaturvedi","Kalpana Garg","Tharamani C. Nagaiah"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"使用富硫和氮碳催化剂调节电化学硝酸盐还原选择性的高产氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐 (NO 3 − ) 还原反应 (NO 3 RR) 为合成高附加值氨 (NH 3 ) 同时去除 NO 3 − 污染物提供了一种有前景的途径。然而，该反应受到 NO 3 − 吸附和涉及多个质子和电子转移步骤的缓慢动力学阻碍。为寻求高效的催化剂，提出了具有立方形态的富硫和氮碳催化剂 SNC 700。SNC 700 催化剂在 -0.6 V vs. RHE 下表现出更高的 NH 3 法拉第效率 (F.E.) 97.83% 和极低的亚硝酸盐 (NO 2 − , ≈ 0.69%) F.E.，而对照 NC 700 催化剂 (F.E. NH3 42.85%, F.E. NO2‐ 9.92%)。补充的原位拉曼光谱和微电化学研究揭示了反应路径，突出了 SNC 700 催化剂相比 NC 700 更快的 NO 3 − 中间体还原和更有利的氢化。这表明将硫掺入含氮碳结构中增强了氢吸附，从而提高了 NO ","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5tc03685b","t":"Atomic layer deposition of Ru using a new zero-valent Ru precursor with a ligand system combining open and closed ligands","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5tc03685b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry C","d":"2025-11-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"A newly designed zero-valent Ru precursor combining open and closed ligands enables atomic layer deposition of low-resistivity, highly conformal Ru thin films with exceptional thermal stability and growth performance.","au":["Na-Gyeong Kang","Min-Ji Ha","Eun-Su Chung","Chang Mo Yoon","Jin-Sik Kim","Yoon-A Park"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"使用结合开式和闭式配体的新型零价Ru前驱体进行Ru原子层沉积","zb":"采用结合开式和闭式配体的新型零价Ru前驱体，实现了低电阻、高均匀性、优异热稳定性和生长性能的Ru薄膜的原子层沉积。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202505148","t":"Atomically Tandem F and P Dual‐Doped Co Catalyst Triggers NO 2 Spillover for Enhanced Ammonia Electrosynthesis from Dilute Nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202505148","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2025-11-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia (NO 3 RR) represents a promising strategy for sustainable NH 3 synthesis and environmental remediation. However, it is critically challenged by high overpotentials and the hydrogen evolution reaction, especially in dilute nitrate environments. Herein, we report an atomically precise tandem electrocatalyst with fluorine and phosphorus dual‐doped cobalt (F, P‐Co) that achieves a record‐high NH 3 yield rate of 357.5 µmol h −1 cm −2 with 96.0% Faradaic efficiency at a low potential of –0.5 V vs. RHE. It exhibits exceptional stability for over 200 h in a 10 m m NO 3 − solution, ranking it among the best‐performing catalysts for low‐concentration NO 3 RR. Notably, in a biomass‐coupled flow cell, it attains a high current density of 200 mA cm −2 , demonstrating great promise for practical application. Mechanistic studies unveil that the F an","au":["Jia Ran","Keqing Fang","Yu‐Lin Sun","Xinzai Lv","Haiyan Wang","Xiaolin Feng"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"原子级串联 F 和 P 双掺杂 Co 催化剂触发 NO 2 溢流以增强从稀硝酸盐电合成氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐 (NO 3 RR) 还原为氨 (NO 3 RR) 代表了可持续 NH 3 合成和环境修复的有前景的策略。然而，它在稀硝酸盐环境中受到高过电位和析氢反应的严重挑战。在此，我们报道了一种具有氟和磷双掺杂钴 (F, P‐Co) 的原子级串联电催化剂，在低电位 -0.5 V vs. RHE 下实现了 357.5 µmol h −1 cm −2 的 NH 3 产率率和 96.0% 的法拉第效率。它在 10 m m NO 3 − 溶液中表现出超过 200 h 的优异稳定性，位列低浓度 NO 3 RR 表现最佳的催化剂之一。值得注意的是，在生物质耦合流电池中，它达到了 200 mA cm −2 的高电流密度，显示出在实际应用中的巨大潜力。机理研究表明，F 和 P 共掺杂协同改变了电位决定步骤并降低了反应势垒，通过涉及 * NO 2 溢流的原子接力机制。具体而言，F‐Co 位点促进了 NO ","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c07131","t":"Alkali Metal Template Effect Manipulates Dual-Site Cobalt–Molybdenum Catalyst Construction for Efficient Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c07131","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-11-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Alkali metals are recognized as effective additives to enhance catalytic activity in heterogeneous catalysis. Nevertheless, the traditional alkali metal promotion effect as electron donors cannot circumvent the linear scaling relationship between intricate reaction intermediates, and achieving highly efficient catalytic processes is still challenging. Herein, we propose an alkali metal template effect for the Co–Mo ensemble, which induces phase transition and intermetallic nanoparticle exsolution to construct a metal-nitride heterostructure. Detailed studies reveal that alkali metal atoms are embedded into the lattice of the oxide precursor rather than being electrostatically deposited over its surface, thus weakening the metal–oxygen interaction and facilitating nanoparticle exsolution from host materials. The prepared Co 3 Mo/Co 2 Mo 3 N catalyst delivers a superior activity of 12.3 mm","au":["Shuairen Qian","Kai Feng","Xiao Chen","Zhengwen Li","Guo Tian","Helai Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"碱金属模板效应调控双位点钴-钼催化剂构建用于高效氨合成","zb":"提出碱金属模板效应诱导 Co-Mo 团簇相变和金属间纳米颗粒析出，构建金属-氮化物异质结构。研究表明碱金属原子嵌入氧化物前驱体晶格而非表面静电沉积，从而削弱金属-氧相互作用。Co3Mo/Co2Mo3N 催化剂在 400 °C 和 0.9 MPa 下活性达 12.3 mmol·g cat−1·h−1，优于单相氮化物。","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta08025h","t":"Light-driven ammonia synthesis from nitrogen and hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta08025h","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-11-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This review summarizes recent advances and mechanisms in light-driven ammonia synthesis from nitrogen and hydrogen, emphasizing the unique role of light in overcoming scaling relationships to facilitate NH 3 production under mild conditions.","au":["Yuqing Xu","Yifei Xue","Chaoran Li","Yu Ji","Yuxuan Zhou","Qianyue Feng"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"光驱动氮气和氢气合成氨","zb":"综述了光驱动氮气和氢气合成氨的最新进展与机理，强调光在克服标度关系以促进温和条件下NH3生产中的独特作用。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.1039/d5mh02001h","t":"Evolving electrocatalytic nitrate-to-ammonia conversion on Cu- and Co-based catalyst engineering with paired electrolysis approaches","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5mh02001h","s":"Materials Horizons","d":"2025-11-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This review outlines a roadmap for efficient electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia, analyzing Cu- and Co-based catalyst design, reaction mechanisms and paired electrolysis systems for transformative energy efficiency and process economics.","au":["Nabilah Saafie","Noor Ashikin Mohamad","Wei Shan Koh","Xianhai Zeng","Soo Young Kim","Wee-Jun Ong"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"利用配对电解方法在 Cu- 和 Co- 基催化剂工程上发展的电催化硝酸盐到氨转化","zb":"该综述概述了高效电催化硝酸盐还原为氨的路线，分析了 Cu- 和 Co- 基催化剂设计、反应机理以及用于变革性能和工艺经济性的配对电解系统。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsomega.5c07318","t":"Defect-Rich Gas–Solution Photocatalytic Systems for Nitrogen Reduction Reactions: Enabling Energy and Carbon Reductions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsomega.5c07318","s":"ACS Omega","d":"2025-11-25","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The efficient and sustainable production of ammonia is pivotal for global food security and energy sustainability. In this study, we developed a novel gas–solution (G–S) photocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (PNRR) system utilizing molybdenum oxide deposited onto carbon fiber paper (MoO3@CFP) and a low-cost 24 W plant lamp as the illumination source. The G–S system eliminates the need for nitrogen gas bubbling by relying on ambient air as the nitrogen source and was demonstrated to be a simplified and scalable approach to ammonia production. The amorphous structure of MoO3@CFP provides abundant active sites and defect centers, enabling effective nitrogen activation and reduction. Under optimized conditions (current = 0.25 A, deposition time = 600 s, stirred), the system achieved a mass-normalized ammonia production rate of 15.144 mmol·g–1·h–1 and sustained performance over five cons","au":["Shih-Mao Peng","Muhammad Saukani","Jen-Chang Yang","Tsung-Rong Kuo"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"富缺陷气-液光催化体系用于氮还原反应：实现能源和碳减排","zb":"研究对象为 MoO3@CFP 和低成本的 24 W 植物灯作为光源的气-液光催化氮还原反应体系。该体系利用环境空气作为氮源，无需氮气鼓泡，是一种简化和可扩展的氨生产方法。MoO3@CFP 的非晶结构提供了丰富的活性位点和缺陷中心，实现了有效的氮活化。在优化条件下（电流 = 0.25 A，沉积时间 = 600 s，搅拌），体系实现了 15.144 mmol·g^-1·h^-1 的质量归一化氨产率，并在五个连续循环（每个循环 1 小时）中保持了持续性能。材料表征证实了催化剂在重复使用后的结构完整性和组成稳定性。提出的机制表明，Mo-O-Mo 链和缺陷位点促进了电子转移和氮活化。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.5c04300","t":"Nickel Oxide Accelerated Iron Nanostructures for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.5c04300","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2025-11-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Rapid industrial growth has led to increasing nitrate (NO 3 – ) wastewater discharge, disrupting ecosystems and threatening human health. Electrocatalytic NO 3 – -to-NH 3 (NITRR) offers a promising method to solve environmental problems and provide clean energy. Electrocatalytic NITRR involves multielectron transfer and hydrogenation processes, in which the hydrogenation of *NO is crucial to the whole reaction. However, the hydrogenation process of *NO is sluggish due to the high chemical dissociation energy of the N–O bond. Here, the Fe nanoplates and nickel oxide/nickel-foam composite material (Fe@NiO/NF) was fabricated and demonstrated an excellent NITRR performance with a high faradaic efficiency over 98.7% at −0.45 V (vs RHE). More importantly, the Fe@NiO/NF electrode maintained excellent stability over 100 h. The condition experiments and electron spin resonance demonstrated that t","au":["Fengjiao Quan","Zihe Xu","Mengqi Hao","Wenjuan Shen","Xiufan Liu","Pengfei Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"氧化镍加速铁纳米结构用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为铁纳米片和氧化镍/镍-泡沫复合材料（Fe@NiO/NF）的电催化硝酸盐（NO3-）还原为氨（NITRR）。该材料表现出优异的NITRR性能，在-0.45 V（vs RHE）下法拉第效率超过98.7%。更重要的是，Fe@NiO/NF电极在100小时内保持优异的稳定性。条件实验和电子自旋共振表明，铁纳米片和氧化镍之间的协同作用显著促进了Fe@NiO/NF上氢自由基（*H）的形成。此外，密度泛函理论计算揭示，这种协同作用有效地降低了Fe@NiO/NF上NO中间体的氢化能垒，从而加速了整体氢化过程。该研究提出了一种经济高效的方法，用于处理NO3-废水并回收宝贵的氮资源。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202511098","t":"Elucidating the Role of Ru‐O v ‐Ce Interfacial Structure on Ru/Silicate‐1 Catalyst by the Doping of CeO 2 for Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202511098","s":"Small","d":"2025-11-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Interface engineer of Ru‐based catalysts has become an attractive strategy to improve ammonia (NH 3 ) decomposition performance by precisely modulating the microenvironment of Ru site. Therefore, the Ru‐O v ‐Ce interfacial structure is constructed on Silicate‐1 (S‐1) to improve the NH 3 decomposition performance of Ru/S‐1 catalyst. The activity test suggests that the generation of Ru‐O v ‐Ce interfacial structure considerably improved the catalytic performance of Ru/S‐1 catalyst, boosting the specific activity from 2546.7 to 4461.3 h −1 at 450 °C, and displays promising cycle and long‐term stability. Comprehensive characterization results reveal that Ru‐O v ‐Ce interfacial structure is favorable for enhancing metal‐support interaction, inducing the generation of oxygen vacancies, and optimizing the electronic structure of Ru species. Moreover, Ru‐O v ‐Ce interfacial structure ex","au":["Xiuzi He","Chao Feng","Fang Dong","Guodong Zhang","Haitao Zhang","Yong Ding"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"通过掺杂 CeO2 解明 Ru-Ov-Ce 界面结构对 Silicate-1 基 Ru 催化剂在氨分解反应中的作用","zb":"研究对象为 Ru/Silicate-1 催化剂，通过掺杂 CeO2 构建了 Ru-Ov-Ce 界面结构，提高了催化剂在氨分解反应中的性能。在 450 °C 下，比活性从 2546.7 h^-1 提高到 4461.3 h^-1。表征结果表明，该界面结构有利于增强金属-载体相互作用，产生氧空位，并优化 Ru 物种的电子结构。此外，该界面结构对 NH3 具有良好的吸附性能，并诱导产生中强碱性位点，促进了 N2 的脱附。原位 DRIFTS 和 DFT 计算揭示，该界面结构在 N-H 键的断裂和 N* 与 H* 的重组中表现出优异性能，显著降低了反应能垒，提高了反应动力学。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472336mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Progress in Catalysts for Green Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472336mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":36,"ab":"Research on catalysts for NH 3 synthesis at mild conditions has been much accelerated in that last decade as evidenced by rapidly increasing publication number of the papers[1]. In this talk I summarize the features of the various activation methods reported so far, looking chronologically back at progress in heterogeneous catalysts since the use of iron oxide for the Haber–Bosch process, introduce progress in new catalysts (Fig.1) and finally the current technical challenges to be overcome are presented. [1] Hosono, H. Spiers Memorial Lecture: Catalytic activation of molecular nitrogen for green ammonia synthesis: introduction and current status. Faraday Discussions, 243, 9-26 (2023). Figure 1","au":["Hideo Hosono"],"o":"回填","w":["Hideo Hosono"],"why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"绿色氨合成催化剂进展（特邀报告）","zb":"回顾了自铁氧化物用于哈伯-博施工艺以来，异相催化剂在温和条件下合成氨的进展、新催化剂特征及当前技术挑战。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02311656mtgabs","t":"(Invited) ALD and Joule Heating-Derived High-Entropy Nano-Alloys for Enhanced Water Electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02311656mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule","ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":21,"ab":"The control of crystal phase, composition, and morphology in multicomponent nanomaterials is a powerful strategy for introducing new, unique physicochemical properties, functionalities, and applications. This contribution details our recent advancements in the rapid non-equilibrium synthesis of functional high-entropy alloy nanocatalysts with enhanced performances in water electrolysis. Precursor noble metal thin layers were deposited sequentially by ALD. Joule heating was then applied in second-range timeframes, promoting atomic diffusion across the individual layers and supercooling kinetics to form homogeneous noble metal high-entropy alloy films. Optimizing precursor film thickness allows control over supercooling kinetics and induces explosive crystallization, forming a multiphasic sub-surface comprising nanocrystalline and amorphous domains through steeper thermal gradients, rapid ","au":["Kwan W. Tan"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat","ALD"],"zt":"(特邀) 原子层沉积和焦耳热衍生的高熵纳米合金用于增强水电解","zb":"通过原子层沉积（ALD）依次沉积前驱体贵金属薄膜，然后利用焦耳热促进原子扩散和过冷动力学，形成均匀的贵金属高熵合金薄膜。优化前驱体薄膜厚度可控制过冷动力学，诱导爆发式结晶，形成包含纳米晶体和非晶区的多相亚表面。所得贵金属高熵合金薄膜在水电解中表现出优异的析氢反应（HER）性能，低过电位（10 mA cm⁻²时为13–65 mV），低塔菲尔斜率（14–78 mV dec⁻¹）。此外，形成的非晶金属磷酸盐薄膜在碱性介质中表现出优异的析氧反应（OER）性能，低过电位（235 mV），低塔菲尔斜率（30–40 mV dec⁻¹），且在10 mA cm⁻²电流下稳定运行100小时。","ob":"析氢反应；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5798935","t":"Predicted the pyrolysis kinetic model of polyvinyl chloride insulation materials for aged wires under different Joule heating effects","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5798935","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:23:23Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["HuiFei Lyu","Yue Li","Caiping Wang","Weifeng Wang","Jun Deng","Yang Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"不同焦耳热效应对老化电线中聚氯乙烯绝缘材料的热解动力学模型的预测","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-0291061mtgabs","t":"Flash-Joule-Heating Carbon for Fiber Engineering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-0291061mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The upcycling of post-consumer plastic waste into high-value materials presents a compelling strategy for sustainable manufacturing. In this study, we demonstrate a scalable and cost-effective method for synthesizing graphene-like carbon from plastic waste using Alternating Current Flash Joule Heating (AC-FJH). The resulting carbonaceous material was incorporated into a polyacrylonitrile (PAN) matrix to fabricate composite fibers via a fiber-spinning process. Compared to pristine PAN fibers, the composite fibers exhibit enhanced structural integrity and improved performance. Comprehensive characterization, including tensile testing, Differential Scanning Calorimetry (DSC), Dynamic Mechanical Analysis (DMA), and X-ray Diffraction (XRD), was conducted to evaluate the mechanical, thermal, and structural impacts of the FJH-derived carbon. This work highlights a dual-benefit approach: reducin","au":["Varunkumar Thippanna","Sri Vaishnavi Thummalapalli"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"闪焦耳热碳用于纤维工程","zb":"利用交流闪焦耳热（AC-FJH）技术将废旧塑料转化为类石墨烯碳，并将其掺入聚丙烯腈（PAN）基体中，通过纤维纺丝工艺制备复合纤维。与原始PAN纤维相比，复合纤维的结构完整性和性能得到提升。通过拉伸测试、差示扫描量热法（DSC）、动态力学分析（DMA）和X射线衍射（XRD）等手段评估了FJH碳对机械、热和结构的影响。该方法实现了废旧塑料的回收利用，并生成了用于能源、航空航天和汽车工业的高性能碳纳米材料。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02663151mtgabs","t":"Diffusion-Steered Epitaxial Atomic Layer Deposition of Tellurium across Van Der Waals Heterointerfaces","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02663151mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Van der Waals (vdW) crystals and their vdW-coupled vertical assembly, often revealing unprecedented properties beyond conventional bulk materials, are certainly promising building blocks for next-generation solid-state devices in scientific and technological regime. These features give rise to further investigation and engineering of diverse vdW crystals as well as the representative mainstream such as transition metal dichalcogenides (TMDs), graphene, etc . As an example, elemental tellurium (Te), known as chiral vdW crystal, has recently garnered significant interest in both (opto-)electronics and spintronics communities because of its inherent chirality and superior carrier transport. To implement them into practical applications, it is crucial to develop damage-free growth and integration techniques in a scalable manner with preserved intrinsic characteristics and potential. However,","au":["Changhwan Kim","Hyeon Cho","Chuqiao Shi","Subin Im","Mingyu Jang","Wenxuan Zhu"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"扩散引导外延原子层沉积在范德华异质界面上的碲","zb":"采用扩散引导外延原子层沉积（Epi-ALD）技术在低温（150 °C）下在范德华表面模板上沉积碲（Te），显著提高了表面扩散率。该方法在9种以上范德华表面上通用，能够在Te和WSe₂之间形成约1.4 Å的清洁界面，同时保持外延关系和应变小于0.2%。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472419mtgabs","t":"Noble Metal Nanostructures via Atomic Layer Deposition Towards Electrocatalytic Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472419mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Platinum group metals such as Pt, Ru, Pd, Ir, etc., have demonstrated superior performance for various catalytic and electrocatalytic applications [1]. Due to their scarcity, efforts have been made to reduce the mass loading while keeping or even enhancing their catalytic activity [2]. Atomic Layer Deposition (ALD) is one of the most effective techniques to facilitate lowering the loading mass on a support of interest [3,4]. Besides, ALD is a well-suited technology for decorating high aspect ratio and high surface area substrate architectures using noble metal nanoparticles [5]. Due to the governing surface energy variations between noble metals and support surfaces, the growth initiates as single atoms. As deposition continues, these atoms coalesce into nanocluster. With further ALD cycles, these nanoclusters grow into nanoparticles (NPs), As the cycle count increases, NP agglomeration ","au":["Jhonatan Rodriguez Pereira","Raul Zazpe","Jan M. Macak"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积制备贵金属纳米结构用于电催化应用","zb":"利用原子层沉积（ALD）技术在碳纸（CP）和二氧化钛纳米管（TNT）基底上制备贵金属纳米结构。ALD技术能够实现低负载量的均匀装饰，促进电催化性能。研究介绍了不同贵金属纳米结构的合成、物理和电化学表征，以及电催化应用中的积极结果。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料、原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02311646mtgabs","t":"Atomic Layer Deposition of Molybdenum Oxide for Interface-Stabilized Single-Crystal NMC","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02311646mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Next-generation lithium-ion batteries demand cathode materials that not only deliver high energy density but also maintain electrochemical reversibility over prolonged cycling. Among the various cathode candidates, single-crystalline lithium nickel manganese cobalt oxide (SC-NMC) has emerged as a promising material due to its superior structural integrity and resistance to grain boundary-related degradation compared to polycrystalline NMC (PC-NMC). However, despite the enhanced bulk stability of SC-NMC, it remains susceptible to surface degradation, particularly under high-voltage conditions. These surface-related issues primarily stem from parasitic side reactions between the active material and the liquid electrolyte, resulting in the formation of an unstable and resistive cathode–electrolyte interphase (CEI) layer. This non-uniform CEI hinders lithium-ion transport, induces localized ","au":["Wooseong Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积氧化钼用于界面稳定的单晶 NMC","zb":"研究对象为单晶锂镍锰钴氧化物（SC-NMC）的表面工程。采用粉末基原子层沉积（Powder-ALD）技术，在SC-NMC表面形成一层致密的纳米级氧化钼（MoOₓ）保护层。该方法利用了MoOₓ的高电子和锂离子电导率，以及优异的电化学和化学稳定性，有效抑制了表面副反应和界面降解，提升了SC-NMC的循环稳定性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02311635mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Atomic Layer Deposition for Highly Durable Hydrogen Fuel Cells: From Catalyst to Cell","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02311635mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The widespread application of hydrogen fuel cells relies heavily on high performance oxygen reduction reaction catalysts. When facing with complex and harsh operational conditions, traditional Pt-based catalysts always surfer from serious electrochemical corrosion or poisoning of sulfonic acid groups at the catalyst or cell level. Previous approaches developed to mitigate unsaturated site dissolution in Pt-based hydrogen fuel cell electrocatalysts often lead to dealloying and reduced electrochemically active areas. In this talk, a series of highly stable Pt-based alloy catalysts are prepared by ultrathin metal oxide coating and post-annealing process, which could avoid the agglomeration of catalyst particles caused by high ordering temperature. A sub-surface interstitial doping strategy is proposed to effectively modulate local lattice strain and the electronic structures of unstable sur","au":["Xiao Liu","Hang Liu","Yuxin Gao","Rong Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积用于高耐久性氢燃料电池：从催化剂到电池","zb":"研究对象为使用原子层沉积（ALD）制备高耐久性Pt基合金催化剂用于氢燃料电池。关键方法是利用超薄金属氧化物涂层和退火处理制备Pt基合金催化剂，以及通过ALD进行亚表面间隙掺杂。主要结果包括通过B原子亚表面间隙掺杂显著提高Pt和Pt合金纳米颗粒的溶解抗性，以及通过原位实验和理论计算揭示B原子引起的非对称拉伸应变减弱了氧物种的吸附，从而提高了电催化耐久性。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02311634mtgabs","t":"Precious Metals Atomic Layer Deposited MXene Advanced Heterostructures for Clean Energy and Healthcare Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02311634mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The economic ramifications associated with the utilization of noble metals/precious metals such as Pt, Pd, Ir, Rh, and Ru are significant, as they are not only costly but also relatively scarce, with Ir being especially limited, given that its natural occurrence is estimated to be roughly one-tenth that of Pt and Ru, rendering its availability a crucial element in industrial electrocatalysis and sensing applications. In this regard, atomic layer deposition (ALD) emerges as a cutting-edge precision thin film technique that is increasingly recommended for industrial applications, as it provides atomic-level control over the deposition of even the rarest noble metals Ir, allowing for the placement of single metal atoms or clusters through a self-limiting growth process. We attempt to introduce a pragmatic approach towards the utilization of Ir precious metal, employing the ALD technique on ","au":["Debananda Mohapatra","Yeseul Son","Chaehyun Park","Soo-Hyun Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"沉积的贵金属MXene先进异质结构用于清洁能源和医疗保健应用","zb":"研究对象为使用原子层沉积（ALD）在MXene上沉积贵金属（Ir）制备先进异质结构。关键方法是利用ALD技术实现Ir原子或团簇的单原子级控制沉积。主要结果包括通过控制Ir-ALD循环数显著提高电催化活性和传感灵敏度，以及观察到单原子或团簇形式的Ir显著增强表面催化和传感活性。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02311632mtgabs","t":"Plasma-Enhanced Atomic Layer Deposition of Niobium Disulfide Films for Hydrogen Evolution Reaction Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02311632mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Two-dimensional transition metal disulfides (2D-TMDs) have attracted significant research interest as potential replacements for noble metal electrocatalysts for the hydrogen evolution reaction [1]. Among these materials, the metallic compound NbS 2 has more recently emerged as a promising candidate due to its high conductivity and catalytically active basal plane sites, which contribute to low overpotentials and high efficiency [2]. Several methods have been used to prepare NbS 2 electrodes, including coating exfoliated nanoflakes on support materials, solvothermal synthesis and chemical vapor deposition, but these approaches have significant drawbacks relating to scalability, consistency, and device integration [1]. In contrast, atomic layer deposition (ALD) can produce films with good adhesion, tunable materials properties, and conformal coating of porous and architectured substrates,","au":["Douglas Heine","Ageeth Anke Bol"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"等离子体增强原子层沉积NbS2薄膜用于析氢反应电催化","zb":"研究对象为使用等离子体增强原子层沉积（PEALD）制备NbS2薄膜用于析氢反应（HER）电催化。关键方法是使用有机金属Nb前驱体和H2S/H2等离子体反应剂。主要结果包括通过调整ALD工艺参数和退火处理控制薄膜组成和微观结构，以及通过改变H2S/H2比例和沉积温度调控Nb/S比和薄膜结晶性。","ob":"析氢反应；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02311606mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Area-Selective Atomic-Molecular Layer Deposition of Photoluminescent Europium-Organic Thin Films on Graphene Activated by Direct Laser Writing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02311606mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Area-selective atomic layer deposition (AS-ALD) is a promising technique for advanced nanofabrication processes. This allows for the simple bottom-up creation of intricate nanostructures essential for advanced optoelectronic and sensor applications. 1 Due to the flexibility of ALD, the method can be used alongside its organic counterpart, molecular layer deposition (MLD). 2 The combined atomic/molecular layer deposition (ALD/MLD) enables tuning of material properties by incorporating organic linkers into the film while maintaining the nanoscale control. 3 Area-selective ALD and MLD separately have been demonstrated previously, but these processes typically rely on utilization of inhibitors and lithography steps to achieve the area-selectivity, which complicates the process. 4,5 While there are examples of AS-ALD being used on two-dimensional materials (2DM), AS-MLD on them is still mostl","au":["Mika Pettersson","Aleksei Emelianov","Kamila Mentel","Amr Ghazy","Joona Pekkanen","Yu-Han Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"直接激光写入激活的石墨烯上Eu-有机薄膜的区域选择性原子/分子层沉积","zb":"研究对象为在直接激光写入激活的石墨烯上进行区域选择性原子/分子层沉积（AS-ALD/MLD）制备Eu-有机薄膜。关键方法是利用直接飞秒激光两光子氧化（TPO）激活石墨烯表面。主要结果包括实现了高达11 nm厚度的薄膜沉积，并观察到宽化的光致发光特性。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02311605mtgabs","t":"Area Selective Atomic Layer Deposition of Ruthenium on SiO 2 and W","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02311605mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Introduction Large-Scale Integrations (LSIs) have been improved performance through the development of scaling technology, and further technological development is required for miniaturization in the future. Cu is currently used as the interconnect layer of LSIs. In general, an additional barrier layer such as titanium nitride or tantalum nitride is required to avoid the Cu diffusion, and then, the interconnect resistance gradually increases as miniaturization of LSIs proceeds [1] because of the high resistivity of barrier material. From the above, Ru is attractive interconnect material since it has low resistance at nanoscale region and does not need the barrier metals in different to Cu [1]. Furthermore, the number of lithography steps can be reduced by applying ASALD (Area Selective Atomic Layer Deposition), leading to cost saving [2]. This is a promising approach for bottom-up patter","au":["Shogo Okugawa","Rahman Gagi","Ryo Yokogawa","Yoshiteru Amemiya","Akinobu Teramoto"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"在SiO2和W上区域选择性原子层沉积Ru","zb":"研究对象为在SiO2和W表面进行区域选择性原子层沉积（AS-ALD）制备Ru薄膜。关键方法是使用抑制剂在W表面促进Ru沉积，在SiO2表面抑制Ru沉积。主要结果包括通过X射线荧光测量Ru厚度，以及在不同图案化衬底上验证了选择性生长。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02311602mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Area Selective ALD: Looking Back and Looking Forward","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02311602mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The continued downscaling of electronic device dimensions requires the development of new, precise patterning methods that are compatible with high-volume manufacturing. Area selective atomic layer deposition (AS-ALD) continues to gain attention as an important method to achieve nanoscale features at the sub-10 nm length scale. It is known that tuning the surface chemistry of the substrate can be used to either inhibit or enhance ALD nucleation, leading to selective deposition. Since the initial introduction of AS-ALD 20 years ago, a key strategy has been the use of inhibitors, ranging from long-chain self-assembled monolayers to small molecule inhibitors, which can alter the native surface reactivity to block nucleation. This inhibition approach enables good selectivity in AS-ALD of thin films on a variety of substrate materials, including dielectrics and metals, and is in use today. I ","au":["Stacey F. Bent"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"区域选择性原子层沉积：回顾与展望","zb":"研究对象为区域选择性原子层沉积（AS-ALD）技术。关键方法是利用抑制剂调节基板表面化学性质以控制ALD成核。主要结果包括使用长链自组装单分子层到小分子抑制剂等策略实现高选择性沉积，以及通过调整前驱体尺寸和种类优化抑制剂效果。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.202501337","t":"Efficient Fe‐Based Catalysts Prepared by Atomic Layer Deposition for CO 2 Hydrogenation to Higher Hydrocarbons","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.202501337","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract In this work, atomic layer deposition (ALD) of Fe is applied for the first time to prepare YZrO x ‐supported catalysts for CO 2 Fischer–Tropsch synthesis (CO 2 ‐FTS). The ALD catalysts promoted via physical mixing with K 2 CO 3 clearly outperformed a catalyst of the same K‐Fe loading but prepared via incipient wetness impregnation (IWI) by achieving higher CO 2 conversion and lower CH 4 selectivity. The best K‐promoted ALD catalyst achieved similar C 2+ ‐hydrocarbon and C 2 ‐C 4 olefin yield and suppression of CH 4 formation as state‐of‐the‐art bulk Fe‐based catalysts, despite its significantly lower Fe content. Spatially resolved characterization of spent catalysts revealed that the superior performance of the K‐promoted ALD catalysts is linked to a higher Fe 5 C 2 content and an improved spatial distribution of Fe 5 C 2 along the catalyst bed. The enhanced formation/stabilizat","au":["Elizaveta A. Fedorova","Laura Krausser","Fionn Collins","Christoph Kubis","Angelika Brückner","Nicola Pinna"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积制备的高效Fe‐基于催化剂用于CO 2 加氢制取更高碳数的烃类","zb":"采用原子层沉积（ALD）制备了YZrO x ‐负载的Fe催化剂用于CO 2 催化加氢制取更高碳数的烃类。与浸渍法（IWI）制备的催化剂相比，通过物理混合K 2 CO 3 推动的ALD催化剂实现了更高的CO 2 转化率和更低的CH 4 选择性。最佳K促进ALD催化剂在Fe含量显著较低的情况下，实现了与最先进块状Fe‐基于催化剂相似的C 2+ ‐烃类和C 2 ‐C 4 烯烃产率，并抑制了CH 4 的形成。空间分辨表征显示，K促进ALD催化剂的优异性能与其更高的Fe 5 C 2 含量和沿催化剂床的Fe 5 C 2 空间分布改善有关。ALD催化剂中Fe 5 C 2的形成/稳定和分布增强可能与Fe物种形貌的差异有关，这可能更显著地与K 2 CO 3 相互作用。此外，原位DRIFTS测量揭示了IWI和ALD催化剂表面的不同中间体，可能参与了CH 4 和更高碳数烃类的形成。提出ALD是制备高效负载Fe‐","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02401945mtgabs","t":"High-Temperature Anion-Exchange Membranes for High-Performance Fuel Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02401945mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Since the first Anion-Exchange Membrane (AEM) Fuel Cell (AEMFC) with practical performance was announced about a decade ago 1 , significant advances have been achieved in this field of research. In the past few years of intensive research on AEMFCs, remarkable progress has been reported, such as new highly stable functional groups for advanced AEMs 2-5 and highly active PGM-free catalysts 6-8 . At the cell level, new AEMFCs based on CRM-free catalysts were successfully demonstrated 9 , AEMFC’s lifetime of 5,000-15,000 hours was theoretically demonstrated for the first time 10-11 , and a cell lifetime of 2,000 hours was experimentally proven 12 . Altogether, the research community has made very impressive progress in such a short time. However, many challenges still need to be overcome to achieve AEMFCs of industrial interest. Among them, AEM degradation and AEMFC performance stability ar","au":["Dario R Dekel"],"o":"回填","zb":"研究团队开发了可在100℃以上运行的高温阴离子交换膜燃料电池。该系统使用无贵金属催化剂，实现了接近300 mS/cm的离子电导率和2000小时的运行稳定性，显著提升了燃料电池性能。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c06842","t":"Unraveling the Dual Dependence of Surface and NH 3 Concentration on Cobalt-Catalyzed Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c06842","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Ammonia decomposition offers a promising route to carbon-free hydrogen, yet its activity is highly sensitive to both surface structure and NH 3 concentration. This dual dependence makes it challenging to design catalysts that remain high efficiency throughout the entire process. Here, we systematically evaluate all potential exposed surfaces and establish an atomistic framework for linking structure–activity relationships across varying reaction stages on cobalt, a widely used ammonia decomposition catalyst. A clear surface-dependent reactivity is identified, with stepped HCP Co(10–10) and FCC Co(110) being the most active, and Co(10–10) consistently outperforming others, indicating that enriching this surface can enhance overall performance. Mechanistically, surface sensitivity is primarily attributed to variations in the d -band center, which correlates linearly with activity. Furtherm","au":["Chunyao Fang","Zheng Li","Zhanzhao Fu","Yuting Zhou","Hao Zhang","Sihang Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"揭示表面和 NH 3 浓度对钴催化氨分解的双重依赖","zb":"研究对象为钴催化氨分解，采用系统评估所有潜在暴露表面和建立原子框架的方法，揭示表面依赖性反应活性，发现 stepped HCP Co(10–10) 和 FCC Co(110) 最活跃，Co(10–10) 持续表现最佳，表明丰富该表面可提高整体性能。机理上，表面敏感性主要归因于 d-带中心的差异，与活性呈线性相关。此外，提出了 Arrhenius 斜率（−1/ RT ）的一般标准，揭示 NH 3 浓度依赖性源于速率限制步骤的转移，随着 NH 3 浓度增加，从 N–N 耦合转变为其他步骤。","ob":"氨分解制氢","top":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5799087","t":"Sustainable ammonia synthesis coupled with cellulose valorization over oxygen vacancy-enrich MoO3-x photocatalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5799087","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zi-Yi Wang","Yun-Hui Hu","Bing-Yu Gao","Xu Han","Ji-Ping Tang","Yongjun Yuan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"可持续氨合成与纤维素高值化耦合：氧空位富集MoO3-x光催化剂","ob":"光驱动","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02663137mtgabs","t":"Developing Tandem-Cell System for Green Ammonia Production by Integrating a Plasma Reactor for Activating Nitrogen with an Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction System","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02663137mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia has recently attracted attention as a promising renewable energy carrier due to its carbon-free nature and high energy density of 4.3 kW h kg ⁻¹ . However, the Haber-Bosch process, a traditional industrial ammonia synthesis process, requires a high temperature of 400–500°C and a high pressure of 100–200 atm, resulting in significant energy consumption and greenhouse gas emissions. As an alternative to this, electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) is evaluated as a promising approach. Nevertheless, NRR faces challenges, such as low reaction efficiency due to the poor solubility and reactivity of nitrogen, along with competition from the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). In this study, a tandem system was developed by integrating a plasma reactor capable of activating nitrogen with an electrochemical reduction system to enhance nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) efficienc","au":["Junbeom Maeng","Jaehyeon Heo","Won Bae Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"开发串联电池系统用于通过集成等离子体反应器激活氮与电化学硝酸盐还原系统绿色制备氨","zb":"研究对象为串联电池系统，关键方法是等离子体激活氮和电化学硝酸盐还原，主要结果是实现了两步法氨的制备，第一步等离子体激活氮，第二步电化学还原硝酸盐，表现出优异的反应稳定性。","ob":"等离子体制氨；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02542605mtgabs","t":"Rational Design of Dual-Atom Electrocatalysts for Ammonia Synthesis with Improved Selectivity","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02542605mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) holds significant promise for sustainable ammonia production; however, it remains limited by challenges in efficient N₂ activation and selective NH₃ formation. Designing an optimal electrocatalyst is essential to address these limitations—it must effectively promote N₂ adsorption, activation, and hydrogenation while simultaneously suppressing the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). In this study, we hypothesize that strategic engineering of dual-atom catalysts (DACs), where one metal center is optimized for N₂ anchoring and the other for hydrogen adsorption, can enhance both NRR activity and selectivity. We investigate a series of DACs supported on a graphene substrate, systematically screening 3d and 4d transition metal pairs (46 combinations in total). The adsorption free energies of key intermediates involved in ammonia f","au":["Satheesh Mani","Mahbub Islam"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"双原子电催化剂的合理设计用于提高氨合成选择性","zb":"研究对象为双原子催化剂，关键方法是理论计算和电化学表征，主要结果是筛选出Mn-Fe、Co-Mn和Co-Fe对，并提出了NNH*形成是决定性步骤的机理。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02532538mtgabs","t":"Design and Synthesis of Multi-Metallic Nanocatalytic Materials for the Direct Reduction of Nitrogen Molecules Toward Ammonia in Acidic and Alkaline Media","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02532538mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The Nitrogen Reduction Reaction (NRR) utilizes ambient conditions and electrocatalysts as a potential alternative to the Haber-Bosch process for ammonia production. NRR, however, often results in low faradaic efficiency and NH 3 yield because of: (1) slow kinetics due to the high-energy triple bond and a high frontier orbital gap, and (2) being outcompeted by the more kinetically favorable Hydrogen Evolution Reaction (HER). These barriers could be overcome by designing more selective catalysts for nitrogen reduction than hydrogen evolution. Cyanometallate catalysts containing transition metals (i.e. Ag, Fe Co, Mn, Cu, and Mo) were designed and synthesized through pyrolysis at 500 °C under an inert atmosphere. The morphology and composition of the catalysts were determined through scanning electron microscopy (SEM) and transmission electron microscopy (TEM). The stability and durability o","au":["Justyna Widera-Kalinowska","Selin Aptoula","Krzysztof Miecznikowski"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"多金属纳米催化材料的制备及其在酸性和碱性介质中直接还原氮分子制备氨","zb":"研究对象为氰基金属酸盐催化剂，关键方法是热解制备和电化学表征，主要结果是在酸性或碱性介质中实现了氨的制备，其中1:3 AgFeCo(CN)6在1小时内的氨产率为21.46 ug。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02532536mtgabs","t":"Metal Sulfide Catalysts for Selective Ammonia Production via Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02532536mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Backgrounds: Ammonia, with an annual global production of approximately 180 million tons, is one of the most essential chemical compounds, widely utilized in the fertilizer industry and various branches of the chemical industry. Ammonia has emerged as a hydrogen carrier for carbon-free energy, due to its high energy density (17.8 wt%) and ease of storage and transport (boiling point = –33.3 °C). To accommodate increasing global demand, over 90% of ammonia is currently synthesized through the Haber–Bosch process. This process relies on extreme reaction conditions—pressures of 150–300 atm and temperatures of 400–500 °C—using an iron-based catalyst to activate the strong triple bond of nitrogen (N≡N). Operating under such extreme conditions consumes nearly 2% of the global energy supply. Furthermore, as hydrogen feedstock is predominantly produced through steam methane reforming, the proces","au":["Jihyun Choi","Chaeyeon Yang","Suji Lee","Yung-Eun Sung","Hyun S. Park"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"金属硫化物催化剂用于选择性电化学氮还原制备氨","zb":"研究对象为金属硫化物催化剂，关键方法是电化学氮还原反应，主要结果是在温和条件下实现了氨的选择性制备。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472343mtgabs","t":"(Invited) A Chemometric Approach Aimed at Tuning Electrolyte Composition for Lithium-Mediated Ammonia Electrosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472343mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Lithium-mediated approach for NH 3 electrosynthesis is recently gaining interest as a delocalized and more sustainable process to reduce nitrogen into ammonia, complementary to the massive-emitting Haber-Bosch process. NH 3 production exceeds 450 million tons per year, following the increasing fertilizer demand, and it is intrinsically dependent on fossil fuels, as it requires a highly pure hydrogen feed obtained from steam reforming. 1 In the lithium-mediated system, Li + are electroplated in an aprotic medium on a metallic surface, and on the obtained metallic lithium, N 2 is activated and protonated into NH 3 thanks to the presence of a proton donor, usually ethanol. Up to date, this system enabled the highest performances in the field, reaching 300 h of continuous operation with a FE as high as 64%. 2 On the electro-plated lithium, a solid electrolyte interphase (SEI) layer is unavoi","au":["Federico Bella","Anna Mangini","Jon Mygind","Sara Garcia Ballesteros","Alessandro Pedico","Marco Armandi"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"旨在调整电解质组成的化学计量方法用于锂介导的氨电合成","zb":"研究对象为锂介导的氨电合成体系，关键方法为使用 Doehlert 实验设计结合响应面方法优化乙醇和锂盐浓度，并研究新提出的锂盐——二氟草酸硼酸盐。主要结果为通过 9 次实验优化了电解质组成，并研究了 SEI 层组成对性能的影响。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472341mtgabs","t":"Ketjenblack-Supported and Unsupported ZrO 2 -Zrn Nanoparticle Systems for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrogen Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472341mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Artificial N 2 fixation via the electrocatalytic nitrogen (N 2 ) reduction reaction (NRR) has been recently promoted as a rational route towards reducing energy consumption and CO 2 emission as compared with the traditional Haber-Bosch process. Nevertheless, optimizing NRR relies on developing highly efficient electrocatalysts. Herein, we report on the reliable and reproducible synthesis of two promising electrocatalysts in either the presence or absence of Ketjenblack (KB), respectively, namely ZrO 2 -ZrN@KB and ZrO 2 -ZrN systems, synthesized through the nitriding of Zr. Both materials had never previously been considered for NRR, to the best of our knowledge. Nevertheless, both of these electrocatalysts incorporated a combination of tetragonal ZrO 2 , ZrON, and cubic ZrN and showed excellent activity and durability towards NH 3 formation. Moreover, the maximum NH 3 production rate of ","au":["Mitu Sharma","Kotaro Sasaki","Stanislaus S Wong"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"Ketjenblack-负载和未负载的 ZrO 2 -Zrn 纳米粒子体系用于高效的电化学氮还原制氨","zb":"研究对象为 ZrO 2 -ZrN@KB 和 ZrO 2 -ZrN 两种电催化剂，通过氮化 Zr 合成，分别负载和未负载 Ketjenblack。关键方法为通过氮化 Zr 合成电催化剂，并使用电化学方法进行表征。主要结果为两种电催化剂均表现出优异的活性和耐久性，ZrO 2 -ZrN 电催化剂在 -0.7 V vs. RHE 下实现 84.1 μg h −1 mg −1 的 NH 3 产率，在 -0.6 V vs RHE 下 Faradic 效率为 21.2 %。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472338mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Using Genetically Engineered Cyanobacteria for Photoelectrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472338mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Cyanobacteria have the machinery to convert light into energy, but they have a limited amount of natural chemistry that can be catalyzed with this energy. This talk will discuss the genetic modification of cyanobacteria to both efficiently deliver electrons from an electrode to the internal components of the cyanobacteria and genetic modification of cyanobacteria to express non-natural chemistry for nitrogen reduction. This talk will also summarize the advantages and disadvantages of this biophotoelectrocatalytic strategy for nitrogen reduction in comparison to other electrocatalytic systems.","au":["Shelley D. Minteer"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction"],"zt":"（特邀）利用基因工程改造的蓝细菌进行光电催化氮还原","zb":"讨论了基因工程改造蓝细菌以高效向其内部组件传递电子以及表达非天然氮还原化学，并总结了该生物光电催化策略与其他电催化系统的优缺点。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472337mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Carbon-Supported Non-Precious Metal Electrocatalysts for Alkaline Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472337mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Alkaline electrolysis allows for the use of non-precious metals as electrocatalysts in both hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) and oxygen evolution reaction (OER) during water splitting. Also, ammonium ions could migrate through polymer electrolyte membrane (PEM) in acidic or neutral electrolyte. Therefore, our effort is dedicated to the development of non-precious metal-carbon electrocatalysts for ammonia synthesis and water splitting in alkaline electrolytes. We incorporated the electrocatalysts into flow cells or membrane electrode assembly (MEA) for continuous production.","au":["Nianqiang Wu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"碳载非贵金属电催化剂用于碱性氨合成","zb":"研究对象为非贵金属-碳电催化剂，用于碱性电解质中的氨合成和水分解。关键方法为将电催化剂集成到流电池或膜电极组件（MEA）中进行连续生产。主要结果为开发出非贵金属-碳电催化剂，用于碱性电解质中的氨合成和水分解。","ob":"涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472329mtgabs","t":"Insights into the Role of Spinel Structure and Electrode Kinetics in Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472329mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3","joule"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH₃) is the second highest-produced chemical by mass after sulfuric acid.¹,² It is widely used in fertilizers, refrigerants, explosives, textiles, and pharmaceuticals, with growing importance as a green energy carrier and fuel. Commercial ammonia production relies on the thermocatalytic Haber-Bosch process, developed in the early 20th century, which accounts for 1.8% of global energy consumption and emits 0.5 gigatons of CO₂ annually, accounting for 1% of global CO₂ emissions and 15-20% of the chemical sector. Moreover, the rise of processed food and fertilizer industries has disrupted the global nitrogen cycle, causing nitrate accumulation in groundwater and water bodies leading to eutrophication, oxygen depletion, and dead zones.³,⁴ Ammonia electrosynthesis from nitrites under ambient conditions offers a sustainable alternative to simultaneously reduce CO₂ emissions and addres","au":["Kamala Kanta Nanda","Nidia Soledad Recuay Arana","Jessenia Brillit Villaverde Herrera","Rafael Alonso Pulido Del Pino","Jesús Valdiviezo"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"对尖晶石结构和电极动力学在电化学硝酸盐还原为氨中的作用洞察","zb":"研究对象为氨（NH₃）的合成，采用电化学方法将硝酸盐还原为氨。研究铜基催化剂在硝酸盐还原反应（NO₃RR）中的高效性，以及合金和尖晶石氧化物电催化剂的合成。探讨尖晶石结构在NO₃RR中的作用，以及电极动力学对氨合成的Faradaic效率（FE）的影响。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472324mtgabs","t":"Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction for Green Ammonia Production: Insights into Real Water Composition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472324mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3","joule"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia, historically essential as a fertilizer, is now emerging as a carbon-free energy carrier due to its high hydrogen content and sustainable energy potential. 1 However, current NH₃ production relies heavily on the energy-intensive and fossil fuel-dependent Haber-Bosch process. Thus, to meet future NH 3 demand sustainably, the development of innovative green synthesis techniques is essential. 2 On the other hand, nitrates (NO 3 - ), due to their high solubility, represent one of the most widespread pollutants in groundwaters. 3 Increasing NO 3 - concentration in water sources constitutes significant environmental concerns and a serious risk to human health, highlighting the urgent need for the development of novel and efficient removal techniques. 4 In this context, the electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (E-NO 3 RR) has gained significant attention as it allows the use of re","au":["Sara Garcia Ballesteros","Lapo Mastrandrea","Lorenzo Sibella","Noemi Pirrone","Anna Mangini","Federico Bella"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"电化学硝酸盐还原用于绿色氨生产：对实际水组成的洞察","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原反应，关键方法为使用钼二硫化物（MoS2）催化剂在流动电池中进行实验，评估实际水体中常见元素对MoS2催化剂性能的影响，通过气扩散电极固定催化剂，分析不同元素对氨合成的选择性影响。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472323mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Electrochemical Ammonia Synthesis from Nitrate-Contaminated Water","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472323mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Nitrate-contaminated water poses a health risk to humans and negatively impacts the ecosystem through eutrophication. While traditional nitrate-removal methods seek to convert the reactive nitrogen species to inert dinitrogen, we propose to valorize nitrate by electrochemically reducing it to ammonia. Ammonia can be used as a fertilizer, chemical precursor, or alternative fuel. Electrochemical methods of water treatment can be implemented in both urban and rural settings because they are modular and can be operated at small through large scales, can be run at ambient temperature and pressure, and can use any source of electricity for power. Here we investigate the impact of ions typically found in groundwater (e.g., calcium, chloride, etc.) on the electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia. In situ attenuated total reflectance–surface-enhanced infrared adsorption spectroscopy (ATR–S","au":["Elizabeth R. Corson","Apoorva M. Ranjekar","Mohammad Abazid"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"从硝酸盐污染水中电化学合成氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐污染水，采用电化学方法将其中的硝酸盐还原为氨。使用原位衰减全反射-表面增强红外吸收光谱（ATR-SEIRAS）和原位表面增强拉曼光谱（SERS）技术研究水污染物对吸附反应物和反应中间体的影响，以及表面失活机制。通过气相色谱（GC）和核磁共振（NMR）分析产物，测量氨合成的选择性和效率，以确定防止阴极失活的策略，如操作条件和催化剂表面改性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472321mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Metal Oxides as Electrocatalysts for Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472321mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Exploring efficient and durable electrocatalysts under industrial-level current densities is highly desirable for nitrate reduction to ammonia; however, it remains a significant challenge. Herein, we propose Ce-substituted Co 3 O 4 supported on nitrogen-doped carbon that achieves a remarkable NH 3 production rate of 230 mg h -1 mg cat -1 with a FE of 95%, as well as long-term stability of 30 h at a high current density of 1.0 A cm -2 ,superior to previously reported values. In situ spectroscopic and theoretical calculation results reveal that the high electronegativity of Ce triggers the electron redistribution in Co 3 O 4 through the Ce-O-Co network, which boosts surface reconstruction. Such rapid reconstruction leads to the formation of a thin amorphous Co(OH) 2 layer, optimizing the generation of H * towards superior ammonia yields. Moreover, the Ce-O unit plays a protective role unde","au":["Minhua Shao","Yan Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"金属氧化物作为电催化剂用于硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"在工业级电流密度下探索高效和耐用的电催化剂，对于硝酸盐还原为氨非常重要；然而，这仍然是一个重大挑战。本研究提出了一种Ce掺杂的Co3O4负载在氮掺杂碳上的催化剂，实现了230 mg h-1 mg cat-1的氨生产速率和95%的法拉第效率，以及在高电流密度1.0 A cm-2下30小时的长期稳定性，优于之前报道的值。原位光谱和理论计算结果表明，Ce的高电负性通过Ce-O-Co网络触发Co3O4中的电子重新分布，从而促进表面重构。这种快速重构导致形成一层薄的非晶态Co(OH)2层，优化了H*的产生，从而获得了更高的氨产量。此外，Ce-O单元在高电流下起保护作用，将重构限制在表面。这项研究为控制尖晶石催化剂在NO3RR过程中的表面重构提供了一种有效策略。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02303534mtgabs","t":"3D Graphene Foam Functionalized with a Metal-Organic Framework for Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02303534mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction offers a sustainable, electricity-driven route to convert nitrate into ammonia, simultaneously removing a pollutant and producing a valuable product for a circular nitrogen economy. However, most catalysts face challenges with selectivity, high cost, and low stability. We present a hierarchical three-dimensional electrode that combines a porous copper foam scaffold, a conductive graphene interlayer, and a metal-organic framework (MOF) coating to enable efficient and selective nitrate-to-ammonia conversion under ambient conditions. The copper foam provides high surface area and conductivity, graphene lowers charge-transfer resistance and enhances durability, and MOF metal sites accelerate multi-electron transfer toward ammonia. Electrochemical studies show that the integrated Cu/Gr/MOF electrode achieves higher current densities, lower onset potential, an","au":["Shahriar Namvar","Mehran Arzani","Kartikey Sharma","Vikas Berry"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"功能化金属有机框架的3D石墨烯泡沫用于电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原提供了一种可持续、电力驱动的路线，将硝酸盐转化为氨，同时去除污染物并生产对循环氮经济有价值的产物。然而，大多数催化剂面临选择性、高成本和低稳定性问题。本研究提出了一种分级的3D电极，结合了多孔铜泡沫支架、导电石墨烯中间层和金属有机框架（MOF）涂层，以在环境条件下实现高效的硝酸盐到氨的转化。铜泡沫提供高表面积和导电性，石墨烯降低电荷转移电阻并增强耐久性，MOF金属位点加速向氨的多电子转移。电化学研究表明，集成的Cu/Gr/MOF电极实现了比裸露或石墨烯涂层的铜更高的电流密度、更低的起始电位和氨产量的三倍增加。该架构由低成本、地球丰产的材料组成，为实际硝酸盐到氨的电催化提供了有前景的方向。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02291550mtgabs","t":"Molecular Dynamics Investigation of Solvation Structures in Localized High-Concentration Electrolytes for Enhanced Li-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02291550mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is a critical industrial chemical and potential carbon-neutral energy carrier, yet its conventional ammonia production via the Haber-Bosch process requires harsh conditions (400-500°C, up to 200 bar) and generates significant carbon emissions. The lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) has emerged as a promising alternative for sustainable ammonia synthesis at ambient conditions. However, Li-NRR efficiency is limited by electrolyte design challenges, as traditional electrolytes either suffer from poor selectivity (low-concentration electrolytes, LCE) or face issues with high viscosity and cost (high-concentration electrolytes, HCE). To improve the efficiency of Li-NRR, we first introduce a localized high-concentration electrolyte (LHCE) that enables the formation of anion-derived SEI. This study employs experimental and computational approaches to elucidate the sup","au":["Minjun Kwon","Hyeju Yun","Chaeeun Lim","Dongmin Lee","Yongju Yun","Kijung Yong"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"局部高浓度电解质中溶剂化结构的分子动力学研究以增强锂介导的氮还原","zb":"氨是关键工业化学品和潜在的碳中和能源载体，但其传统的哈伯-博施制氨过程需要在严苛条件（400-500°C，高达200 bar）下进行并产生大量碳排放。锂介导的氮还原反应（Li-NRR）已成为在环境条件下可持续制氨的替代方案。然而，Li-NRR效率受电解质设计挑战的限制，因为传统电解质要么选择性差（低浓度电解质，LCE），要么面临高粘度和成本问题（高浓度电解质，HCE）。本研究采用实验和计算方法，阐明了局部高浓度电解质（LHCE）在Li-NRR中氨合成的优越性能。分子动力学模拟全面分析了LCE、HCE和LHCE系统中的溶剂化结构。计算结果表明，LHCE在锂配位层中具有最高的阴离子与溶剂比率，尽管其盐浓度与LCE相同。实验上观察到，LHCE中计算确认的更高阴离子比率直接对应于比LCE和HCE系统更高的法拉第效率。光谱分析验证了预测的溶剂化结构，确认了计算模型的准确性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02281543mtgabs","t":"Electrochemical Ammonia Synthesis and Integrated Li Recovery from Brine","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02281543mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is a necessary fertilizer and chemical in industrial processes. However, the conventional Haber-Bosch process for ammonia synthesis consumes 1% of the world’s total energy production and accounts for 1.4% of global carbon dioxide emissions. Electrochemical Li-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) presents a favorable alternative because it allows for ammonia synthesis with a lower CO 2 footprint at mild conditions. Given the expensive cost of Li sources, recovering Li from abundant brine, and improving Li utilization in ammonia synthesis would improve its sustainability and efficiency. Herein, we have developed a new electrochemical strategy to achieve ammonia production and Li + recovery from brine using a Li-ion selective redox material. We choose λ-MnO 2 as the redox material and synthesize it by delithiating nanosized lithium manganese oxide. The λ-MnO 2 electrode can se","au":["Abayomi Awoyomi","Rui Wang","Fang Liu","Song Jin"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"从盐湖中电化学制氨和锂回收","zb":"氨是工业过程中必要的肥料和化学品。然而，传统的哈伯-博施制氨过程消耗了世界总能源生产的1%，并占全球二氧化碳排放的1.4%。本研究开发了一种新的电化学策略，使用锂离子选择性氧化还原材料从盐湖中实现氨生产和锂离子回收。选择λ-MnO2作为氧化还原材料，通过脱锂纳米级锂锰氧化物合成。λ-MnO2电极可以选择性地提取锂离子，并在盐湖中表现出优异的电化学稳定性，在Na+/Li+比例超过50的循环中具有高比率。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02281539mtgabs","t":"Sustainable, Electrified, and Decentralized Ammonia Synthesis from Diverse Nitrogen-Based Compounds","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02281539mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Green ammonia production via electrolysis using renewable and low-cost electrons is a promising pathway to compete with the traditional Haber-Bosch process. According to the U.S. Department of Energy (DOE) and National Renewable Energy Lab (NREL), the projected average levelized cost of energy (LCOE) could reach 0.03 $/kWh by 2030, a promising lower price point than fossil fuel-driven electricity generation. The nitrogen-containing compounds required for ammonia production can be sourced from various sources, including wastewater and exhaust gas, reinforcing the nitrogen circular economy. Various cell configurations, flow cells, and batch cells affect the electrochemical cell performance and efficiency. In addition to the choice of cell design, selecting the right proton donor, such as hydrogen, water, and water vapor, is crucial to achieve the highest cell energy efficiency. The economi","au":["Maryam Ahmadi","Mohammadreza (Reza) Nazemi"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"可持续、电气化和分散的多种含氮化合物制氨","zb":"通过使用可再生且低成本的电子进行电解，绿色氨的生产是与传统哈伯-博施工艺竞争的有前景的途径。氮基化合物可以来自废水、废气等多种来源，强化了氮循环经济。本研究探讨了使用多种氮源（废水中的硝酸盐和亚硝酸盐、废气中的氮氧化物和二氧化氮、空气中的氮气）进行氨生产的多种电化学途径，并通过选择阳极和阴极原料、电池配置、温度以及动态或静态运行来优化氨的平准化成本（LCOA）。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02251397mtgabs","t":"Optimizing Electrochemical Reactor Design for Unraveled and Efficient Lithium-Mediated Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02251397mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical synthesis of ammonia (NH 3 ) presents a promising avenue for sustainable industrial production, particularly via lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reactions (NRR). This study explores innovations in reactor architecture and electrode materials while focusing on process efficiency for NH 3 electrosynthesis. A major challenge in NRR lies in overcoming the strong nitrogen triple bond and suppressing the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER), which lowers the Faradaic efficiency (FE) of NH 3 production [1],[2] . The conventional Haber-Bosch process, while effective, operates at extreme conditions of temperature and pressure, consuming vast amounts of energy and emitting significant CO 2 . Electrochemical NH 3 synthesis, by contrast, offers a pathway to decentralized and sustainable production, particularly if renewable electricity is employed. However, the sluggis","au":["Serpil Kiokekli","Anel Zulji","Sandro Agostini","Stephan Paredes","Abhijit Dutta","Joël Keller"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"优化电化学反应器设计以揭示和高效锂介导的氨合成","zb":"研究对象为锂介导的氮还原反应（NRR）电化学合成氨，探索反应器架构和电极材料的创新，重点关注过程效率。主要挑战在于克服氮三键的强活性和抑制竞争的析氢反应（HER），以提高氨生产的法拉第效率（FE）。传统哈伯-博施工艺在极端温度和压力下运行，能耗高且排放 CO 2。电化学 NH 3 合成提供了一种分散化和可持续的生产途径，若使用可再生电力。初始实验使用镍作为工作电极（WE）、铂作为对电极（CE）和银作为参电极（RE），在含锂催化剂的电化学池中，氨产率低且电流不稳定。通过迭代反应器设计优化，包括工作电极（WE）表面积修改和集成了气泡器，将初始产率从 0.08% FE（-3.2 V Li 沉积电位）提高到 6.75% FE（-3.1V）。进一步，长期稳定性实验显示…","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02251396mtgabs","t":"Towards Practical Electrochemical Ammonia Production from Wastewater Nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02251396mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Recent research has shown a surge of interest in the electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction for ammonia synthesis. While catalyst development has advanced rapidly, a significant gap remains in understanding the complete system required to recover NH 3 from wastewater nitrate for real-world applications. Additionally, there is no consensus on the practical reaction conditions that should be used to assess the fundamental catalytic performance, including the electrolyte composition and nitrate concentration. In our recent work, we first report a three-chamber solid electrolyte reactor design, and couple this with cation shielding effects for efficient nitrate reduction reaction without supporting electrolytes. By flowing treated nitrate-containing water from the cathode chamber to the middle solid electrolyte layer, we can realize a cation shuttling from the middle layer back into the ","au":["Feng-Yang Chen","Haotian Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"面向从废水硝酸盐中实际电化学合成氨","zb":"研究对象为废水硝酸盐的电化学还原反应，关键方法为三室固体电解质反应器设计，结合阳离子屏蔽效应实现无支持电解质的硝酸盐还原，通过将处理后的含硝酸盐水从阴极室流经中间固体电解质层，实现阳离子从中间层回阴极室的迁移以提升硝酸盐还原选择性，反应器在典型工业废水硝酸盐浓度下可提供高氨法拉第效率，实现高纯度出水且无需电解质回收过程。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02251395mtgabs","t":"Synergistic and Energy-Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction Toward Sustainable Ammonia Synthesis via Indium-Modified Magnéli Phase Electrodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02251395mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Nitrate contamination in water presents a serious global environmental challenge. Electrochemical nitrate reduction (ENR) to ammonia (NH₃) offers a promising solution for both water purification and sustainable ammonia synthesis. This study investigates the synthesis, characterization, and performance of reactive electrochemical membranes (REMs) composed of Magnéli phase titanium suboxides, modified with indium as a cost-effective post-transition metal catalyst. The Magnéli phase substrate was prepared via thermal treatment at 850 °C under a hydrogen atmosphere, yielding a mixed-phase material with predominant Ti₉O₁₇. This substrate exhibited high intrinsic ENR activity, achieving ~69% nitrate removal and ~1% nitrite selectivity at –1.0 V vs. SHE with a hydraulic residence time of 8.3 s—even without any additional catalyst—demonstrating its inherent electroactivity. To further enhance pe","au":["Atefeh Nadeali","Brian P. Chaplin"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过铟改性磁利石相电极实现协同和节能的电化学硝酸还原至可持续氨合成","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸还原（ENR）至氨，采用热处理制备的磁利石相钛亚氧化物基材，通过浸渍法沉积铟（2–8 wt%）。基材表现出高固有 ENR 活性，在 –1.0 V vs. SHE 和 8.3 s 水力停留时间下，硝酸盐去除率 ~69%，亚硝酸盐选择性 ~1%。4 wt% 铟电极（4In–850）表现最佳，在 –0.8 V vs. SHE 和 1 mM NO₃⁻ 下，硝酸盐转化率高达 90 ± 0.57%，亚硝酸盐形成率极低（0.09 ± 0.03%），氨选择性 81.5 ± 0.5%。XPS 分析证实 In₂O₃ 初步形成，在操作条件下电化学还原为金属铟。在 –0.4 至 –1.4 V vs. SHE 的电位范围内，氨产率法拉第效率峰值达 85%，在 –0.6 V vs. SHE 和 100 mM NO₃⁻ 下。4In–850 电极比未改性基材（9.09 ± 2.45 kWh m⁻³）显","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02251394mtgabs","t":"General Approach to High-Entropy Single-Atom Nanocages for Electroreduction of Nitrate to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02251394mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Given the growing emphasis on energy efficiency, environmental sustainability, and agricultural demand, there’s a pressing need for decentralized and scalable ammonia production. Converting nitrate ions electrochemically, which are commonly found in industrial wastewater and polluted groundwater, into ammonia offers a viable approach for both wastewater treatment and ammonia production yet limited by low producibility and scalability. High-entropy materials (HEMs) is emerging as a promising class of catalytic materials with unique physicochemical properties for complex electrochemical reactions such as ammonia electrosynthesis from nitrate. However, the high compositional complexity of HEMs often frustrates the effort for manipulating their morphology and surface structures without compromising their versatility and scalability. Here we report a scalable solution-phase synthesis of high-","au":["Minghao Xie","Sishuang Tang","Guihua Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"通向高熵单原子笼的通用方法用于硝酸电还原至氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸电化学还原至氨，采用可扩展的溶液相合成方法制备高熵单原子笼（HESA NCs），其中 Fe 和其他五种金属-Co、Cu、Zn、Cd 和 In-通过氰桥隔离并分别与 C 和 N 配位。将五种金属隔离并嵌入 Fe 基质中，形成 Fe-C 5 活性位点，晶格对称性最小化，促进水裂解和加氢过程。结果，Fe-HESA NCs 在硝酸电催化还原中表现出对 NH 3 的高选择性，法拉第效率为 93.4%，产率率为 81.4 mg h −1 mg −1 。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02251366mtgabs","t":"Pulsed Electrolysis in Membrane Electrode Assembly Architecture for Enhanced Nitrate Reduction Reaction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02251366mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 – RR) to ammonia offers a promising solution to environmental and energy challenges, converting a ubiquitous pollutant in aquatic environments into a carbon-free energy carrier and essential chemical feedstock. While considerable research has focused on electrocatalyst development, relatively less attention has been given to device engineering and electroanalytical techniques that could play crucial roles in enhancing the performance of the electrocatalytic NO 3 – RR, especially at such low concentrations. In this talk, we present our recent work on synthesizing Cu x Ru y alloy catalysts and investigate their electrocatalytic performance by using various electroanalytical techniques in H-type and membrane-electrode-assembly (MEA) configurations. The results revealed the poor performance of the electrocatalytic NO 3 – RR at low NO 3 – conce","au":["Rami Reddy Boppella","Maryam Ahmadi","Brenden Arndt","Mohammadreza (Reza) Nazemi"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"在膜电极组件架构中脉冲电解用于增强硝酸盐还原反应为氨","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原反应（NO3- RR）到氨，将其转化为水生环境中普遍存在的污染物，并转化为无碳能源载体和重要化学原料。虽然大量研究集中于电催化剂开发，但相对较少关注可能对增强电催化NO3- RR性能起关键作用的器件工程和电分析技术，尤其是在如此低浓度的应用中。本研究通过使用各种电分析技术在H型和膜电极组件（MEA）配置中合成Cu x Ru y合金催化剂，并研究了其电催化性能。结果表明，在H型电池中低NO3-浓度（0.01 M）下电催化NO3- RR性能差，这是由于传质损失，促进了竞争的析氢反应。脉冲电解作为一种前沿技术，通过周期性地交替施加正负电位，有效地解决了传质限制并最小化了竞争的HER。研究表明，交替正电位可以补充靠近工作电极的带负电的NO3-离子，从而提高传质效率。此外，连续流电池反应器，特别是带有气体扩散电极（GDEs）的零间隙膜电极组件（MEA）细胞，在克服传统H型反","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-031443mtgabs","t":"Electrochemical Study of a Solid Oxide Fuel Cell Stack for Nitrous Oxide Reduction Utilizing Diluted Ammonia As Fuel","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-031443mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Introduction Nitrous oxide (N 2 O) is a harmful gas for the environment and significantly impacts the greenhouse effect. Hence, by 2030, the European Union issued a directive for cutting emissions by 42 % 1 . In this respect, one of the main anthropogenic sources of nitrous oxide is the production of nitric acid (HNO 3 ). Several strategies for its mitigation have been pursued. However, recently, the use of a SOFC was proposed as a promising pathway for addressing the end of pipe emissions. At very defined operating conditions 2 , the SOFC oxidizes N 2 O at the cathode to produce NO in the anode – which can be recycled to the HNO 3 process – when supplied with ammonia to the anode side, with the great benefit of producing power. Usually, SOFCs use H 2 as fuel, although this gas presents some drawbacks regarding storage and transportation 3 ; subsequently, it has been proposed to use ammo","au":["Celina Fernandes","Laura I. V. Holz","Francisco J. A. Loureiro","Miguel Duarte","Duncan Paul Fagg","Adélio Mendes"],"o":"回填","zt":"固体氧化物燃料电池堆电化学研究用于利用稀释氨作为燃料的二氧化氮还原","zb":"研究对象为固体氧化物燃料电池，关键方法是电化学表征，主要结果是利用稀释氨作为燃料在SOFC中实现了二氧化氮的还原，并生产了功率。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02532565mtgabs","t":"Single-Atom Catalyst Electrochemical Stability: Role of Metal Identity and Coordination Environment on Aggregation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02532565mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"While single-atom catalysts (SACs) are often touted for their maximal atomic efficiency and enhanced activity compared to nanoparticle counterparts, our understanding of SAC stability is severely lacking. The atomic dispersion of SACs leads to a high surface free energy, which can result in single-atom aggregation. Such instability can be further exacerbated by reaction conditions, such as temperature, gaseous atmosphere, or applied potential. Here, we investigated the stability of a series of SACs of various metal identities during electrocatalytic nitrate reduction by potential-resolved in situ X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS). We demonstrate the metal center to have significant influence on stability, where under an identical applied potential pattern, SACs underwent varying levels of reconstruction ranging from minimal change to complete reduction into metallic particles. The in s","au":["Kali Rigby","Saerom Yu","Leslie Arrazolo","Denis Leshchev","Aidan Meese","Eli Stavitski"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"单原子催化剂电化学稳定性：金属种类和配位环境对聚集的作用","zb":"研究对象为单原子催化剂（SACs）在电化学硝酸盐还原中的稳定性，关键方法为使用电位解析原位X射线吸收光谱（XAS）研究不同金属SACs的稳定性，发现金属种类对稳定性有显著影响，Cu SACs最易聚集，通过密度泛函理论计算确定Cu SAC结构与稳定性的关系。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02532506mtgabs","t":"Tandem Electrocatalysis for the Electrochemical Reduction of Carbon Dioxide and Nitrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02532506mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Tandem electrocatalysis, also referred to as sequential or cascade electrocatalysis, is a process in which multiple catalytic steps take place consecutively at distinct active sites within the same system. Inspired by enzymatic processes, this approach relies on the intermediate formed at one catalytic site serving as a reactant for the subsequent stage. By carefully integrating electrocatalysts and co-catalysts, tandem systems enhance reaction efficiency through synergistic effects, lower energy barriers, and improve selectivity toward targeted products. This study presents four case studies developed in our laboratory, focusing on the electrochemical reduction of CO₂ and N₂. Both transformations are pivotal for the energy transition, as they provide alternative electrochemical routes for carbon dioxide capture and conversion into valuable compounds while also promoting more sustainable","au":["Mauricio Isaacs","Pedro Jofré","Elias Mardones herrera","Zachary Schultz","Pablo Barraza"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"串联电催化用于二氧化碳和氮的电化学还原","zb":"研究对象为串联电催化体系，关键方法为在相同体系内不同活性位点进行连续催化步骤，通过中间体在催化位点之间的传递增强反应效率。主要结果为开发了四个案例研究，包括铜纳米立方体电极掺杂银纳米颗粒和锌纳米颗粒，通过拉曼光谱电化学、电化学阻抗谱和差分电化学质量谱研究了反应机理和产物选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472342mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Hybrid Catalytic Systems for Electrochemical Conversion of Inert Inorganic Molecules: Reduction of Carbon Dioxide and Nitrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472342mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Our recent research interests concentrate on the development, characterization, as well as establishing relation between structure and reactivity of functionalized materials for efficient electrocatalysis and electrochemical energy conversion. There has been growing attention in the electrochemical reduction of carbon dioxide, a potent greenhouse gas and a contributor to global climate change. Given the fact that the CO 2 molecule is very stable, its electroreduction processes are characterized by large overpotentials. To optimize the hydrogenation-type electrocatalytic approach, we have proposed to utilize nanostructured metallic centers (e.g. palladium) in a form of highly dispersed and reactive nanoparticles generated within supramolecular network of distinct nitrogen, sulfur or oxygen-coordination complexes. Among important issues are the mutual completion between hydrogen evolution ","au":["Pawel Kulesza","Iwona A. Rutkowska","Anna Chmielnicka","Beata Rytelewska"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"用于惰性无机分子电化学转化的混合催化体系：二氧化碳和氮的还原","zb":"研究对象为功能化材料，用于高效的电催化和电化学能量转化。关键方法为使用纳米结构金属中心（如钯）在高分散的活性纳米颗粒中，以及生物膜在碳电极材料表面的形成。主要结果为通过结合金属纳米结构和导电聚合物超薄膜，获得了对 CO 2 还原的高反应活性和选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472334mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Advancing Ammonia Electrocatalysis for Hydrogen Production via Ammonia Electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472334mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia is gaining significant attention as a carbon-free energy carrier due to its ease of storage, distribution, and compatibility with existing infrastructure. Leveraging ammonia as a scalable and cost-effective energy vector requires critical advancements in the electrocatalysis of the ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR), a field that has seen rapid progress in recent years. Dr. Botte’s group has been working on the electrolysis of ammonia for different applications, including hydrogen production [1-3] to the simultaneous removal of ammonia and nitrate from wastewater [4]. In this talk, I will present a comprehensive overview of ammonia electrocatalysis, focusing on fundamental mechanisms, electrochemical testing, electrochemical reactor design, and material innovations. A key challenge in ammonia electrolysis is preventing hydrogen liberation through the reverse Haber–Bosch reaction, w","au":["Gerardine G Botte"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"通过氨电解推进氨电催化用于氢生产","zb":"研究对象为氨（NH₃）的氧化反应（AOR），采用电化学方法将氨氧化为氢气。研究Pt₃Ni催化剂在氨电解中的应用，通过气体扩散电极（GDE）和碳布上的双金属Pt₃Ni催化剂，实现氨的阳极氧化。该方法有效地将每分子氨的氢气产量提高一倍，同时比传统水电解具有更低的过电位。选择性研究表明，特定催化剂成分可以实现显著的N₂和H₂生成。进一步研究揭示了Pt₃Ni集成GDE在N₂和H₂生产中的效率提升，为优化氨电解系统铺平了道路。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472332mtgabs","t":"(Invited) What Are the Best Ways to Make Green Ammonia?","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472332mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Low-carbon ammonia can be produced at scale using the conventional Haber-Bosch process coupled with carbon capture and sequestration (referred to as blue ammonia), or via a renewable-powered Haber-Bosch process utilizing hydrogen generated through water electrolysis (green ammonia). Additionally, green ammonia can be produced at smaller scales from a range of photovoltaic based approaches (photocatalysis and photoelectrocatalysis). Finally, green ammonia is also plausible using non dinitrogen-based feedstocks (e.g. nitrate and organic nitrogen). The viability of each production technological pathway and feedstock; however, is influenced by factors such as the cost, the price of renewable electricity, and the presence of carbon pricing mechanisms. Here, we will discuss the latest findings for green and blue ammonia and detail the tradeoffs for each approach. We will discuss the role detai","au":["Marta Hatzell"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"如何才能最好地制造绿色氨？","zb":"讨论了绿色氨和蓝色氨的最新研究成果，并详细说明了每种方法的权衡。讨论了详细过程模型和技术经济在评估技术中的作用，以及技术验证的重要性。探索了将新兴氨生产技术与电网和可变可再生能源源相结合的更广泛影响，以及与其未来部署相关的潜在社会影响。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02472330mtgabs","t":"Nitrogen Reduction Catalyst Testbed with Real-Time 15 NH 3 Yield Quantification","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02472330mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This talk will overview our development and demonstration of a testbed for nitrogen reduction reaction (N 2 RR) studies employing in-line gas analysis with orbital multiturn time-of-flight mass spectrometry (TOF-MS) 1 . This capability addresses the major hindrance to developing N 2 RR catalysts, false positive NH 3 signal, while adding real-time 15 NH 3 detection and multi-reactant/product tracking. The specialized test station and cell hardware designs combined with picomole·s –1 sensitivity are essential to successfully conducting in-line NH 3 analytics at trace levels. The selectable mass resolution of orbital multiturn TOF-MS enables measurement of 14 NH 3 and of 15 NH 3 without interference from H 2 O, whose exact masses differ by only 0.013 amu. The demonstrated test protocol employs the relevant and scalable gas diffusion electrode cell architecture and achieves a minimum detecta","au":["James L. Young","Kabirat Balogun","Ellis Klein","Prithviraj Chumble","Logan Wilder","Todd G Deutsch"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"具有实时¹⁵NH₃产率定量的氮还原催化剂测试台","zb":"开发并演示了一种用于氮还原反应（N₂RR）研究的测试台，采用轨道多转飞行时间质谱（TOF-MS）进行在线气体分析。该测试台能够实时检测¹⁵NH₃，并跟踪多种反应物和产物。通过轨道多转TOF-MS的选择性质量分辨率，实现了¹⁴NH₃和¹⁵NH₃的测量，而不会受到H₂O的干扰。测试协议采用可扩展的气体扩散电极（GDE）细胞架构，实时测量¹⁵NH₃产率的最低检测限为6 pmol⋅cm⁻²⋅s⁻¹。"},{"id":"10.1149/ma2025-02381817mtgabs","t":"(Invited) Tuning the Catalytic Pocket of a Single Atom Fe-N-C Electrocatalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1149/ma2025-02381817mtgabs","s":"ECS Meeting Abstracts","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Storing energy in the nitrogen cycle (N 2 ⇌ N-based fuel) is a promising and thorny route towards energy sustainability. Hydrazine (N 2 H 4 ) is a key nitrogen compound, ubiquitous in nature and in chemical applications. Since the 1940s, anhydrous hydrazine has been used as a rocket fuel, good for its energetic oxidation by O 2 . The hydrazine oxidation reaction (HzOR, N 2 H 4 + 4OH – → N 2 + 4H 2 O + 4 e – ) is especially promising as an electrode reaction in direct liquid fuel cells and for hydrazine-assisted hydrogen evolution. Electrocatalysis of the HzOR is both a practical goal, and a scientific paradox: although hydrazine is a famous reductant in chemical synthesis, the overpotential for hydrazine electro-oxidation reaction is still highly dependent on the catalytic surface. Some excellent catalysts have been developed in recent years towards this goal, designed for direct hydrazi","au":["David Eisenberg"],"o":"回填","zt":"调节单原子Fe-N-C催化剂的催化口袋","zb":"在氮循环（N2 ⇌ N基燃料）中储存能量是走向能源可持续性的有前景且棘手的途径。肼（N2H4）是一种关键的氮化合物，在自然界和化学应用中普遍存在。自20世纪40年代以来，无水肼一直用作火箭燃料，因其能被O2强烈氧化。肼氧化反应（HzOR，N2H4 + 4OH – → N2 + 4H2O + 4 e – ）特别有前景，可作为直接液体燃料电池和肼辅助析氢的电极反应。肼的电催化既是实际目标，也是科学悖论：尽管肼是化学合成中著名的还原剂，但肼电氧化反应的过电位仍然高度依赖于催化表面。近年来，为了实现这一目标，开发了一些优秀的催化剂，设计用于直接肼燃料电池、电解器和传感器。然而，这些催化剂中，大多数要么价格昂贵（例如基于Pt的催化剂），要么易于失活并产生NH3（例如Co-和Ni基材料）。因此，尽管肼具有最高的理论燃料电池电压vs.氧气（1.56 V），尽管几十年来进行了研究，但还没有提出实际的解决方","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/cctc.202501417","t":"A Two‐Step Electrochemical Conversion of Nitric Oxide to Ammonia on Defective Copper Foam Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cctc.202501417","s":"ChemCatChem","d":"2025-11-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical reduction of nitrogen oxides (NO x ) and nitrates (NO 3 − ) to ammonia (NH 3 ) has recently gained interest due to its potential to replace the energy intensive Haber–Bosch process, which requires high temperatures and pressures. In this study, we synthesized a highly porous reduced copper foam enriched with oxygen vacancies and evaluated its performance in both batch (H‐cell) and flow cell configurations for nitrate reduction. The catalyst achieved an impressive NH 3 yield of 162 mg/h cm 2 in the H‐cell and 183 mg/h cm 2 in the flow cell, with a maximum Faradaic efficiency of 95.6% in 0.1 M NO 3 − electrolyte. The enhanced activity is attributed to the increased number of active sites formed via electrochemical reduction of copper oxide. Additionally, we demonstrated a proof‐of‐concept approach for synthesizing nitrate from gaseous NO via chlorine‐ and oxyge","au":["Jaganathan Jayakumar","Raghuram Chetty"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在缺陷铜泡沫催化剂上氮氧化物和硝酸盐的两步电化学转化为氨","zb":"研究对象为富含氧空位的致密铜泡沫催化剂，在批式（H-电池）和流电池配置中评估了其在硝酸盐还原反应中的性能。催化剂在 H-电池中实现了 162 mg/h·cm^2 的 NH3 产率，在流电池中实现了 183 mg/h·cm^2 的产率，在 0.1 M NO3^- 电解液中最高法拉第效率为 95.6%。增强的活性归因于通过电化学还原铜氧化物形成的活性位点增加。此外，还展示了通过氯和氧介导的电化学氧化从气态 NO 合成硝酸盐的概念验证方法。所得硝酸盐随后用于氨生产，完成了 NO 到 NH3 的两步转化。合成的氨通过氩气剥离并结晶为氯化铵 (NH4Cl)，这是一种稳定的化合物，在肥料、药物和电池系统中具有直接应用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1111/jace.70402","t":"Enhanced microwave absorption in joule‐heating‐synthesized (Fe 1/3 Mn 1/3 Cr 1/3 ) 2 AlB 2 via dielectric–magnetic coupling","u":"https://doi.org/10.1111/jace.70402","s":"Journal of the American Ceramic Society","d":"2025-11-23","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract The modulation of electromagnetic parameters is crucial for enhancing the electromagnetic wave (EMW) absorption performance of materials. Here, a ternary MAB‐phase solid solution, namely (Fe 1/3 Mn 1/3 Cr 1/3 ) 2 AlB 2 (T‐FMCAB), was synthesized for the first time via rapid joule heating, overcoming the limitations associated with the synthesis of conventional MAB phases. The EMW dissipation capacity of Fe 2 AlB 2 was enhanced through the incorporation of both Cr and Mn at the Fe sites: Cr introduces strong magnetic moments, boosting the magnetic loss of the system, while Mn enhances its dielectric loss by promoting interfacial/dipole polarization through charge transitions between Mn 2+ and Mn 3+ . Defect engineering achieved through Cr/Mn co‐doping and the joule‐heating treatment further enhances dielectric and magnetic losses: the lattice distortions arising from the size mis","au":["Yuhang Bai","Zelong Yao","Yang Yang","Jinrui Li","Jia Liu","Peipei Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["joule-heat"],"zt":"增强焦耳热合成（Fe 1/3 Mn 1/3 Cr 1/3 ）2 AlB 2 的介电-磁耦合微波吸收","zb":"研究对象为（Fe 1/3 Mn 1/3 Cr 1/3 ）2 AlB 2 (T-FMCAB)材料的微波吸收性能，关键方法为通过快速焦耳热合成T-FMCAB，通过Cr和Mn的共掺杂增强Fe 2 AlB 2的电磁损耗，Cr引入强磁矩提升磁损耗，Mn通过Mn 2+ 和Mn 3+ 之间的电荷转移增强介电损耗，缺陷工程进一步增强介电和磁损耗，T-FMCAB在1.47 mm厚度下最小反射损耗为-58.38 dB，最大有效吸收带宽为4.0 GHz。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1007/s11426-025-3118-0","t":"Sustainable ammonia production beyond Haber-Bosch: a review of nitrogen reduction pathways from diverse feedstocks","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11426-025-3118-0","s":"Science China Chemistry","d":"2025-11-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Yanzhe Li","Lei Shi","Shuzhen Zhang","Yangyang Liu","Jun Huang","Shenlong Zhao"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"超越 Haber-Bosch 的可持续氨生产：不同原料氮还原路径综述","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.3390/nitrogen6040106","t":"Advances in Layered Double Hydroxide (LDH)-Based Materials for Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction to Ammonia: A Comprehensive Review","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nitrogen6040106","s":"Nitrogen","d":"2025-11-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Nitrogen (N2), constituting the majority of Earth’s atmosphere, remains indispensable for biological systems and underpins modern agriculture and industry. Traditionally, the Haber–Bosch process has been essential for synthesizing ammonia (NH3) from N2 under high temperature and pressure, but it contributes significantly to global CO2 emissions. Recently, carbon-free electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction (e-NRR) has emerged as a promising, eco-friendly, and cost-effective approach for green NH3 production under mild conditions using renewable energy, offering a sustainable alternative to the fossil fuel dependent Haber–Bosch process. This work explores NRR by contrasting the limitations of Haber–Bosch with the advantages of electrocatalysis. Despite progress, electrochemical N2 reduction to NH3 production remains challenging due to low activity, poor selectivity, stability, efficiency, and","au":["Sayali S. Kulkarni","Ganesh L. Khande","Jayavant L. Gunjakar","Valmiki B. Koli"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesizing ammonia"],"zt":"层状双氢氧化物（LDH）基材料在电催化氮还原为氨方面的进展：综合评述","zb":"氮气（N2）是地球大气的主要成分，对生物系统至关重要，支撑着现代农业和工业。传统上，哈伯-博施法在高温高压下将N2合成氨（NH3），但会产生大量CO2排放。近年来，无碳电催化氮还原（e-NRR）作为一种环保、经济的方法，在温和条件下利用可再生能源生产NH3，为依赖化石燃料的哈伯-博施法提供了可持续替代方案。该综述对比了哈伯-博施法的局限性及电催化的优势，指出电化学N2还原为NH3生产仍面临活性低、选择性差、稳定性差、效率低和检测问题。开发高效的e-NRR电催化剂对于提高活性、抑制析氢反应（HER）、提高NH3产率和法拉第效率至关重要。该综述重点介绍了LDH催化剂在e-NRR中的作用，总结了基本过程、反应路径和合成策略，比较了氨检测方法、关键指标和潜在污染问题，以指导标准NRR测量规程。最后，总结了合成和改进LDH电催化剂的关键发现，以实现NH3生产和可持续的无碳N2经济。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5784205","t":"Universal synthesis of mesoporous nitride modified alumina catalysts for hydrogen production from ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5784205","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-11-21","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Lili Huo","Xiaoyu Tian","Fangfei Lv","Meng Zhang","Wei-Wei Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"通用合成介孔氮化物改性氧化铝催化剂用于氨分解制氢","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5777285","t":"Improved Coking Resistance and Thermal Stability of Pd/Al₂O₃ Catalyst by Atomic Layer Deposition of Iron Oxide for Dry Reforming of Methane","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5777285","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-11-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Ning Wang","Joseph Jolley","Jihwan Kim","Shaoliang Guan","Stephan Hofmann","Tzia Onn"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积铁氧化物改善Pd/Al₂O₃催化剂的结焦抗性和热稳定性用于甲烷干法重整","ob":"甲烷干重整；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/smtd.202501678","t":"Flash Joule Heating: A Transformative Non‐Equilibrium Strategy for Next‐Generation Advanced Materials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smtd.202501678","s":"Small Methods","d":"2025-11-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract High‐temperature synthesis methods play a pivotal role in the development of advanced functional materials. However, conventional approaches often suffer from high energy consumption, prolonged reaction durations, and limited control over metastable phase formation. Flash Joule heating (FJH), an electrothermally driven transient energy conversion technique, applies short‐duration (<10s), high‐intensity electrical pulses (>2000 W) to achieve ultrafast heating and cooling (typically >10 2 –10 5 K s −1 ), with peak temperatures reaching up to 3,500 °C, and energy utilization efficiency is close to 100%. This non‐equilibrium thermodynamic environment facilitates the rapid transformation of diverse precursors into carbon‐based and inorganic materials, enabling highly tunable compositions, multiscale architectures, and abundant defect states. As such, FJH provides a sustainable and sc","au":["Jiawei Xiao","Yun Chen","Liang Cheng","Hengxu Wu","Maoxiang Hou","Li Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"闪焦耳加热：下一代先进材料的变革性非平衡策略","zb":"高温合成方法在先进功能材料发展中起着关键作用。然而，传统方法通常存在高能耗、反应时间过长以及对亚稳态相形成控制有限的问题。闪焦耳加热（FJH）是一种电热驱动的瞬态能量转换技术，通过短时程（<10s）、高强度的电脉冲（>2000 W）实现超快加热和冷却（通常>10^2–10^5 K s −1），峰值温度高达3500 °C，能量利用效率接近100%。这种非平衡热力学环境促进了多种前驱体快速转化为碳基和无机材料，实现高度可调的成分、多尺度结构和丰富的缺陷态。因此，FJH为先进材料制造提供了一个可持续和可扩展的平台，同时在废物资源化和环境修复方面也显示出巨大潜力。本文系统概述了FJH的基本原理和反应器配置，阐明了加工过程中结构重建的内在机制，突出了在不同应用场景中的技术优势，并讨论了FJH成为先进材料工程和可持续技术开发中心策略所必须解决的关键挑战。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1088/1361-6595/ae1da6","t":"Cracking ammonia in atmospheric-pressure nitrogen microwave discharge plasma to produce hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1361-6595/ae1da6","s":"Plasma Sources Science and Technology","d":"2025-11-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Abstract An atmospheric-pressure microwave plasma torch (MPT) is used for hydrogen production without using catalyst, in which a mixture of ammonia (NH 3 ) and N 2 as carrier gas passes through the excitation region. Optical emission spectroscopy is employed to diagnose the MPT with respect to electron density, gas temperature, and species concentrations. The production of electrons, NH radicals, N atoms, H atoms, and N 2 + ions, as well as the influence of NH 3 on their generation are discussed. And it is found that the contribution of electron impact ionization to electron generation outweighs stepwise ionization and pooling reactions and the variation of gas temperature around 5500 K is governed primarily by the Joule heat generated by microwave plasma discharge and the chemical heat absorbed by NH 3 decomposition. Furthermore, it is experimentally obtained that NH 3 conversion rate r","au":["Yu-Long Niu","Shou-Zhe Li","Gui-Bin Xu","Xiaoqiong Wen"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"在 атмосфер-压氮微波放电等离子体中裂解氨生产氢气","zb":"使用大气压微波等离子体炬（MPT）在不使用催化剂的情况下生产氢气，其中氨（NH3）和N2作为载气通过激发区域。利用光发射光谱诊断MPT的电子密度、气体温度和物种浓度。讨论了电子、NH自由基、N原子、H原子和N2+离子的产生，以及NH3对其产生的影响。研究发现，电子冲击电离对电子产生的贡献超过了逐级电离和团聚反应，并且气体温度在5500 K附近的波动主要由微波等离子体放电产生的焦耳热和NH3分解吸收的化学热控制。此外，实验结果表明NH3转化率达到100%，氢气生产速率和能量产率分别为994.9 l/h和378.4 l/kWh。","ob":"反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1093/jimmun/vkaf283.659","t":"Targeting ammonia metabolism to enhance immunotherapy response in colorectal cancer 2776","u":"https://doi.org/10.1093/jimmun/vkaf283.659","s":"The Journal of Immunology","d":"2025-11-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Description Advanced colorectal cancer (CRC) is notably resistant to immunotherapy, yet the underlying metabolic mechanisms driving this resistance remain unclear. Using genetically engineered mouse models with Apc, Tp53, and Kras mutations, we identified significant ammonia accumulation in tumors, resulting from dysregulated urea cycle metabolism via HNF4α/OTC downregulation. Ammonia exposure impaired T cell proliferation, increased exhaustion markers (PD-1, CTLA-4), and reduced interferon-gamma production. Enhancing ammonia clearance through ornithine supplementation restored T cell activity and improved the response to anti-PD-L1 therapy. Analysis of CRC patient samples revealed elevated serum ammonia levels, which correlated with poor survival and diminished immunotherapy efficacy. Mechanistically, high ammonia levels impaired T cell function by disrupting the transsulfurati","au":["Zhenghong Lee","Yatrik M. Shah"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"靶向氨代谢以增强结直肠癌免疫治疗反应","zb":"在具有Apc、Tp53和Kras突变的基因工程小鼠模型中，发现肿瘤中存在显著氨积累，这是由于HNF4α/OTC下调导致尿素循环代谢失调。氨暴露损害T细胞增殖，增加耗竭标志物（PD-1、CTLA-4），并减少干扰素-γ的产生。通过鸟氨酸补充增强氨清除恢复了T细胞活性并改善了抗PD-L1治疗的反应。CRC患者样本分析显示血清氨水平升高，与生存率差和免疫治疗疗效降低相关。机制上，高氨水平通过破坏转硫途径、增加氧化应激和加剧T细胞耗竭损害T细胞功能。将进行体外氨应激下T细胞的全基因组CRISPR筛选，并使用小鼠模型中的靶向CRISPR删除验证关键靶点。此外，体内CRISPR筛选将识别肿瘤细胞中氨产生的代谢调节因子。这项工作旨在揭示新的治疗靶点和产生创新的联合策略，以增强CRC患者的免疫治疗结果。"},{"id":"10.53941/matsus.2025.100014","t":"Cu-Based Atomic Catalysts for the Electrochemical Hydrogenation of Nitrate to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.53941/matsus.2025.100014","s":"Materials and Sustainability","d":"2025-11-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is an essential industrial feedstock, but conventional synthesis processes, Haber-Bosch process, emit significant greenhouse gases. Electrochemical ammonia synthesis offers a promising alternative, enabling ammonia production without harmful pollutants. Recently, electrochemical nitrate reduction has attracted considerable attention for ammonia synthesis due to its high selectivity. Achieving efficient ammonia synthesis requires active and selective catalysts, and single-atom catalysts have shown great promise owing to their tunable chemical and geometric active sites. However, challenges remain, including the need to enhance active surface area and suppress competing hydrogen evolution reactions. This minireview summarizes recent advances in the design strategies of Cu-based single-atom catalysts, highlighting their advantages and performance in electrochemical nitrate reduction","au":["Hyeong Bin Park","Haneul Jin"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于Cu的单原子催化剂用于硝酸盐的电化学加氢合成氨","zb":"氨是一种重要的工业原料，但传统的合成过程，哈伯-博施法，会排放大量温室气体。电化学氨合成提供了一种有前景的替代方案，能够在没有有害污染物的情况下生产氨。最近，电化学硝酸盐还原因其高选择性而受到相当大的关注，用于氨合成。实现高效的氨合成需要活性高、选择性的催化剂，单原子催化剂因其可调的化学和几何活性位点显示出巨大的潜力。然而，仍然存在挑战，包括需要提高活性表面积和抑制竞争的析氢反应。本短评总结了Cu基单原子催化剂的设计策略，重点介绍了它们在电化学硝酸盐还原中的优势和性能。特别强调通过研究其局部原子配位，如Cu-N4、Cu-NxO、CuM-Nx和嵌入金属氧化物中的Cu，来研究局部组成/原子结构与电化学氮还原性能之间的关系。该评论最后强调了进一步研究以优化Cu基单原子催化剂，以实现高效和可持续的氨生产的重要性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.5c17012","t":"Unveiling the Mechanisms of Improved Stability and Performance via Tetraalkyl-Type Ionic Liquids: Suppression of Organic Solid Electrolyte Interface Formation in Lithium-Mediated Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c17012","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2025-11-20","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) has emerged as a promising alternative to the conventional Haber-Bosch process, enabling modular and decentralized ammonia production. A critical component influencing Li-NRR efficiency is the solid-electrolyte interface (SEI), which modulates reactant transport and controls reaction pathways at the electrode surface. Recently, tetraalkyl organic salts have attracted attention as advantageous proton carriers due to their superior electrochemical stability and structural versatility, offering avenues for optimized SEI control. In this study, we utilized in situ attenuated total reflectance-surface-enhanced infrared absorption spectroscopy (ATR-SEIRAS) to dynamically investigate SEI formation during Li-NRR, comparing ethanol (EtOH) and tetrabutylammonium chloride (TBACl) as proton carriers. Distinct differences in SEI composition and mo","au":["Sungbin Yang","Yurim Sohn","Jinwoo Chu","Wooyul Kim","Byungha Shin"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"通过四烷基型离子液体揭示提高稳定性和性能的机制：抑制锂介导氮还原中的有机固体电解质界面形成","zb":"锂介导氮还原反应（Li-NRR）已成为传统哈伯-博施过程的替代方案，能够实现模块化和分散的氨（NH3）生产。影响Li-NRR效率的关键因素是固体电解质界面（SEI），它调节反应物传输并控制电极表面的反应路径。最近，四烷基有机盐因其优异的电化学稳定性和结构多样性而作为有利的质子载体引起关注，为优化SEI控制提供了途径。在本研究中，我们利用原位衰减全反射-表面增强红外吸收光谱（ATR-SEIRAS）动态研究了Li-NRR过程中的SEI形成，比较了乙醇（EtOH）和四丁基氯化铵（TBACl）作为质子载体。观察到SEI组成和形态的明显差异，EtOH促进不规则有机SEI层的快速和广泛形成，主要是锂乙醇盐（LiOEt）和碳酸锂（Li2CO3）。相反，TBACl条件通过TBA+离子形成稳定的双电层抑制有机SEI生长，显著限制电极表面附近的自由THF分子，从而减少不需要的有机SEI成分。我们的结果表明，质","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/smtd.202501467","t":"Catalyzing the Nitrogen Fixation under Ambient Environment: Progress and Prospects in TiO 2 ‐Based Nanomaterials for Solar‐Driven Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smtd.202501467","s":"Small Methods","d":"2025-11-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract TiO 2 ‐based nanomaterials have attracted considerable attention for their ability to produce ammonia (NH 3 ) through photocatalysis, offering a sustainable method for nitrogen (N 2 ) fixation under ambient conditions. TiO 2 , being a stable and benchmark semiconductor, shows great promise as a photocatalyst for utilizing light energy to show the pathway for efficient reduction of N 2 to NH 3 . This review provides relevant information about the fundamental mechanisms of photocatalytic N 2 adsorption and reduction pathways, besides providing the insights essential for the development of efficient TiO 2 ‐based photocatalysts. Various strategies, such as doping with metals and nonmetals, have been developed to modify the electronic structure of TiO 2 , enabling it to absorb visible light more effectively. Furthermore, advanced strategies such as defect engineering, crystal facet m","au":["Kajal Chauhan","Akshay Thakur","Mahender Singh","Majed Alsubih","Nadeem A. Khan","Ashish Kumar"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"在环境条件下催化氮固定：基于TiO2纳米材料的太阳能驱动氨合成进展与前景","zb":"基于TiO2的纳米材料因其能通过光催化生产氨（NH3），在环境条件下实现N2固定而受到广泛关注。TiO2作为一种稳定和基准半导体，作为光催化剂，利用光能将N2高效还原为NH3显示出巨大潜力。该综述提供了关于光催化N2吸附和还原路径的基本机制的相关信息，并提供了开发高效TiO2基光催化剂所需的见解。各种策略，如金属和非金属掺杂，已被开发出来以修饰TiO2的电子结构，使其能更有效地吸收可见光。此外，缺陷工程、晶体晶面调控和等离子体杂化等先进策略已被广泛阐述，证明了它们在增强电荷载体分离和提高光催化NH3合成效率中的关键作用。此外，通过将TiO2与其他材料结合开发TiO2基复合材料，为更高效和可持续的NH3生产提供了有前景的结果。最后，该论文讨论了开发高效TiO2基光催化剂的当前限制、挑战和未来前景，以及正确的NH3定量实验规程和进一步必要的进展，以实现可扩展的光催化NH3生产。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1038/s44160-025-00941-1","t":"Copper–palladium hydride interfaces promote electrochemical ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44160-025-00941-1","s":"Nature Synthesis","d":"2025-11-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"","au":["Yunfan Fu","Shuo Wang","Pengfei Wei","Yi Wang","Rongtan Li","Jiaqi Shao"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"铜-钯氢化物界面促进电化学氨合成","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1,"top":1},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202524133","t":"Rapid‐Response Electromagnetic Metamaterial Enabling Round‐The‐Clock Electrified CO 2 Methanation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202524133","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2025-11-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Abstract CO 2 methanation offers a practical solution for sustainable, renewable energy storage and long‐term space exploration missions. However, conventional direct solar‐driven photothermal systems suffer from thermal response hysteresis and dynamic temperature fluctuations, undermining methane yield stability and limiting their applicability under high gas hourly space velocity (GHSV) conditions. Herein, a round‐the‐clock CO 2 methanation system is pioneered that integrates photovoltaic power generation with induction heating by a rapid‐response electromagnetic metamaterial (EEM), serving as both a catalyst and a susceptor. The EMM assembles single atoms, nanoclusters, and nanotubes into a macrostructure by a 3D‐printed strategy and rapidly reaches the methanation temperature of 300 °C within just 36 s at a frequency of 297 kHz with an input power of 461 W, achieving a substantially ","au":["Pengxuan Wang","Yuming Gao","Haoyu Yan","Zhengwu Yang","Chaoping Xu","Dawei Tang"],"o":"回填","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"快速响应电磁超材料实现全天候电化学CO2甲烷化","zb":"CO2甲烷化提供了一种可持续、可再生的能源储存和长期太空探索任务的实用解决方案。然而，传统的直接太阳能驱动光热系统存在热响应滞后和动态温度波动问题，这会降低甲烷产率稳定性并限制其在高气体小时空速（GHSV）条件下的适用性。本文开发了一种全天候CO2甲烷化系统，该系统集成了光伏发电与感应加热，通过快速响应电磁超材料（EEM）实现，该超材料既是催化剂也是感应器。EMM通过3D打印策略将单原子、纳米团簇和纳米管组装成宏观结构，在297 kHz频率和461 W输入功率下，仅36 s即可快速达到300 °C的甲烷化温度，在超高空速150 000 mL g cat −1 h −1 下实现821 mmol g cat −1 h −1 的CH4时空产率。户外光伏驱动感应加热系统在一周内保持稳定生产，累计CH4输出为1373.2 L，屏蔽了系统免受环境不稳定的影响。值得注意的是，该系统表现出13%的太阳能到"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.5c15788","t":"Nonmetallic Modified Atomically Precise Octagold Nanoclusters for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c15788","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2025-11-18","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Atomically precise metal nanoclusters (NCs) with metal cores functionalized by nonmetallic elements hold great promise for electrocatalytic NO3- reduction reaction (NO3RR). However, elucidating structural evolution during catalysis and precisely identifying the active sites remain formidable challenges. Herein, we have synthesized [Au8S2(dppm)4]2+ and [Au8Se2(dppm)4]2+ (dppm: Ph2PCH2PPh2) NCs with Au cores modified by S or Se atoms and subjected them to electrochemical pre-activation. Comprehensive experiments reveal that pre-activation leads to the removal of one dppm ligand from both NCs, thereby exposing metallic Au sites. As NO3RR catalysts, the activated [Au8S2(dppm)4]2+ achieves an NH3 yield rate of 1108.47 mg h-1 mgAu-1 and a Faradaic efficiency of 98.34%, significantly surpassing [Au8Se2(dppm)4]2+, most reported NCs, and conventional nanocatalysts. Mechanistic studies unveil that","au":["Xiaojuan Zhu","Wei-Dan Si","Kaiyu Qu","Leyang Song","Jing Wang","Yushuang Gong"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"非金属修饰的原子精确八金纳米簇用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为非金属元素修饰的原子精确金属纳米簇（NCs）在电催化NO3-还原反应（NO3RR）中的应用。通过合成[Au8S2(dppm)4]2+和[Au8Se2(dppm)4]2+（dppm: Ph2PCH2PPh2）纳米簇，其中Au核心被S或Se原子修饰，并对其进行电化学预活化。研究发现预活化导致NCs失去一个dppm配体，暴露出金属Au位点。预活化的[Au8S2(dppm)4]2+作为NO3RR催化剂，氨产率率为1108.47 mg h-1 mgAu-1，法拉第效率为98.34%，显著优于[Au8Se2(dppm)4]2+、大多数报道的NCs和传统纳米催化剂。机理研究表明，预活化后暴露的金属Au位点为主要的催化中心。此外，S原子引入Au核心使表面电势更正，上移Au-d带中心，增强NO3-吸附，并加强活性氢的产生和消耗之间的平衡，共同提高NO3RR性能。这项工作不仅为电解过程中原子精确NC","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/smm2.70052","t":"Coupling Nitrate Reduction Reaction With Ammonia Recovery: Perspectives on Principles and Engineering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smm2.70052","s":"SmartMat","d":"2025-11-18","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"ABSTRACT Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) refers to the route of converting nitrate (NO 3 − ) to ammonia (NH 3 ). However, NH 3 dissolved in the post‐reaction solution is limited for direct reuse toward downstream purposes, thereby undermining the application potentials and economic viability of NO 3 RR. Instantaneous NH 3 recovery after NO 3 − conversion reduces the entropy of the system, thermodynamically favoring the forward reaction. NH 3 separation is necessary for both resource recovery and environmental safety considering its toxicity. Coupling NO 3 RR with NH 3 recovery presents a promising solution for decentralized nitrogen management, particularly in areas with limited access to the power grid and commercial fertilizers. In this perspective, principles and engineering design of NH 3 recovery are introduced, with a highlight on heat as a suitable driving for","au":["Yuecheng Xiong","Mingzheng Shao","Yunhao Wang","Wei Chen","Zhanxi Fan"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"耦合硝酸盐还原反应与氨回收：原理与工程展望","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）将硝酸盐（NO3-）转化为氨（NH3），但反应后溶液中溶解的氨难以直接回收利用。本研究提出耦合NO3RR与氨回收，通过瞬时氨回收降低系统熵，热力学上促进正向反应。氨分离对资源回收和环境安全至关重要。耦合NO3RR与氨回收为分散式氮管理提供了一种有前景的解决方案，特别是在电力供应和商业化肥获取受限的地区。本文介绍了氨回收的原理和工程设计，重点强调热作为合适的驱动力。展望未来，通过智能材料设计提高反应物和产物的选择性，将促进不同氮源的处理，结合现有能源基础设施将提高对电力、卫生和化肥的获取。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1002/cmtd.202500066","t":"Metamorphosis of Multilayered‐(NH 4 ) 2 V 7 O 16 Squares to Zinc Vanadate and w‐ZnO Nanoparticles via Zinc Metalation through Atomic Layer Deposition: Precision and Sustainability in Material Transformation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cmtd.202500066","s":"Chemistry–Methods","d":"2025-11-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Vapor phase metalation (VPM) via atomic layer deposition is emerging as a sustainable, solvent‐free method for precise material functionalization. This study demonstrates selective zinc metalation of multilayered (NH 4 ) 2 V 7 O1 16 nanostructured squares using diethylzinc (DEZ) as a volatile precursor. A sequence of samples—(HDA)V 7 O 16 ·nH 2 O (S‐1), (NH 4 ) 2 V 7 O 16 ·nH 2 O (S‐2), iodine‐functionalized (S‐3), and Zn‐metalated (S‐4)—was characterised via XRD, HRTEM/SAED, FIB‐SEM, ESEM, ATR‐FTIR, Raman microscopy, and XPS. The V7 7 O 16 bilayer framework revealed a triclinic crystal structure (P‐1 space group) for the first time. VPM enabled the transformation into Zn 3 V3 3 O 8 and wurtzite ZnO nanoparticles with structural precision and minimal waste. Metalation was achieved from a single half‐cycle (210 seconds total), allowing fine control over deposition dynamics. This process a","au":["Mabel. A. Moreno","Anjana Devi","Luis Velasquez","Guillermo Gonzalez","Daniel Navas"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积锌金属化将多层(NH4)2V7O16正方形转变为锌钒酸盐和w-ZnO纳米颗粒：材料转变的精确性和可持续性","zb":"气相金属化（VPM）通过原子层沉积作为一种可持续、无溶剂的方法正在兴起，用于精确的材料功能化。本研究展示了使用二乙锌（DEZ）作为挥发性前驱体对多层(NH4)2V7O16纳米结构正方形进行选择性锌金属化。一系列样品——(HDA)V7O16·nH2O (S-1)、(NH4)2V7O16·nH2O (S-2)、碘功能化（S-3）和Zn金属化（S-4）——通过XRD、HRTEM/SAED、FIB-SEM、ESEM、ATR-FTIR、拉曼显微镜和XPS进行了表征。V7O16双层框架首次揭示了三斜晶体结构（P-1空间群）。VPM实现了向Zn3V3O8和纤锌矿ZnO纳米颗粒的结构精确转换，并最大限度地减少了废物。金属化从单个半周期（总共210秒）实现，允许对沉积动力学进行精细控制。该过程还诱导了磁性转变，从自旋 frustrated 半导体行为转变为铁磁性。结果强调了VPM在低影响、高精度合成多功能氧","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.3390/catal15111084","t":"Single-Atom Catalysts for Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia: Rational Design, Mechanistic Insights, and System Perspectives","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/catal15111084","s":"Catalysts","d":"2025-11-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia serves as a critical industrial feedstock and a potential carbon-free energy carrier. However, its conventional synthesis method (the Haber–Bosch process) suffers from high energy consumption and substantial carbon emissions. The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (eNO3RR) has emerged as a promising alternative pathway, capable of converting nitrate pollutants in water into high-value ammonia under mild conditions, enabling green synthesis while offering dual benefits of environmental remediation and energy conversion. Single-atom catalysts (SACs), with their maximal atom utilization efficiency, well-defined active sites, and highly tunable electronic structures, have demonstrated exceptional catalytic performance and selectivity in eNO3RR. This review systematically summarizes recent advances of SACs in eNO3RR, with a focus on reaction mechanisms, advanced in situ charac","au":["Shupeng Yin","Yinglong Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"用于电化学硝酸盐还原为氨的单原子催化剂：理性设计、机理洞察和系统视角","zb":"氨作为关键工业原料和潜在的无碳能源载体，其传统合成方法（哈伯-博施法）存在高能耗和大量碳排放问题。电化学硝酸盐还原反应（eNO3RR）在温和条件下将水中的硝酸盐污染物转化为高价值氨，实现绿色合成，兼具环境治理和能量转换双重效益。单原子催化剂（SACs）因其原子利用率最大化、活性位点明确、电子结构高度可调等特点，在eNO3RR中展现出优异的催化性能和选择性。本文系统总结了SACs在eNO3RR中的最新进展，重点关注反应机理、原位表征技术、理论计算以及各种非贵金属中心（如Cu、Fe、Co）的催化行为和构效关系。阐述了提升SACs性能的关键策略，分析了电解质组成、pH值和电位等微环境影响因素。最后，本文概述了材料设计、动态活性位点识别和SACs工业应用中的当前挑战，并提出了促进eNO3RR技术实际应用和建立可持续氨经济未来的研究方向。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-p5jl6","t":"Electric-field-driven ammonia synthesis approaching industrial-level efficiency over a La2O3-supported Ru atomic cluster catalyst under mild conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-p5jl6","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-11-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia synthesis under mild conditions is critical for decarbonizing fertilizer production and enabling sustainable hydrogen carriers, yet remains a major challenge due to the lack of efficient catalysts and viable processes. This study presents an external electric field-driven ammonia synthesis strategy using Ru atomic clusters supported on La2O3, enabling efficient production under mild conditions. The system achieves industrial-grade ammonia output (17.8 vol%) at 200 °C, 4.0 MPa with a 92% reduction in energy consumption compared to conventional thermal catalysis (328 vs. 3681 kWh kg−1 NH3), far surpassing the high-temperature, high-pressure requirements of traditional Haber-Bosch process (> 400 °C, > 10 MPa). Mechanistic investigation reveals a dual-site catalyzed reaction pathway: the applied electric field enhances electron density at Ru sites, promoting N2 chemisorption and acti","au":["Xilun Zhang","Ye Lv","Ying Wang","Jiabo Le","Weiming Nie","Jianping Guo"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"电场驱动氨合成接近工业级效率在温和条件下La2O3负载的Ru原子簇催化剂上","zb":"研究对象为在温和条件下使用La2O3负载的Ru原子簇催化剂进行电场驱动氨合成，实现高效生产。该系统在200 °C、4.0 MPa下实现工业级氨输出（17.8 vol%），与传统热催化相比，能耗降低92%（328 vs. 3681 kWh kg−1 NH3），远低于传统哈伯-博施过程（> 400 °C，> 10 MPa）的高温高压要求。机理研究表明，施加的电场增强了Ru位点的电子密度，促进N2化学吸附和活化，同时动态生成La2O3上的氧空位，促进H从Ru溢流到La，从而解耦竞争性的H2/N2吸附并抑制氢中毒；此外，Ru-La界面处的H2裂解是可行的，形成LaH物种，作为协同活性中心参与关联氮氢化。这项工作开创了一条低能耗、分布式氨合成路线，可与可再生能源驱动的水电解兼容，并推进了外场驱动催化的基本理解。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系｜电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1007/s44422-025-00010-w","t":"Electrocatalytic nitrate to ammonia conversion: from mechanistic insights to catalyst engineering for practical applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s44422-025-00010-w","s":"Catal","d":"2025-11-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Excessive nitrate (NO3–) discharge disrupts the nitrogen cycle and threatens ecosystems and human health. Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO3RR) to ammonia (NH3) offers a sustainable route for pollution control and resource recovery. However, achieving high efficiency and selectivity remains challenging due to competing reactions and complex intermediates. This review summarizes recent advances in electrocatalytic nitrate reduction, emphasizing mechanistic insights into key intermediates, catalyst design, reaction conditions, and performance evaluation. Special attention is devoted to emerging studies of NO3RR in single-cell systems, demonstrating its potential for practical, real-world applications. Finally, we discuss the remaining challenges and future prospects, highlighting innovative catalyst strategies for sustainable and stable NH3 production. This review provides a framework","au":["Joyjit Kundu","Toshali Bhoyar","Jeonghyeon Kim","Jinwon Choi","Dohee Kim","Taehyun Kwon"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"电催化硝酸盐转化为氨：从机理洞察到催化剂工程以实现实际应用","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原（NO3RR）将硝酸盐（NO3–）转化为氨（NH3），为污染控制和资源回收提供了一条可持续路线。然而，由于竞争反应和复杂中间体，实现高效率和选择性仍然具有挑战性。本文总结了电催化硝酸盐还原的最新进展，强调关键中间体的机理洞察、催化剂设计、反应条件和性能评估。特别关注单电池系统中NO3RR的新兴研究，展示了其在实际应用中的潜力。最后，讨论了剩余的挑战和未来前景，重点介绍了可持续和稳定氨生产的创新催化剂策略。本文为电催化剂和系统的合理设计提供了框架，推动NO3RR在氮循环中的进展。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/slct.202505015","t":"Optimized Co–Ni–Ce–Al Multimetallic Catalyst for Efficient Ammonia Decomposition to Green Hydrogen","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/slct.202505015","s":"ChemistrySelect","d":"2025-11-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The rising interest in the use of ammonia as a long‐distance hydrogen carrier urges the development of efficient catalysts for its conversion to hydrogen (H 2 ). A highly active multimetallic Co‐Ni‐Ce‐Al catalyst for ammonia decomposition was synthesized via co‐precipitation of these four metals under reflux conditions. The catalytic activity was evaluated in a laboratory reactor using undiluted ammonia feed at atmospheric pressure in a temperature window of 300–600 °C. Systematic variation of the metal molar ratios identified a Co/(Co+Ni) atomic ratio of 0.3 and a Ce/(Al+Ce) ratio of 0.14 to be optimal, achieving 93% ammonia conversion at a temperature as low as 500 °C with a WHSV of 4 h −1 . The catalyst synthesized via co‐precipitation outperformed counterparts synthesized via conventional impregnation methods using alumina and ceria‐alumina supports. This activity enhancemen","au":["Frea Van Steenweghen","Annabel Verschueren","Matthew V. Hickson","Lander Hollevoet","Bert Sels","Christine Kirschhock"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"优化的Co-Ni-Ce-Al多金属催化剂用于高效氨分解为绿色氢","zb":"研究对象为高效催化剂将氨（NH3）分解为氢（H2），以利用氨作为长距离氢载体。通过共沉淀法合成Co-Ni-Ce-Al多金属催化剂，在回流条件下将四种金属共沉淀。在实验室反应器中，使用未稀释的氨原料，在常压和300–600 °C的温度窗口下评估催化活性。系统改变金属摩尔比，确定Co/(Co+Ni)原子比为0.3，Ce/(Al+Ce)比为0.14为最佳，在500 °C时氨转化率达93%，重量时空速（WHSV）为4 h −1 。通过共沉淀法合成的催化剂优于使用氧化铝和二氧化铈-氧化铝载体通过传统浸渍法合成的类似物。活性增强归因于多元素共沉淀形成的更紧密界面和钴、镍与二氧化铈之间改进的电子相互作用，如H2-TPR和STEM-EDS表征所示。研究结果强调了催化剂制备技术的重要性。Co-Ni-Ce-Al催化剂为钌催化剂提供了一种可扩展、经济的替代方案，支持通过氨分解进行可持续的氢生产。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系｜表征温程（TPR/TPD/TPO 等，不等于反应供热）"},{"id":"10.1002/adom.202502759","t":"Solar‐Driven Photocatalytic N 2 Reduction to Ammonia Using Plasmonic Au@NiZIF‐8 MOF Hybrids","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adom.202502759","s":"Advanced Optical Materials","d":"2025-11-17","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Photocatalytic ammonia synthesis has emerged as a sustainable alternative to the fossil‐fuel‐dependent industrial Haber‐Bosch process, utilizing solar energy to convert atmospheric nitrogen and water into NH 3 under mild conditions. While this method significantly reduces CO 2 emissions, it faces challenges such as low nitrogen solubility in water and competition with the hydrogen evolution reaction, which hinder its efficiency and scalability. Here, a core‐shell approach is employed to incorporate controlled‐morphology plasmonic gold nanoparticles (AuNPs) into Ni‐doped ZIF‐8 metal‐organic frameworks (MOF S ), forming a hybrid photocatalyst. In this design, AuNPs serve as the core, while the NiZIF‐8 shell prevents nanoparticle agglomeration and facilitates enhanced nitrogen and proton transport to the AuNP surface during illumination. The Au@NiZIF‐8 photocatalyst outperforms NiZ","au":["Belén Arjones‐Fernández","Ankur Malik","Lucía Guillade","Rudranarayan Khatua","Lucas V. Besteiro","Ana Sousa‐Castillo"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"太阳能驱动光催化氮还原为氨使用等离子体Au@NiZIF-8 MOF杂化材料","zb":"研究对象为光催化氨合成，利用太阳能将大气氮和水在温和条件下转化为氨（NH3），作为依赖化石燃料的工业哈伯-博施过程的可持续替代方案。该方法显著减少CO2排放，但面临氮在水中的溶解度低和与析氢反应竞争等挑战，阻碍其效率和规模化。本研究采用核壳法将可控形貌的等离子体金纳米粒子（AuNPs）结合到Ni掺杂的ZIF-8金属有机框架（MOF S）中，形成杂化光催化剂。设计中，AuNPs作为核心，NiZIF-8壳防止纳米粒子团聚，并在光照期间促进氮和质子传输到AuNP表面。Au@NiZIF-8光催化剂优于单独的NiZIF-8，得益于改进的电子转移、能量迁移和局域场极化。这些协同效应增强氮活化并稳定反应中间体，显著提高催化效率和选择性。此外，催化活性在三个连续循环中保持稳定。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1093/nsr/nwaf508","t":"Piezocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia in seawater","u":"https://doi.org/10.1093/nsr/nwaf508","s":"National Science Review","d":"2025-11-14","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"ABSTRACT The renewable-energy-driven conversion of nitrate in seawater into ammonia ions (NH4+) is a promising strategy for concurrent marine environmental remediation and sustainable chemical production. Herein, a seawater piezocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NitRR) is demonstrated for efficient NH4+ production by employing MnPS3 nanosheets (NSs) as a new type of piezocatalyst. It is shown that the Mn and P dual sites promote the adsorption and activation of NO3− ions via an asymmetric side-on mode. Moreover, the lattice strain of MnPS3 NSs induced by the external mechanical vibration further weakens the N–O bond. With the additional contribution of the active hydrogen supplied by the S sites, the MnPS3 NSs exhibit an NH4+ production rate of 2.75 mmol h−1 g−1 in simulated seawater without sacrificial agents. By utilizing the mechanical energy of water flow in real seawater, the co","au":["Zhijie Li","Chaoqi Zhang","Yamin Xi","Yingying Zou","Tong Bao","Yingxuan Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"海水压电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"利用可再生能源将海水中的硝酸盐转化为氨离子（NH4+）是一种兼顾海洋环境治理和可持续化学生产的有前景策略。本文采用MnPS3纳米片（NSs）作为新型压电催化剂，实现了海水压电催化硝酸盐还原反应（NitRR），高效生产NH4+。研究表明，Mn和P双位点通过非对称侧向模式促进NO3−离子的吸附和活化。此外，MnPS3 NSs的晶格应变在外部机械振动下进一步削弱了N–O键。S位点提供的活性氢的额外贡献，使MnPS3 NSs在模拟海水中（无牺牲剂）表现出2.75 mmol h−1 g−1的NH4+产率。通过利用真实海水中水流机械能，实现了120分钟内NO3−以95.0%的转化率和96.4%的选择性连续转化为NH4+。该工作为通过可再生自然能将海水中的硝酸盐转化为高附加值化学品开辟了道路。","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202509113","t":"Single‐Site Polyoxometalate Complexes with Engineered Electron Channels for Efficient Electrocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis from Nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202509113","s":"Small","d":"2025-11-14","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia (ENRA) is a sustainable approach for the electrosynthesis of ammonia (NH 3 ) and the purification of wastewater. Herein, three polyoxometalate‐based (POM‐based) mononuclear complexes, namely [M(HNCP) 2 (H 2 O)][PW 12 O 40 ]·H 2 O (HNCP = 4‐(1H‐imidazo[4,5‐f][1,10]phenanthrolin‐2‐yl)benzoic acid; M = Ni, Co, Zn, referred to as M‐PW 12 ), that feature atomically dispersed metal sites are prepared. Among them, Ni‐PW 12 exhibits outstanding ENRA performance, with a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 90.3% and an NH 3 yield rate of 11.2 mg h −1 mg cat. −1 at −1.3 V versus reversible hydrogen electrode (RHE). An in‐depth computational study reveals that directional electron transfer from the POM cluster to the metal center diminishes the energy barrier associated with the rate‐determining step ( * N → * NH) and improves protonation energetics alon","au":["Qiushuang Jiang","Xinming Wang","Gang Li","Nan Zhao","Haijun Pang","Huiyuan Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"具有工程化电子通道的单位点多金属氧酸盐配合物用于高效电催化硝酸盐合成氨","zb":"电化学硝酸盐还原为氨（ENRA）是一种可持续的氨电合成和废水净化方法。本文制备了三种基于多金属氧酸盐（POM）的单核配合物，即[M(HNCP)2(H2O)][PW12O40]·H2O (HNCP = 4-(1H-咪唑[4,5-f][1,10]菲咯啉-2-基)苯甲酸；M = Ni, Co, Zn，称为M-PW12)，其具有原子分散的金属位点。其中Ni-PW12表现出优异的ENRA性能，在-1.3 V vs RHE下，法拉第效率（FE）为90.3%，氨产率速率为11.2 mg h−1 mg cat−1。深入的计算研究表明，POM簇到金属中心的定向电子转移降低了决速步骤（*N → *NH）的能量势垒，并改善了NO3−到NH3途径中的质子化能学。该研究表明，通过POM-金属杂化系统进行电子转移工程，与纯POM催化剂相比，氨FE提高了24.1–39.3%。核心机理在于POM和金属组分之间的电子转移效","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.202517293","t":"Holistic Recovery of Spent Lithium‐Ion Batteries by Flash Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.202517293","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2025-11-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":30,"ab":"Abstract The rising demand for lithium‐ion batteries (LIBs) highlights the urgent need for sustainable recycling technologies. Existing pyrometallurgy and hydrometallurgy methods can recover valuable metals but suffer from high energy costs and wastewater generation. Here, a selective flash Joule heating chlorination and oxidation (FJH‐ClO) strategy is presented for the efficient separation of metals from spent batteries. In this process, cathode metals are first chlorinated for 60 s, after which the transition metal chlorides are oxidized to oxides, enabling lithium to be separated from transition metals due to their different aqueous solubility. This approach applies not only to the recovery of metals from lithium cobalt oxide (LCO), lithium iron phosphate (LFP), and lithium manganese iron phosphate (LMFP) cathode materials, but also to the anodic graphite, all from the black mass. The","au":["Shichen Xu","Justin Sharp","Qiming Liu","Jaeho Shin","Haoxin Ye","Kaiwen Yang"],"o":"回填","w":["James M. Tour"],"why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"整体回收废旧锂离子电池","zb":"针对锂离子电池（LIBs）回收的迫切需求，提出一种选择性焦耳热氯化氧化（FJH‐ClO）策略，通过瞬时高温分离电池中的金属。该方法首先对正极金属进行60秒氯化，然后将过渡金属氯化物氧化成氧化物，利用锂和过渡金属在水中溶解度的差异实现分离。适用于从钴酸锂（LCO）、磷酸铁锂（LFP）和锰铁磷酸锂（LMFP）正极材料及石墨负极中回收金属，石墨纯度≈100%，产率85%；钴纯度99%，产率97%；锂纯度99%，产率92%。克级实验验证了该方法的可扩展性，与传统方法相比，能显著降低能耗、操作时间和试剂消耗，操作成本降低高达92%。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202522410","t":"Gradient Adsorption Energy Strategy Unlocks Ultra‐Long Stability and Efficient Electrocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis from Nitrate Over CoP/Cu 3 P","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202522410","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-11-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Electrocatalytic nitrate (NO 3 − ) reduction to ammonia (NRA) is an important approach for achieving both ammonia synthesis and wastewater treatment. However, its multi‐step proton‐electron transfer process and the difficulty in synergistically regulating the adsorption energy of intermediates limit the reaction efficiency. In this study, a self‐supported CoP/Cu 3 P composite nanotube array electrode (CoP/Cu 3 P‐CF) was fabricated on copper foam through in situ growth and phosphidation. By precisely regulating synergistic catalytic sites for multiple elementary reactions, the catalyst simultaneously enhances both adsorption and desorption processes through a gradient adsorption energy strategy. The catalyst utilizes the synergistic effect of Cu and Co dual sites to enhance the adsorption and conversion of NO 3 − and the directed transformation of *NO 2 intermediates to NH 3 , re","au":["Hui Xu","Jinghuan Peng","Peiquan Li","Xichen Feng","Jinwu Hu","Guanjie Han"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"梯度吸附能策略解锁CoP/Cu3P上超长稳定性和高效电催化硝酸盐合成氨","zb":"电催化硝酸盐（NO3−）还原为氨（NRA）是实现氨合成和废水处理的重要方法。然而，其多步质子-电子转移过程以及难以协同调节中间体吸附能的困难限制了反应效率。本研究通过原位生长和磷化在铜泡沫上制备了自支撑的CoP/Cu3P复合纳米管阵列电极（CoP/Cu3P-CF）。通过精确调节多步基元反应的协同催化位点，该催化剂通过梯度吸附能策略同时增强了吸附和解吸过程。该催化剂利用Cu和Co双位点的协同效应，增强了NO3−的吸附和转化，以及*NO2中间体的定向转化为NH3，而P原子作为电子转移桥梁促进电荷传输。在-0.3 V vs RHE下，其实现了1.59 mmol h−1的优异氨产率，法拉第效率为96.35%。CoP和Cu3P之间的强界面相互作用有效抑制了结构重建，使催化剂在150小时稳定运行而无显著性能降解。凯尔文探针力显微镜和原位表征证实了有利于多位点协同催化的宽吸附能分布。该研究为高活性NRA","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta07512b","t":"Recent advances in the application of transition metal-based catalysts in electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis and C–N bond formation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta07512b","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-11-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This review outlines the progress and challenges of transition metal electrocatalysts in C–N coupling from N-sources like N 2 and NO x − , emphasizing the need for mechanistic studies and improved stability.","au":["Shanmei Tu","Jin Li","Tianxing Wu","Xiujing Xing","Wei Xiong","Hao Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"过渡金属基催化剂在电催化氨合成和C–N键形成中的应用最新进展","zb":"概述了过渡金属电催化剂在利用N2和NOx-等氮源进行C-N偶联方面的进展与挑战，强调了机理研究和提高稳定性的必要性。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta06955f","t":"Insight into multivalent iron complex-bound oxygen vacancy-rich BiOBr nanodiscs for photocatalytic ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta06955f","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-11-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Multivalent Fe atoms attached to OV-rich 2D-BiOBr nanodiscs have been fabricated and utilized for photocatalytic NH 3 production from N 2 . The role of active sites and OVs has been clearly investigated by experimental and computational studies.","au":["Vinay Kumar Sriramadasu","Himani Joshi","Ibamerisha Lyngdoh","Naveen Sharma","Srimanta Pakhira","Santanu Bhattacharyya"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"多价铁配合物结合的富氧空位BiOBr纳米圆盘用于光催化氨合成的机理研究","zb":"制备了结合在富氧空位2D-BiOBr纳米圆盘上的多价Fe原子并用于光催化N2合成NH3，通过实验和计算研究阐明了活性位点与氧空位的作用。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Fe/铁体系｜光驱动"},{"id":"10.1038/s44160-025-00933-1","t":"Catalytic Joule heating synthesis of one-dimensional nanomaterials in seconds","u":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s44160-025-00933-1","s":"Nature Synthesis","d":"2025-11-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"","au":["Jian Sheng","Yifan Xu","Zhen Han","Sida Sun","Xinrui Zhang","Chi Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"催化焦耳热秒级合成一维纳米材料","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","bt":1,"top":1},{"id":"10.1002/cey2.70119","t":"Review of Flash Joule Heating for the Synthesis of Graphene and Other Functional Carbon Materials","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cey2.70119","s":"Carbon Energy","d":"2025-11-12","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"ABSTRACT Flash Joule heating (FJH), as a high‐efficiency and low‐energy consumption technology for advanced materials synthesis, has shown significant potential in the synthesis of graphene and other functional carbon materials. Based on the Joule effect, the solid carbon sources can be rapidly heated to ultra‐high temperatures (> 3000 K) through instantaneous high‐energy current pulses during FJH, thus driving the rapid rearrangement and graphitization of carbon atoms. This technology demonstrates numerous advantages, such as solvent‐ and catalyst‐free features, high energy conversion efficiency, and a short process cycle. In this review, we have systematically summarized the technology principle and equipment design for FJH, as well as its raw materials selection and pretreatment strategies. The research progress in the FJH synthesis of flash graphene, carbon nanotubes, graphene fibers","au":["Zhiwu Tan","Faisal Mahmood","Mengzhen Tian","Yimeng Li","Qingfa Zhang","Zhong Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"焦耳热合成石墨烯及其他功能碳材料的综述","zb":"焦耳热（FJH）是一种高效低能耗的先进材料合成技术，在石墨烯和其他功能碳材料合成中显示出巨大潜力。通过瞬时高能电流脉冲，将固体碳源快速加热至>3000 K，驱动碳原子快速重排和石墨化。该技术具有溶剂和催化剂-free、高能量转换效率、短工艺周期等优点。综述了FJH的技术原理、设备设计、原料选择和预处理策略，以及其在合成闪速石墨烯、碳纳米管、石墨烯纤维和阳极硬碳等方面的研究进展。通过调节FJH的操作参数（如闪速电压和时间），可精确优化碳材料的微观结构（如турбостратический石墨烯的层间距、缺陷浓度和杂原子掺杂），提升其在复合材料增强、金属离子电池电极、超级电容器和电催化剂等领域的性能。该技术仍面临工艺产率低、宏观材料均匀性差和绿色电源系统构建等挑战，需要更多研究推动其从实验室向工业规模应用转型。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.5c04589","t":"Manipulating Local Electron Density of Fe Nanoclusters with Cerium Incorporation to Optimize Adsorption Behavior of N-Related Intermediates for Electrochemical Ammonia Synthesis from Nitrite","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.5c04589","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2025-11-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Cluster-scale metal ensembles feature high atomic utilization characteristics, but their activity and selectivity toward the electrocatalytic nitrite reduction reaction (NO2RR) remain suboptimal. As conventional holders of 4f orbitals, rare earth elements, especially cerium, are drawing wide attention as efficient promoters for transition-metal-based materials. Herein, Ce is incorporated into the Fe nanocluster to manipulate its local electron density for efficient NO2RR. The presence of Ce with a unique 4f subshell electron configuration effectively withdraws electrons from the outmost 3d orbitals of adjacent Fe, an electronic modulation likely attributable to the pronounced lanthanide contraction effect. Consequently, the energy level of Fe 3d orbital electrons is shifted closer to the Fermi level, thereby promoting stronger adsorption and stabilization of N-related intermediates, as d","au":["Wenjun Shi","Yutong Zhu","Sisi Liu","Yunfei Huan","Weiyi Shen","Xiaolei Yuan"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过铈掺杂调控铁纳米团簇的局部电子密度以优化N相关中间体的吸附行为用于硝rite电化学合成氨","zb":"研究对象为Ce掺杂的Fe纳米团簇，采用原子层沉积法制备，通过闪蒸焦耳热处理，结合多种原位表征技术研究其对电化学硝rite还原反应（NO2RR）的催化性能。Ce掺杂能有效调控Fe纳米团簇的局部电子密度，使Fe 3d轨道电子能量更接近费米能级，从而增强N相关中间体的吸附和稳定性。优化后的Ce-Fe团簇催化剂在NO2RR中实现了116.59 mg h-1 mg-1的NH3产率率和96.46%的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.34178/jbth.v8i4.531","t":"Bibliometric Analysis on the Joint Application of Core-Shell Catalysts and Atomic Layer Deposition in Solide Oxide Fuel Cells","u":"https://doi.org/10.34178/jbth.v8i4.531","s":"JOURNAL OF BIOENGINEERING, TECHNOLOGIES AND HEALTH","d":"2025-11-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This study presents a bibliometric analysis of the scientific output between 2010 and 2025 related to solid oxide fuel cells (SOFC), atomic layer deposition (ALD), and core-shell catalysts. Based on Scopus database records processed using the Bibliometrix R tool, various combinations of these themes were evaluated to map publications, authors, institutions, collaboration networks, geographic distribution, gaps, and emerging trends. The results indicate that the association between ALD and core-shell structures already constitutes a consolidated field, with the highest volume of publications. At the same time, approaches directly involving SOFCs remain in an emerging stage. Although no studies were found that integrate ALD, core-shell catalysts, and SOFC simultaneously, the qualitative indicators observed in the individual analyses suggest a significant gap and a promising, specialized re","au":["Iuri Dantas Passos da Mota","Marcos Makoto Toyama","Gerhard Ett","Lilian Lefol Nani Guarieiro"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"核壳催化剂与原子层沉积在固体氧化物燃料电池中联合应用的文献计量分析","zb":"对2010年至2025年固体氧化物燃料电池（SOFC）、原子层沉积（ALD）和核壳催化剂相关科学产出的文献计量分析。基于Scopus数据库记录，使用Bibliometrix R工具处理，评估了这些主题的各种组合，以绘制出版物、作者、机构、合作网络、地理分布、空白和新兴趋势。结果表明，ALD与核壳结构的关联已构成一个成熟领域，出版物数量最多。同时，直接涉及SOFC的方法仍处于新兴阶段。尽管未发现同时集成ALD、核壳催化剂和SOFC的研究，但个体分析中的定性指标表明存在显著空白和有前景的专业研究领域。观察到亚洲和北美国家（如中国、韩国和美国）占主导地位，突出了这些国家在先进能源技术发展中的战略作用。总体而言，结合这些方法可能推动更高效和可持续能源系统的发展。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-tgkdj-v2","t":"Turning Up the Heat: Wireless Induction Heating for Multi-Temperature Microscale Reactions","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-tgkdj-v2","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-11-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This manuscript introduces a novel induction heating platform designed to enable multiplexed temperature screen for microscale high-throughput reactions through remote, wireless heating in multi-well plates. This approach employs metal balls within the wells to efficiently convert surrounding electromagnetic energy into localized heat, overcoming limitations associated with conventional heating methods. By leveraging induction energy, the platform facilitates rapid, uniform heating at the reaction site, thereby allowing for optimal conditions across a broad range of chemical reactions. This system addresses common challenges of traditional hotplate heating of plastic well plates, such as uneven temperature distribution and material degradation, and offers a scalable solution suited to contemporary chemistries that demand accurate temperature control. Experimental validation using three s","au":["Noah Tu","Emma Clay-Barbour","Mary Bellizzi"],"o":"回填","why":["Induction Heating"],"zt":"加热：无线感应加热用于多温度微尺度反应","zb":"介绍了一种新型感应加热平台，通过远程无线加热在多孔板中实现微尺度高通量反应的多温度筛选。该方法在孔中使用金属球高效地将周围电磁能转化为局部热量，克服了传统加热方法的局限性。利用感应能量，平台可在反应位点实现快速均匀加热，从而为广泛化学反应提供最佳条件。该系统解决了传统塑料孔板加热的均匀温度分布和材料降解等问题，提供了一种适用于需要精确温度控制的现代化学的、可扩展的解决方案。实验验证了该平台的有效性和可靠性，在不同感应功率设置下实现了快速稳定的温度控制。关键发现表明了有效的能量转换，金属球数量和感应功率与实现温度之间的正比关系，以及反应过程中的均匀加热。该创新使单次筛选运行中能在高通量实验（HTE）工作流程中进行温度优化，无需多个特定温度的孔板，从而提高工艺通量并减少实验延迟。此外，三功能金属球（作为加热剂、精确试剂输送载体和有效搅拌器）展示了ChemBead-based HTE的多功能性。","pre":1},{"id":"10.1116/6.0004888","t":"Kinetic analysis and steric-hindrance effects in thermal atomic layer deposition of high-purity cobalt films with dicobalt hexacarbonyl tert-butylacetylene as the precursor","u":"https://doi.org/10.1116/6.0004888","s":"Journal of Vacuum Science & Technology A","d":"2025-11-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Thermal atomic layer deposition of cobalt (Co) using dicobalt hexacarbonyl tert-butylacetylene (CCTBA) and H2 was investigated for application as an interconnect material in ultra-large-scale integrated circuits. In this study, H2 reduction conditions were optimized to obtain Co thin films with high purity and low resistivity. The effects of H2 partial pressure and supply time on the chemical composition and resistivity were systematically analyzed. The growth per cycle (GPC) was evaluated by varying the CCTBA supply time, and self-limiting behavior was observed. The saturated GPC was 0.018 nm/cycle, which is lower than previously reported values due to a carbon impurity reduction. This corresponds to approximately 0.088 monolayers, attributed to the steric hindrance effect (SHE) of CCTBA adsorption. The SHE was analyzed by combining density functional theory-calculated adsorption struct","au":["Jun Yamaguchi","Noboru Sato","Naoki Tamaoki","Atsuhiro Tsukune","Takeshi Momose","Yukihiro Shimogaki"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"热原子层沉积高纯度钴薄膜的动力学分析与空间位阻效应","zb":"研究了使用二钴六羰基丁基乙炔（CCTBA）和H2进行热原子层沉积钴（Co）薄膜，应用于超大规模集成电路中的互连材料。优化了H2还原条件，获得高纯度低电阻率的Co薄膜。系统分析了H2分压和供应时间对化学成分和电阻率的影响。通过改变CCTBA供应时间评估了每周期生长量（GPC），观察到自限制行为，饱和GPC为0.018 nm/cycle，低于先前报道值，归因于碳杂质减少。对应约0.088单层，归因于CCTBA吸附的空间位阻效应（SHE）。通过结合密度泛函理论计算的吸附结构与随机顺序吸附模拟，分析了SHE，结果与实验值吻合良好。100 °C时CCTBA吸附概率为1.3 × 10−4。在深沟结构（深宽比9.7）上实现了 conformal 薄膜生长。碳杂质浓度随H2供应增加而减少，在H2压力555 Pa、供应时间20 s下，获得99% Co和1% C的成分。100 °C时吸附CCTBA表面还原反应","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-2zdsw","t":"The Interaction of Hydrogen with Iron under High Pressure and Temperature","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-2zdsw","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-11-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Adsorbed hydrogen (Had) plays a critical role in Fe-catalyzed processes such as the synthesis of ammonia. We have developed a constant-pressure molecular dynamics simulations to investigate the interaction of a dense hot hydrogen gas with the (110) iron surface at the operando conditions of pressures above 150 bar and temperatures larger than 700 K. In order to carry out this study, we have constructed a machine learning potential that is able to describe with ab initio accuracy the chemical processes that take place in this system. The Fe(110) surface, chosen for this study, is the most stable one and it is believed to be catalytically relevant. Upon impinging on the surface, the H2 molecule can dissociate and in turn the Had atoms can diffuse, recombine and eventually return to the gas-phase. At operando conditions, a dynamical equilibrium between all these processes is established, le","au":["Giulia M. Bovolenta","Michele Parrinello"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of ammonia"],"zt":"氢与铁在高压高温下的相互作用","zb":"研究氢在高压高温下与铁表面的相互作用。采用恒压分子动力学模拟，研究了密度高温氢气与(110)铁表面的相互作用，压力高于150 bar，温度大于700 K。构建了机器学习势能，描述了该系统中的化学过程。结果表明，H2分子在表面解离，Had原子扩散、重组并最终返回气相，建立了动态平衡，氢覆盖度保持在饱和以下，减少了共反应物吸附的抑制。Had原子在表面高度移动，偶尔进行短暂的亚表面迁移。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","pre":1},{"id":"10.5006/m2025_00104","t":"Modelling of Ammonia Cracking for Low-Carbon Hydrogen Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.5006/m2025_00104","s":"MECC 2025","d":"2025-11-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia is considered to be a promising hydrogen carrier as it comprises of 17.8 wt% of hydrogen and enables its transfer over long distances at lower costs. In efforts of optimizing the process of back-cracking ammonia to hydrogen, this study focuses on energy efficiency and conversion for ammonia cracking unit. In this study, a process model is developed for the Ammonia Cracking process to produce low-carbon hydrogen based on the Peng-Robinson equation of state. The model comprises ammonia furnace along with accessory equipment such as ammonia pump, coolers, heaters, PSA (Pressure Swing Adsorption) and Hydrogen Compressor. The variation of ammonia conversion and energy efficiency are evaluated data against the different operating pressure and temperature. In cracking process, ammonia conversion is favored by high temperature and moderate pressures. High pressure decreases the ","au":["Bandar H Solami","AbdulRahman AlSuhaibani","Sung Ho (Colin) Kim","Mohammed Albuali","Osamah Siddiqui"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Cracking"],"zt":"用于低碳氢生产的氨分解建模","zb":"基于Peng-Robinson状态方程建立了氨分解过程模型，评估了不同操作压力和温度下的氨转化率和能量效率，在650~700°C下记录了高达99%的氨转化率。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.5c12610","t":"Membrane Reactors for Ammonia Production: Insights into Ammonia-Separative Membranes, Synthesis Catalysts, and Their Integration","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.5c12610","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2025-11-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":36,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) is one of the most widely demanded industrial chemicals, with its synthesis currently dominated by the Haber-Bosch process. Although the reaction is thermodynamically favorable at high pressures and low temperatures, it faces challenges: high pressures require costly infrastructure and energy input, while low temperatures result in slow reaction kinetics. Beyond thermodynamic considerations, high pressures are required to liquefy the NH3 product stream, a practical necessity to separate NH3 by condensation. Membrane reactors, which integrate chemical reaction and selective separation in a single unit, offer a promising approach to overcome these limitations by selectively removing products (e.g., NH3) to drive the reaction forward and permit product separation at lower pressures. This review aims to advance the field of NH3-separative membrane reactors for energy efficient ","au":["Genevieve Yarema","Ji Yang","Akash Warty","Zixiao Liu","Liangbing Hu","Dongxia Liu"],"o":"回填","w":["Liangbing Hu"],"why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"氨生产膜反应器：氨分离膜、合成催化剂及其集成","zb":"膜反应器通过选择性移除氨产物来驱动反应并降低分离压力。综述总结了氨分离膜与合成催化剂的发展历史、集成策略及材料创新。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1002/cmtd.202500105","t":"Spectroscopic Reactor for Operando Investigations Made by Additive Manufacturing for High‐Pressure Catalysis Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cmtd.202500105","s":"Chemistry–Methods","d":"2025-11-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"Knowledge‐based catalyst design requires the identification of the active structure during reaction, i.e., by operando spectroscopy, and at different conversion levels. However, for reactions that run at elevated pressure, such as methanol, Fischer–Tropsch, or ammonia synthesis, obtaining spectroscopic data at realistic conditions remains a major challenge. In particular, standard operando setups often fail to replicate the high‐pressure, high‐conversion regimes relevant to industrial processes. This requires specially designed reactors, and here, how additive manufacturing enables the development of spectroscopic reactors for operando studies of catalysts under high‐pressure conditions at different conversion levels up to equilibrium is reported. The reactor has two consecutive zones with independent temperature control and individual catalyst loading. An X‐ray‐transparent window in the","au":["Mariam L. Schulte","Vera Truttmann","Lorena Baumgarten","Alexander G. Nicolai","Diego A. Montalvo Beltran","Florian J. Summ"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于高压催化应用的增材制造光谱反应器","zb":"报道了一种由增材制造的光谱反应器，用于高压条件下催化剂的在线研究。反应器具有两个独立温控和催化剂负载的连续区域，后区域有一个X射线透明窗口，允许空间分辨的光谱监测催化剂结构。在同步辐射源上构建了移动装置，并在Cu/ZnO/ZrO2催化剂在CO2加氢制甲醇过程中的在线X射线吸收光谱研究中证明了反应器的功能。双区设计模拟了催化剂床末端环境，包括冷凝，这对工业相关性至关重要，但在传统在线实验中难以实现。"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.202516937","t":"Multiply Nano‐Twinned Copper as a “Dual‐Site Cooperative” Catalyst for Enhanced Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.202516937","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2025-11-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract To advance the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NIRR) to ammonia, it is essential to rationally regulate the kinetics of active hydrogen (H * ). Nevertheless, an in‐depth understanding of H * generation, transfer, and utilization remains elusive, which impedes exploring strategies for optimizing H * dynamics. In this study, a copper nanocrystalline is developed with a multiply nano‐twinned structure (MNTs‐Cu) using a “dual nonequilibrium” strategy to optimize H * dynamics and enhance NIRR performance. Experimental and theoretical studies show that MNTs‐Cu functions as a “dual‐site cooperative” catalyst, addressing the H * supply‐consumption balance to boost ammonia electrosynthesis. Specifically, the Cu sites are responsible for the activation of nitrate, while the nano‐twinned structure serves as an “active hydrogen hub” to facilitate the generation, transfer, and u","au":["Xuebiao Ji","Riming Hu","Jiawei Li","Heng Zhao","Xin Liu","Kai Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"多重纳米孪晶铜作为“双位点协同”催化剂用于增强电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为具有多重纳米孪晶结构（MNTs-Cu）的铜纳米晶体，采用“双非平衡”策略制备，通过实验和理论研究表明MNTs-Cu作为“双位点协同”催化剂，通过调控活性氢（H*）的动力学增强硝酸盐还原反应（NIRR）性能。Cu位点负责硝酸盐活化，而纳米孪晶结构作为“活性氢中心”促进H*的产生、转移和利用。MNTs-Cu催化剂在-0.7 V vs RHE下实现了112.03 mg h-1 cm-2的NH3产率，且在-0.7至-0.9 V vs RHE的高电位范围内持续保持>99%的NH3法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-bzz37-v2","t":"Continuous ammonia electrosynthesis from nitrogen and water from a membrane-based flow cell","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-bzz37-v2","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-11-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Continuous electrochemical lithium-mediated ammonia production has shown promising performance. For this reaction, using protons generated from water oxidation would provide a direct route for proton supply, eliminating the need to generate molecular hydrogen. However, recent studies reported low Faradaic efficiency to ammonia when using water directly as a proton source. In this work, we integrate an electrically isolated Pd membrane to transfer protons generated from water oxidation into a non-aqueous lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction system. By employing Pd as a proton- and electron-conducting membrane rather than solely as a cathode, we enabled continuous operation in a flow-cell configuration, achieving a Faradaic efficiency of 40 ± 3% at a current density of –6 mA cm⁻² over 6 hours. Operando mass spectrometry confirmed that the produced ammonia contained protons generated by wate","au":["Boxi Ye","Craig Burdis","Vladislav Mints","Yuxiang Zhou","Artem Khobnya","Guanglei Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于膜式流动电池的氮和水连续氨电合成","zb":"研究对象为电化学锂介导的氨生产，关键方法为集成电隔离的 Pd 膜将水氧化产生的质子传输到非水锂介导的氮还原系统中，实现连续操作，Faradaic 效率为 40 ± 3%，电流密度为 –6 mA cm⁻²，持续 6 小时。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pre":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta06140g","t":"Modulating catalyst surface wettability to boost electrochemical ammonia synthesis under ambient conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta06140g","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-11-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Engineered hydrophobic–hydrophilic regions tune catalyst wettability to control the triple-phase boundary, promoting N 2 adsorption while limiting proton transport. This enhances NRR selectivity and suppresses competing HER.","au":["Nilam Qureshi","Krishnan Ravi","Jun Ho Shim"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"调节催化剂表面润湿性以在环境条件下提升电化学氨合成","zb":"通过工程化疏水-亲水区域调节催化剂润湿性，控制三相边界，促进N2吸附，同时限制质子传输，从而增强氮还原反应（NRR）的选择性并抑制竞争的析氢反应（HER）。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s12209-025-00451-3","t":"Nitrogen-Doped Metal Organic Frameworks for Boosting Photocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s12209-025-00451-3","s":"Transactions of Tianjin University","d":"2025-11-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The efficiency of photocatalytic ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis is severely limited by the extremely difficult activation of N 2 owing to its high N≡N triple bond energy. To address this challenge, we propose an N-doping strategy to facilitate the N 2 activation. Our strategy involves optimizing the electronic structure of the metal active sites by modulating the coordination element. First, we introduce five different N-coordination ligands with distinct steric hindrances and N electron densities (2-methylimidazole (MI), isoindolin-1-one (II), 1,2-benzisothiazolin-3-one (BIT), benzo[d]isoxazol-3-ol (BIX), and terephthalamide (TA)) into an amino-functionalized metal–organic framework (MOF), NH 2 -MIL-68 (NM), to construct the N-coordination via the partial replacement of the O-coordination in the metal clusters. Electrochemical impedance spectroscopy and photocurrent analysis demonst","au":["Yonghui Shi","Yongqi Liu","Qian Li","Hongxiang Liu","Dong Yang","Zhongyi Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"氮掺杂金属有机框架用于提升光催化氨合成","zb":"研究对象为氮掺杂的金属有机框架（MOF），通过将五种不同的N配位配体（2-甲基咪唑、异吲哚啉-1-酮、1,2-苯并噻唑啉-3-酮、苯并[d]异噁唑-3-醇和对苯甲酰胺）引入氨基功能化的MIL-68（NM）中构建N配位，部分取代金属团簇中的O配位。N掺杂增强电子转移和载流子分离，其中中等尺寸和空间位阻的配体（异吲哚啉-1-酮、1,2-苯并噻唑啉-3-酮和苯并[d]异噁唑-3-醇）比小尺寸（2-甲基咪唑）或大尺寸（对苯甲酰胺）配体更有效地提升载流子分离效率。NM-0.5BIT（其中N具有中等电子密度）表现出最强的载流子分离能力，并实现175.5 μmol g-1 h-1的NH3产率。","ob":"光催化固氮｜光驱动","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202509924","t":"MXene‐Based Catalysts for Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202509924","s":"Small","d":"2025-11-10","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH 3 ) is a key raw material for fertilizer production, as well as an emerging clean energy source. Presently, the current principal strategy for industrial NH 3 production is the Haber–Bosch process, which consumes energy and causes environmental problems. Because of its potential for mild reaction conditions and environmentally friendly, sustainable production, the nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) has garnered a lot of attention as an NH 3 synthesis technique. However, it has also encountered certain difficulties, such as low faradaic efficiency (FE) and low NH 3 yield rate. Therefore, developing high‐performance catalysts for the NRR has become a key objective. Transition metal carbides/nitrides/carbon nitrides (MXene) are a recently created 2D material that has a unique layered structure, a large specific surface area, high electrical conductivity, and unique physi","au":["Zhekai Song","Shiyuan Fan","Zhijie Cui","Wenchao Peng","Zhiying Wang","Jiapeng Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"用于电催化氮还原反应的MXene基催化剂","zb":"总结了MXene作为2D材料的特性及其作为NRR催化剂的发展潜力，综述了MXene基NRR催化剂的最新研究进展，并探讨了当前面临的挑战和未来发展方向。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsnano.5c07134","t":"Nanodiamond Synthesis from Coal via Flash Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsnano.5c07134","s":"ACS Nano","d":"2025-11-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":26,"ab":"As the coal industry transitions toward cleaner production, it demands advanced coal utilization strategies. Converting low-value coal into high-value nanodiamonds (NDs) is a promising approach. NDs exhibit exceptional properties with broad potential applications. NDs are typically synthesized from high-purity graphite, whereas coal serves as a lower-cost alternative. However, existing coal-based NDs (C-NDs) are synthesized in low purity and low efficiency, restricting their applicability and scalability. To address these challenges, a fluorine (F)-assisted flash Joule heating (FJH) method is developed using coke as a feedstock to synthesize C-NDs within 1 s. After post-treatment, C-NDs achieve ∼ 100% purity with an 8% yield and exhibit thermal stability comparable to commercial NDs. Theoretical calculations indicate that F atoms induce electronic rearrangement and promote the formation ","au":["Mingjin Du","Yi Cheng","Tianyou Xie","Zhiliang Yang","Shen Xi","Karla J. Silva"],"o":"回填","w":["James M. Tour"],"why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"煤基闪热法合成纳米金刚石","zb":"将低价值煤转化为高价值纳米金刚石（NDs）是一种有前景的方法。通常NDs由高纯度石墨合成，而煤是一种低成本替代品。然而，现有的煤基NDs（C-NDs）纯度和效率低。研究开发了一种氟（F）辅助的闪热法（FJH），使用焦炭作为原料，在1秒内合成C-NDs。经后处理，C-NDs纯度达~100%，产率8%，热稳定性与商业NDs相当。理论计算表明F原子诱导电子重排，促进层间C-C键形成。C-NDs作为种子晶体用于制备高质量金刚石薄膜。生命周期评估（LCA）显示，C-NDs在成本、碳排放、用水和电力使用方面优于高温高压（HPHT）法。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1002/adma.202515938","t":"Non‐Equilibrium Carbothermal Shock Upcycling: Atomically Precise Synthesis of Tailored SiC Polytypes and Novel Hybrid Graphene from Complex Composites","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adma.202515938","s":"Advanced Materials","d":"2025-11-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Abstract The complex, heterogeneous nature of challenging precursors, as seen in end‐of‐life wind turbine blades, typically comprises glass or carbon fiber‐reinforced polymer composites with polyvinyl chloride foam cores. This complexity poses a significant material synthesis challenge, particularly for achieving high‐value recovery with precise structural control. A transformative one‐step, ultrafast carbothermal shock (CTS) process is presented that selectively converts these intricate, unseparated composites into high‐value SiC polytypes or novel graphene structures. Leveraging ultrafast Joule heating, CTS enables remarkable atomic‐scale phase control, facilitating kinetic trapping of specific non‐equilibrium structures such as metastable 6H‐SiC and a unique hybrid AB‐turbostratic graphene. This unique hybrid graphene combines the high charge carrier mobility of AB‐stacked nanodomains","au":["Jing Wu","Jiadong Yu","Beikai Zhang","Duanmei Song","Lanbin Wang","Lili Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zb":"利用超快碳热冲击结合焦耳加热，将复杂复合材料转化为高价值的SiC多型体或新型AB型乱层石墨烯。该方法实现了对6H-SiC和AB-乱层石墨烯的原子级相控制，所得石墨烯具有1791 S m-1的电导率和21.8%的机械增强效果。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5nr03851k","t":"Joule-heating synthesis of Pd/C catalysts with excellent electrocatalytic performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5nr03851k","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2025-11-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"A facile solid-phase synthesis strategy that couples ball milling with rapid Joule-heating to fabricate Pd/C catalysts for high-performance electrocatalysis.","au":["Shaonan Tian","Zhenya Hu","Mengyuan Ma","Hui Liu","Jun Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-heat"],"zt":"焦耳热合成Pd/C催化剂优异电催化性能","zb":"采用球磨与快速焦耳热耦合的固相合成策略制备Pd/C催化剂，用于高性能电催化。","ob":"通用催化方法｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202504325","t":"Descriptor‐Driven Design of Dual‐Active‐Site Electrocatalysts for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202504325","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2025-11-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) offers a sustainable route to convert nitrate (NO 3 − ) pollutants into value‐added ammonia (NH 3 ). However, the NO 3 RR process still suffers from sluggish kinetics due to unfavorable NO 3 − adsorption and limited active hydrogen (*H) availability. Optimizing NO 3 − adsorption and increasing *H supply can enhance catalytic performance, yet incorporating these improvements into the rational design of high‐performance catalysts remains challenging. Here, a descriptor‐guided intermetallic design strategy is proposed that synergistically integrates NO 3 − ‐adsorbing metal sites with *H‐supplying counterparts to enhance NO 3 RR performance. Density functional theory calculations indicate that Co possesses ideal NO 3 − adsorption energy, while Ge effectively supplies *H. By constructing atomic ordered Co‐Ge intermetallic comp","au":["Chaoqun Ma","Fukai Feng","Huaifang Zhang","Gang Lin","Jing Xia","Xiaojuan Zhu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"基于描述符驱动的双活性位点电催化剂设计用于氨合成","zb":"研究对象为硝酸根还原反应，关键方法为密度泛函理论计算指导的金属间化合物设计，构建 Co-Ge 金属间化合物，其中 hexagonal Co 7 Ge 4 ( h ‐Co 7 Ge 4 ) 表现出最有利的极限电势和氨选择性，实验证实碳负载的 h ‐Co 7 Ge 4 /C 催化剂 Faradaic 效率为 97.8%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c06372","t":"Tailored Interfacial Water Kinetics Enhancing N 2 Electroreduction to Ammonia over Alkanethiol-Functionalized Iron Hollow-Fiber Penetration Electrodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c06372","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-11-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"The electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR), offering an attractive route to ammonia (NH 3 ) from dinitrogen (N 2 ) and water, has attracted substantial interest. However, conventional hydrophobic modification strategies face comprehensive challenges: effectively inhibiting the competing hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) inevitably impedes the critical proton-coupled electron transfer (PCET) steps essential for efficient NRR. Herein, we present a high-performance electrocatalyst based on alkanethiol-modified iron hollow fibers (Fe HF-C x, x = 6, 12, and 18). Significantly, the optimized Fe HF-C12 achieves water management at the interface, suppressing HER without hindering the dynamic water activity essential for proton supply during NRR. Compared to the unmodified Fe HF (3.5%, 27.1 μg h –1 cm –2 ), this distinctive interfacial design achieves a significantly improved Faradaic","au":["Tan Zhang","Zhikai Che","Yuru Song","Rui Yao","Jinping Li","Yuhan Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"通过烷硫醇功能化的铁中空纤维渗透电极的界面水动力学增强 N 2 电还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电催化氮还原反应，关键方法为烷硫醇修饰的铁中空纤维电极，优化界面水动力学，抑制析氢反应，实现 Faradaic 效率为 18.8%，氨产率 40.0 μg h –1 cm –2 。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1515/znb-2025-0061","t":"Co 6 W 6 N: mechanochemical synthesis, crystal structure, and catalytic activity for ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1515/znb-2025-0061","s":"Zeitschrift für Naturforschung B","d":"2025-11-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Co 6 W 6 N has been prepared by a mechanochemical synthesis route and characterized by energy-dispersive X-ray spectroscopy (EDX), hot gas extraction analysis, powder X-ray diffraction (XRD), and X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS). In addition, group-theoretical methods were used to demonstrate the structural relation of Co 6 W 6 N to the rock salt type. Furthermore, the catalytic activity with regard to ammonia decomposition was investigated. It was confirmed that Co 6 W 6 N remains intact during ammonia decomposition.","au":["Eva Maria Heppke","John Carl A. Camayang","Liqun Kang","Yves Kayser","Jan Folke","Sophie Hund"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"Co 6 W 6 N: 机械化学合成、晶体结构和氨分解催化活性","zb":"研究对象为 Co 6 W 6 N，关键方法为机械化学合成路线制备并表征，研究其在氨分解中的催化活性，证实 Co 6 W 6 N 在氨分解过程中保持完整。","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.72332","t":"Harnessing Surface‐Tuned Ag/Cu Interfaces in Ag/Ag 2 O/CuO for High‐Efficiency Ammonia Synthesis and Co‐Electricity Generation in Zn–Nitrate Batteries (Adv. Funct. Mater. 45/2025)","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.72332","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2025-11-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Zn–Nitrate Batteries In their Research Article (10.1002/adfm.202511876), Myong Yong Choi and co-workers reveal that the modified Ag/Cu interface in the laser-produced Ag/Ag2O/CuO electrocatalyst delivers superior nitrate reduction reaction performance, enabling simultaneous nitrite-to-ammonia conversion and electricity co-generation in a Zn–nitrite battery.","au":["Wonji Go","Raja Arumugam Senthil","Jayesh Cherusseri","Anuj Kumar","Cheol Joo Moon","Wanwisa Limphirat"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"利用 Ag/Ag2O/Cu 中表面调制的 Ag/Cu 界面实现 Zn–硝酸根电池中高效氨合成与共发电","zb":"Myong Yong Choi 等人利用激光制备的 Ag/Ag2O/Cu 电催化剂，通过表面调制的 Ag/Cu 界面显著提升了硝酸根还原反应性能，实现了 Zn–硝酸根电池中硝酸盐到氨的转化与共发电。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsmaterialsau.5c00162","t":"Boosting the Mechanical Strength and Photocatalytic Activity of 3D-Printed Titania Aerogels by Atomic Layer Deposition and Heat Treatment","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsmaterialsau.5c00162","s":"ACS Materials Au","d":"2025-11-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Titania aerogels are highly porous materials optimal for photocatalysis due to their high surface area. Further spatial structuring by 3D printing improves gas diffusion in the aerogel, leading to a higher photocatalytic activity. However, the aerogel’s mechanical properties are reduced in comparison to non-3D printed aerogels. We hereby present an approach based on atomic layer deposition (ALD) of subnanometer-thin TiO2 layers to compensate for that detrimental effect. The ALD-deposited TiO2 consists of amorphous and anatase phase, with the anatase phase likely crystallizing on the aerogel’s crystallites. Nanoindentation measurements confirm that the TiO2 ALD-coatings improve the aerogel’s mechanical properties. Additionally, it enhances the photocatalytic properties of the TiO2 aerogel, which we attribute to the increased interface area and improved interconnection of the nanoparticle ","au":["Malte M. Schmidt","Tjark L. R. Gröne","Robert Zierold","Diego Ribas Gomes","Sandra König","Michael Fröba"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积和热处理增强3D打印二氧化钛气凝胶的机械强度和光催化活性","zb":"二氧化钛气凝胶因其高表面积是光催化剂的理想材料。3D打印进一步空间结构化提高了气凝胶中的气体扩散，从而提高了光催化活性。然而，气凝胶的机械性能与非3D打印气凝胶相比有所降低。研究提出了一种基于原子层沉积（ALD）亚纳米级TiO2层的方法来补偿这种不利影响。ALD沉积的TiO2由非晶态和金红石相组成，金红石相可能在气凝胶的晶粒上结晶。纳米压痕测量证实TiO2 ALD涂层改善了气凝胶的机械性能。此外，它还增强了TiO2气凝胶的光催化性能，这归因于界面面积增加和纳米粒子网络互联改善。通过进一步的热后处理，可以完全结晶ALD沉积的TiO2，这显示出对光催化性能的补充效应，将氢气产生速率提高了一个数量级，从6.35增加到125 μmol g–1 h–1。这项工作展示了3D结构化气凝胶与ALD涂层相结合，未来可扩展到各种材料，其中机械和催化性能之间的相互作用至关重要。","ob":"析氢反应；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.29363/nanoge.iperop.2026.057","t":"Methylammonium Iodo Bismuthate Perovskite: A New Electrocatalyst for Green Ammonia Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.29363/nanoge.iperop.2026.057","s":"Proceedings of the Asia-Pacific International Conference on Perovskite, Organic Photovoltaics and Optoelectronics","d":"2025-11-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Subha Sadhu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"甲基铵碘铋钙钛矿：一种用于绿色氨生产的新的电催化剂","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-zs9vz","t":"Light-Driven Ammonia Synthesis Beyond Scaling Relations over LiH-Mediated Ru/TiN","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-zs9vz","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-11-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photothermal catalysis offers a promising route for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions, yet its performance is fundamentally limited by intrinsic scaling relations between dinitrogen activation and subsequent hydrogenation steps. Here, we overcome this longstanding constraint by introducing lithium hydride (LiH) as a dynamic “nitrogen mediator” in a Ru-LiH/TiN catalyst. Under ambient pressure and 3.3 W·cm-2 light irradiation, the Ru-LiH/TiN achieves an unprecedented ammonia production rate of 5574.3 μmol·g-1·h-1 (428.8 mmol·gRu-1·h-1), representing a 52-fold enhancement over the LiH-free Ru/TiN benchmark under illumination and 30.5 times higher than its thermal performance at 400 °C. Notably, Ru-LiH/TiN exhibits exceptional stability over 50 hours of continuous photothermal operation, in sharp contrast to its rapid deactivation observed under purely thermal conditions due to NHx poi","au":["Xibo Zhang","Fei Chang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"超越比例关系的光驱动氨合成 LiH 介导的 Ru/TiN","zb":"研究对象为光热催化氨合成，关键方法为引入锂氢化物 (LiH) 作为动态“氮介体”在 Ru-LiH/TiN 催化剂中，实现氨生产速率 5574.3 μmol·g-1·h-1，远高于无 LiH 的 Ru/TiN 催化剂，并展现 50 小时连续光热操作的稳定性。","ob":"光催化固氮；涉及Ru/钌体系｜光驱动","pre":1},{"id":"10.3390/catal15111052","t":"Platinum Nanoparticles Supported on Atomic Layer Deposited SnO2 Decorated Multiwalled Carbon Nanotubes as the Electrocatalyst for the Oxygen Reduction Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/catal15111052","s":"Catalysts","d":"2025-11-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Tin(IV) oxide (SnO2) was deposited onto acid-washed multiwalled carbon nanotubes (MWCNTs) to be used as a support for platinum nanoparticles (PtNPs). The effect of the SnO2–CNT support on the electrocatalytic activity of the PtNPs for the oxygen reduction reaction (ORR) in 0.1 M HClO4 solution was investigated. The physical characterization of the catalyst confirms the presence of Pt, Sn and C on the catalyst as well as the presence of the PtNPs on SnO2. The synthesized catalyst possesses a specific activity of 0.15 mA cm−2 at 0.9 V, while the commercial Pt/C catalyst showed a specific activity of 0.05 mA cm−2. Accelerated durability testing (ADT) was performed on both catalysts, with the synthesized PtNP/SnO2–CNT catalyst retaining over 50% of its initial electrochemically active surface area (ECSA). Thus, the results obtained in this study confirm the positive influence of SnO2-decorat","au":["Raegan Chambers","Aivar Tarre","Markus Otsus","Jekaterina Kozlova","Kaupo Kukli","Arvo Kikas"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积的SnO2修饰的多壁碳纳米管负载的铂纳米粒子作为氧还原反应电催化剂","zb":"研究对象为PtNPs/SnO2-CNT催化剂。将SnO2沉积到酸洗MWCNTs上作为PtNPs的载体，研究其对ORR的电催化活性。催化剂表征显示存在Pt、Sn和C，以及PtNPs在SnO2上。在0.1 M HClO4溶液中，该催化剂在0.9 V时的比活性为0.15 mA cm−2，高于商业Pt/C催化剂（0.05 mA cm−2）。加速耐久性测试（ADT）显示，该催化剂保留超过50%的初始电化学活性表面积（ECSA）。结果表明SnO2-CNT载体对PtNPs的ORR电催化活性和稳定性有积极影响。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1515/pac-2025-0545","t":"Effect of atomic layer deposition and alumina actions of optoelectronic behaviour of polyfluorene OLEDS","u":"https://doi.org/10.1515/pac-2025-0545","s":"Pure and Applied Chemistry","d":"2025-11-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract With unique properties such as enhanced photoluminescence (PL) efficiency, improved thermal stability, and favourable optical properties, polyfluorenes (PFs) are well-suited for organic light-emitting diode (OLED) applications. However, the conventional PF layers are found to have drawbacks, including variation in charge transport, which minimizes the overall PL efficiency due to uneven coating and photo-oxidation. Current research aims to overcome the above difficulties and to synthesize PF reinforced with alumina (Al 2 O 3 ) nanoparticles (3 wt%) along with encapsulation coating via Atomic Layer Deposition (ALD) and investigates the influence of varying encapsulation coating thicknesses (0, 10, 30, and 50 nm) in the enhancement of optoelectronic performances and operational stability. The fabricated devices were characterized using electroluminescence (EL) spectra, external qu","au":["Gopal Kaliyaperumal","Nagabhooshanam Nagarajan","Sharad Rathore","Ankur Kulshreshta","Santha Sheela","Beulah David"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积和氧化铝对聚荧光素 OLED 光电性能的影响","zb":"研究对象为聚荧光素（PFs）OLED。通过原子层沉积（ALD）制备了添加3 wt%氧化铝（Al2O3）纳米粒子的PF层，并研究不同封装层厚度（0, 10, 30, 50 nm）对光电性能和操作稳定性的影响。使用电致发光（EL）光谱、外量子效率（EQE）、电流-电压（I-V）曲线和封装有效性测试进行表征。结果表明，30 nm封装层厚度下，EL强度最大，峰值波长为470 nm，EQE为8.1%，开启电压为3 V，最大电流密度为8.2 mA/cm2，霍尔迁移率为1.0 × 10−4 cm2/V·s，载流子浓度为2.6 × 10^16 cm−3，器件寿命为312小时，氧渗透率降至5 cm3/m2/day/atm。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1063/5.0292737","t":"Transmission electron microscopy analysis of atomic layer deposited NbTiN/NbN superconducting thin films","u":"https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0292737","s":"APL Materials","d":"2025-11-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Atomic-scale processing and precise control of superconducting thin films are essential for the advancement and large-scale implementation of superconducting quantum technologies. Consequently, detailed analysis of the structural features and elemental composition of such superconducting films is a key element in developing highly sensitive and efficient superconducting nanowire single photon detectors. In this work, we use advanced techniques in scanning transmission electron microscopy (STEM), specifically 4-dimensional STEM (4DSTEM) and electron energy loss spectroscopy (EELS), to analyze the structure and chemistry of two few-nanometer-thick films of NbN and NbTiN deposited by plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition. Digital dark field imaging is used to image the crystalline core of the films, separate from the silicon substrate and protective platinum overlayer, and the data are us","au":["Nidhi Choudhary","Silke A. Peeters","Ciaran T. Lennon","Dmytro Besprozvannyy","Harm C. M. Knoops","Ian Maclaren"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积 NbTiN/NbN 超导薄膜的透射电子显微镜分析","zb":"利用扫描透射电子显微镜（STEM）和电子能量损失谱（EELS）分析了等离子增强原子层沉积制备的 NbN 和 NbTiN 超导薄膜。研究发现薄膜中存在超导 NbC 和岩盐结构碳氮化物，并测量了晶格参数。尽管存在扩散现象，但薄膜结构连续且成分适宜，证实了该工艺适用于超导应用。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta04555j","t":"Atomic layer deposition of NiO x : harnessing the potential of new precursor combinations for photoelectrochemical water oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta04555j","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-11-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This work shows the critical effect of both nickel precursors and oxygen sources on the photoelectrochemical response towards water oxidation of NiO thin films grown by atomic layer deposition.","au":["Vyshnav Kannampalli","Marcel Schmickler","Bruno Fabre","Ludovic Largeau","Antoine Seyeux","José Alvarez"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"NiOx的原子层沉积：利用新的前驱体组合潜力进行光电化学水氧化","zb":"该研究展示了镍前驱体和氧源对原子层沉积生长的NiO薄膜在光电化学水氧化响应中的关键影响。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202517715","t":"DFT‐Guided Design and Synthesis of Bipyridine‐Anchored Copper Single‐Atom Catalysts for Efficient Nitrate‐to‐Ammonia Electroreduction Across a Broad pH Range","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202517715","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-11-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical conversion of nitrate to ammonia represents an efficient approach to alleviate nitrate pollution, concurrently providing a sustainable strategy for ammonia synthesis. The development of cost‐effective electrocatalysts that exhibit both high activity and selectivity in nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) constitutes a substantial challenge. Herein, we demonstrate the rational design of single‐atom catalysts (SACs) for the NO 3 RR through theoretical screening and precise synthesis techniques. A series of bipyridine‐anchored 3 d transition metal SACs has been computationally pre‐evaluated for their NO 3 RR activity and selectivity, and bipyridine‐Cu SAC stands out as the optimal candidate. Guided by the computational predictions, the bipyridine‐Cu encapsulated inside a zirconium‐containing metal–organic framework (namely Cu‐SA/UiO‐bpy) is synthesized and achie","au":["Yuhua Zhu","Yufang Li","Yuhui Tian","Bernt Johannessen","Pria Ramkissoon","Qixuan Chang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于 DFT 指导的设计和合成用于高效硝酸盐到氨电还原的联吡啶锚定铜单原子催化剂","zb":"研究对象为硝酸盐到氨的电还原反应，采用 DFT 理论筛选和精确合成技术设计制备了联吡啶锚定的 3d 过渡金属单原子催化剂，其中联吡啶-铜单原子催化剂在 UiO-bpy 金属有机框架中实现 7.4 mg NH3 h−1 cm−2 的氨产率率和 98.1% 的法拉第效率，并在中性条件下表现出优异的催化性能（FE > 90%）。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsomega.5c08269","t":"Efficient Electrocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis via Spirulina Biomass Based on High-Entropy Alloy","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsomega.5c08269","s":"ACS Omega","d":"2025-11-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"To address persistent challenges of low ammonia yield and Faradaic efficiency (FE) in electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction, this work pioneers a breakthrough strategy utilizing nitrogen-enriched spirulina biomass as the nitrogen source coupled with high-entropy alloy (HEA) catalysts. This novel electrocatalytic synthesis route establishes a sustainable pathway for green ammonia production. The MnFeNiCuAl and MnFeNiCuCo HEAs were synthesized via a coprecipitation method. Structural analysis reveals that MnFeNiCuAl exhibits a pure face-centered cubic (FCC) phase, and the Al element incorporation suppresses high-temperature sintering and mitigates compositional segregation. Its oxygen vacancy concentration is higher than that of the MnFeNiCuCo HEO, which can optimize the multielectron transfer kinetics, thereby enhancing the electrocatalytic performance. Electrocatalytic tests using four ami","au":["Xiao Zhu","Dali Sun","Tianxu Shen"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"基于高熵合金的螺旋藻生物质高效电催化氨合成","zb":"研究对象为利用富氮螺旋藻生物质和高熵合金催化剂进行电催化氮还原，通过共沉淀法制备 MnFeNiCuAl 和 MnFeNiCuCo 高熵合金，MnFeNiCuAl 表现出纯的面心立方相，Al 元素抑制高温烧结和成分偏析，其氧空位浓度高于 MnFeNiCuCo，优化多电子转移动力学，MnFeNiCuAl 催化剂在螺旋藻电解中实现 1783.9 μg/(h cm2) 的氨产率和 80.27% 的法拉第效率。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.langmuir.5c04304","t":"Exploring the Reaction Mechanism of Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia over Carbon Cloth-Supported α-Co(OH) 2 Nanosheets","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.langmuir.5c04304","s":"Langmuir","d":"2025-11-04","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (eNO3RR) with Co-based catalysts provides a sustainable and efficient approach to wastewater purification and nitrogen recovery. However, their inevitable and uncontrollable reconstruction during the eNO3RR leads to uncertain actual active sites and a confused understanding of the mechanism. Herein, the active sites and structural evolution of α-Co(OH)2/CC during the eNO3RR process were investigated via in situ and ex situ characterizations. The results show that α-Co(OH)2 nanosheets are converted to β-Co(OH)2 in a strongly alkaline electrolyte and then act as active sites to adsorb NO3- and spontaneously react to generate CoOOH. Whereas CoOOH is swiftly reduced to β-Co(OH)2 at negative cathodic potential, realizing a nitrate-electrically mediated cyclic evolution process and synergistically catalyzing the eNO3RR. Consequently, α-Co(OH)2/CC achi","au":["Xiaoru An","Xiaonan Du","Hong Li","Fei Gao","Yue Hua","Xiuling Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"探索碳布负载的 α-Co(OH)2 纳米片上高效电化学硝酸盐还原到氨的反应机理","zb":"研究对象为碳布负载的 α-Co(OH)2 纳米片在电化学硝酸盐还原反应中的活性位点和结构演变，通过原位和非原位表征发现 α-Co(OH)2 纳米片在强碱性电解质中转化为 β-Co(OH)2 并作为活性位点吸附 NO3- 生成 CoOOH，CoOOH 在负极电位下被快速还原为 β-Co(OH)2，实现硝酸盐-电介质的循环演化过程，α-Co(OH)2/CC 在 -0.1 V vs RHE 下达到 92% 的法拉第效率和 -0.6 V vs RHE 下 338 mmol·gcat−1·h−1 的氨产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsomega.5c07671","t":"Effect of Potassium Doping on the Surface Structure and Ammonia Synthesis Activity of Co/MgO","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsomega.5c07671","s":"ACS Omega","d":"2025-11-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"The development of effective catalysts for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions is crucial for the mitigation of global warming. Recently, supported Co catalysts have been of great interest, and it is important to investigate the doping effects of basic promoters, such as potassium (K), having strong electron-donating properties. Here we show that even a small amount of K doping (K/(K + Mg) = 0.5–1 mol %) to Co/MgO increases the ammonia synthesis rate of Co/MgO by twice. Moreover, our results revealed that the reduction conditions, such as the temperature and time, strongly affect the amount, chemical state, and arrangement of K species, thereby significantly impacting the NH3 synthesis activity. The findings of this research will contribute to understanding of the effect of alkaline promoters on Co catalysts used for various reactions.","au":["Tomoko Shibata","Kohei Era","Katsutoshi Sato","Shin-ichiro Miyahara","Takahiro Naito","K. Kanishka H. De Silva"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"钾掺杂对Co/MgO表面结构及氨合成活性的影响","zb":"少量钾掺杂（K/(K+Mg)=0.5–1 mol%）使Co/MgO的氨合成速率提高一倍。还原条件显著影响钾物种的量、化学状态及排列，从而影响NH3合成活性。"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202503822","t":"Unraveling Tandem Catalytic Sites for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202503822","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2025-11-03","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Nitrate (NO 3 − ) pollution from industrial and agricultural sources poses significant threats to water quality and human health. The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NIRR), which converts NO 3 − into high‐value ammonia (NH 3 ), offers an efficient approach for treating NO 3 − ‐containing wastewater while addressing energy‐related challenges. Generally, NIRR is a multi‐step reaction, and its core steps‐NO 3 − activation and hydrogenation‐correspond to the NO 3 − adsorption sites and hydrogenation sites on the catalyst, respectively. The tandem catalytic sites accelerate reaction kinetics by spatially separating NO 3 − adsorption sites from hydrogenation sites and leveraging multifunctional catalytic sites for tandem catalysis. Consequently, tandem catalytic sites have recently emerged as an effective strategy for electrocatalytic NIRR. Nevertheless, a comprehensive u","au":["Jiawei Li","Yujie Wang","Xuebiao Ji","Heng Zhao","Wanqiang Yu","Yangtian Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"揭示用于电催化硝酸盐还原到氨的串联催化位点","zb":"研究对象为电催化硝酸盐还原到氨的串联催化位点，串联催化位点通过空间分离 NO3- 吸附位点和氢化位点，利用多功能催化位点实现串联催化，加速反应动力学，综述了串联催化位点的优势、代表性催化剂、原位表征技术、反应中间体和串联催化位点，并讨论了在废水处理、可持续氨合成和能量转换中的应用。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202520377","t":"Unlocking the Critical Role of Noncovalent Interactions Between Alkali Metal Cations and Nitrate in Promoting the Reduction of Nitrate to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202520377","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-11-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 − RR) is widely investigated for sustainable ammonia (NH 3 ) production from NO 3 − pollutants. Alkali metal cations (AM + ) in the electrolyte often greatly impact electrocatalytic performance; however, the role of AM + in the NO 3 − RR remains unclear. Here, we first investigate the influence of AM + on the Cu‐catalyzed NO 3 − RR, revealing an activity increase trend of Li + < Cs + < Na + < K + , which is inconsistent with the local electric field and proton transfer rate increase trend of Li + < Na + < K + < Cs + , hinting that the presence of other important factors governs the NO 3 − RR activity. Intriguingly, Ab initio molecular dynamic (AIMD) simulations uncover that Na + , K + , and Cs + with relatively soft solvation shells could be partially desolvated and then coordinate with NO 3 − via a short‐range electrostatic i","au":["Shuai Qi","Xinbao Chen","Huan He","Jiaying Wang","Linli Li","Qihua Huo"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate to Ammonia"],"zt":"解锁碱金属阳离子和硝酸盐之间非共价相互作用在促进硝酸盐还原到氨中的关键作用","zb":"研究对象为碱金属阳离子在电化学硝酸盐还原反应中的作用，研究发现 Li+ < Cs+ < Na+ < K+ 的活性增加趋势与局部电场和质子转移速率的增加趋势不一致，AIMD 模拟揭示 Na+、K+ 和 Cs+ 通过短程静电相互作用与 NO3- 配位，从而加速 NO3- 到 NO2- 的转化步骤，K+ 具有合适的 NO3- 相互作用强度，比 Na+ 和 Cs+ 表现出更高的活性。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-q772j","t":"Hot Electron-Driven Nitrate-to-Ammonia Conversion On Nanocatalyst: Insights from Quantum Dynamics Simulations","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-q772j","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-11-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Photocatalytic NO3⁻ reduction to NH3 offers a sustainable alternative to established energy-intensive conversion methods but is hindered by poor selectivity and sluggish multi-electron kinetics. Using integrated quantum mechanical simulations, we reveal that metal-rich CdSe quantum dots (QDs) exhibit unusual hot electron (HE)-mediated photocatalytic activity, facilitating ultrafast nitrate (NO3⁻) reduction under ambient conditions. The non-adiabatic molecular dynamics track the ultrafast HE transfer from QD to the lowest unoccupied molecular orbital of NO3, activating its subsequent reduction. The impulsive two-state model captures the real-time HE-mediated N-O bond breaking that results in NO3– to NO2– reduction. The atomistic details emphasize the pivotal role of undercoordinated surface Cd centers in strongly adsorbing and further selectively exciting antisymmetric vibrational modes o","au":["Dibyajyoti Ghosh","Ankita Kumari","Sergei Tretiak"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"基于纳米催化剂的热电子驱动的硝酸盐至氨转化：量子动力学模拟的见解","zb":"研究对象为金属富集 CdSe 量子点（QDs）在环境条件下对硝酸盐（NO3⁻）的超快还原，关键方法是量子力学模拟，主要结果为揭示了热电子（HE）介导的光催化活性，以及表面 Cd 中心在吸附和激发反应物非对称振动模式中的关键作用，计算了多步 NO 至 NH3 转化和产物脱附的吉布斯自由能变化，提出设计原则以提升 QD 基光催化剂的效率和选择性。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动","pre":1},{"id":"10.1109/fie63693.2025.11328629","t":"WIP: Lifelong Learning in Electrical Engineering Education Using a Stakeholder Approach for Electrified Aviation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/fie63693.2025.11328629","s":"2025 IEEE Frontiers in Education Conference (FIE)","d":"2025-11-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This work in progress innovative practice category paper introduces teaching using a stakeholder approach. It illustrates how this approach may be used in an electrical engineering lifelong learning course to support student learning about technology implementation involving far-reaching industry change. The stakeholder approach involves group work where students get to discuss who the important organizations, or stakeholders, are in relation to a complex electrical engineering challenge. This is a suitable approach in a lifelong learning course where students have professional experience to draw on. The uniqueness of this innovative practice is in using a stakeholder approach to teach electrical engineering in a field that is undergoing particularly rapid change involving many interconnected organizations. The paper presents the stakeholder approach, and teaching using this approach is ","au":["Olof Lindahl","Jennifer Leijon"],"o":"回填","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.1016/j.chempr.2025.102618","t":"The Co/NbN interphase as an effective ammonia synthesis catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.chempr.2025.102618","s":"Chem","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"","au":["Ang Cao","Ke Zhang","Jerome Vernieres","Lau Halkier Wandall","Rikke Egeberg Tankard","Jakob Kibsgaard"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Co/NbN界面作为高效氨合成催化剂","bt":1,"top":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2025.115462","t":"Carbon nanotubes enhanced hydrogen and ammonia desorption for efficient ammonia synthesis on a low-ruthenium catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2025.115462","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Hao Li","Guorun Dai","Yuxiang Mao","Jun Cheng"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"碳纳米管增强低钌催化剂的氢和氨脱附以实现高效合成氨","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116394","t":"Is the N2 Dissociative Mechanism Universal Across Stepped Metal Surfaces for Ammonia Synthesis?","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116394","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Yuetan Su","Chunyao Fang","Sihang Liu","Ang Cao","Jianhua Yan"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"阶梯金属表面氨合成N2解离机理是否具有普适性？","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.diamond.2025.112797","t":"High-performance microporous single-walled nanotubes for ammonia production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.diamond.2025.112797","s":"Diamond and Related Materials","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Xuan Peng","Julia Zhu","Yixin Peng"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"用于氨生产的高性能微孔单壁纳米管","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.168922","t":"Comprehensive kinetic analysis of ammonia synthesis over a Co/BaO/MgO catalyst under milder conditions: Integral reactor modeling via Langmuir–Hinshelwood mechanism","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.168922","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Mostafa El-Shafie","Tomoyuki Yajima","Takahiro Naito","Katsutoshi Sato","Shoichi Tsuda","Koji Inazu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Co/BaO/MgO催化剂合成氨的温和条件综合动力学分析","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.168541","t":"Universal kinetic model for ammonia synthesis on various ruthenium-based catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.168541","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"A Langmuir-Hinshelwood type kinetic model is proposed for ammonia synthesis on ruthenium-based catalysts. The model assumes the nitrogen dissociation step as the rate-limiting step and considers N* and H* species on the catalyst surface. The improved kinetic model effectively describes ammonia synthesis on ruthenium-based catalysts over a wide range of conditions, namely temperatures of 247–465 °C, pressures of 1–200 bar, H 2 /N 2 ratios of 0.05–5, and space velocities of 6.6–4247 Nm 3 ·kg cat −1 ·h −1 . The effects of temperature, pressure, H 2 /N 2 ratio, and space velocity are all well captured. Differences in activity between the various catalysts, at the same operating conditions, are correlated via a Relative Catalytic Activity factor. A single correction factor per catalyst is introduced for the binding strength for the N* surface species, to account for effects of promoters and d","au":["Hilbert Keestra","Kevin Hendrik Reindert Rouwenhorst","Derk Willem Frederik Brilman"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"各类钌基催化剂合成氨的通用动力学模型","zb":"提出了适用于 Ru 基催化剂的 Langmuir-Hinshelwood 型动力学模型，假设氮解离为决速步。该模型在 247–465 °C、1–200 bar、H2/N2 比为 0.05–5 的宽范围内有效。引入相对催化活性因子和单一修正因子来描述不同催化剂和助剂对 N* 表面物种结合强度的影响。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcata.2025.120525","t":"Design of ammonia synthesis Ru catalysts with mesoporous structures through the Si-doping of cerium–lanthanum oxide","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcata.2025.120525","s":"Applied Catalysis A: General","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Masashi Kikugawa","Yoshihiro Goto","Kiyoshi Yamazaki","Yuichi Manaka","Tetsuya Nanba","Hideyuki Matsumoto"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过 Ce-La 氧化物 Si 掺杂设计具有介孔结构的氨合成 Ru 催化剂","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.psep.2025.107880","t":"Controlling product selectivity and residual carbon behavior in biomass pyrolysis via pulse-structured joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.psep.2025.107880","s":"Process Safety and Environmental Protection","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Yang Liu","Ruming Pan","Renaud Ansart","Chenxu Zhong","Yue Niu","Hongdi Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"脉冲结构焦耳加热控制生物质热解产物选择性和残余碳行为","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mssp.2025.109829","t":"Plasma-Enhanced Atomic Layer Deposition of Al2o3 on Graphene Via an in Situ-Deposited Interlayer","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mssp.2025.109829","s":"Materials Science in Semiconductor Processing","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"A novel method has been developed for the deposition of high-κ dielectrics on graphene, which uses a nonstoichiometric aluminum oxide (AlOX) protective layer. This approach employs mild plasma conditions to directly grow a thin AlOX layer on graphene, followed by the deposition of aluminum oxide (Al 2 O 3 ) via plasma-enhanced atomic layer deposition (PEALD) without breaking the vacuum. A sub-3 nm AlOX layer provides effective protection for graphene and facilitates the formation of functional groups, thereby enabling the deposition of high-quality dielectrics without damaging the graphene. Top-gated graphene field-effect transistor (GFET) devices fabricated via this method demonstrated an electric field strength above 11 MV/cm and an equivalent oxide thickness (EOT) of less than 5 nm on a wafer scale. This deposition technique addresses a significant challenge in transitioning next-gene","au":["Sarah Riazimehr","Ardeshir Esteki","Martin Otto","Michael Powell","Gordon Rinke","Bianca Robertz"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"等离子体增强原子层沉积 Al2O3 在石墨烯上通过原位沉积层","zb":"开发了一种在石墨烯上沉积高κ介电层的新方法，使用非化学计量比氧化铝（AlOX）保护层。该方法在温和等离子条件下直接生长AlOX层，随后在真空不中断的情况下进行等离子增强原子层沉积（PEALD）Al2O3。制备的顶栅石墨烯场效应晶体管在晶圆尺度上实现了超过11 MV/cm的电场强度和小于5 nm的等效氧化层厚度。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积｜电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.matre.2025.100377","t":"Ultrafast Joule heating technology for functional nanomaterials synthesis: Recent progress, challenges, and perspectives","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matre.2025.100377","s":"Materials Reports: Energy","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Ultrafast Joule heating (JH) has emerged as a powerful and scalable platform for rapid thermal processing of advanced nanomaterials. By delivering transient, high-intensity electrical pulses, JH induces ultrafast heating and cooling rates on the order of milliseconds, facilitating nonequilibrium phase transitions, defect modulation, and tailored nanostructural evolution. This technique offers unprecedented control over material synthesis and has been successfully applied to a broad spectrum of functional property-driven materials, including graphene, single-atom catalysts, transition metal carbides, oxides, nitrides, phosphides, and chalcogenides, as well as complex multicomponent frameworks such as high-entropy alloys. This review systematically explores the principles governing JH, highlights recent advances in its application to diverse materials systems, and critically assesses curre","au":["Yuyu Liu","Ruting Lin","Baoyi Guo","Chen Chen","Qiujin Wu","Xiaofeng Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳加热技术用于功能纳米材料合成：近期进展、挑战与展望","zb":"综述了超快焦耳热（JH）在功能纳米材料合成中的应用，涵盖石墨烯、单原子催化剂、过渡金属碳化物等材料。JH能诱导毫秒级的超快加热冷却，实现非平衡相变和结构调控。文章讨论了其能量效率、环境可持续性等优势，并提出了结合原位诊断和数据驱动优化以发现新材料的建议。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1016/j.matlet.2025.138990","t":"Flash Joule Heating Enables Rapid Synthesis of Silicon Carbide Nanowires","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matlet.2025.138990","s":"Materials Letters","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Chengyu Li","Jianjun Chen","Xiaohong Li","Jinyu Guo","Hao Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"闪焦耳加热实现碳化硅纳米线快速合成","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.matlet.2025.138890","t":"Rapid titanium carbide synthesis from titanium and graphite powders via ultrafast high-temperature sintering","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.matlet.2025.138890","s":"Materials Letters","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Self-propagating high-temperature synthesis (SHS) is a combustion-based method that involves a self-heating chain reaction, which is effective for rapidly producing materials with high melting points. Herein, ultrafast high-temperature sintering (UHS) was leveraged to ignite the SHS of titanium carbide (TiC) from titanium and graphite powders, and the heat generation and microstructural evolution during the process were investigated. The exothermic heat generated during TiC synthesis was confirmed, demonstrating that SHS was initiated in the initial stage of UHS. The incubation time before SHS ignition decreased with an increase in the UHS temperature above the melting point of titanium. Scanning electron microscopy revealed that fine TiC grains formed during SHS, which became denser under continued UHS. Additionally, molten Ti spread over the graphite particles during SHS, which transfo","au":["Daiki Akutagawa","Toshiki Sato","Tomoharu Tokunaga","Kiyoshi Kobayashi","Takahisa Yamamoto"],"o":"回填","why":["ultrafast high-temperature sintering"],"zt":"钛碳化物超快高温烧结合成","zb":"利用超快高温烧结（UHS）引发钛和石墨粉末的自蔓延高温合成（SHS）制备碳化钛（TiC）。SHS在UHS初期被点燃，随着UHS温度升高，点火前的潜伏期缩短。SEM显示SHS形成细晶TiC，后续UHS使其致密化。熔融Ti在石墨颗粒上形成片状TiC，其间的长条状空隙阻碍了进一步致密化。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.237967","t":"Rapid carbothermic shock synthesis of high-entropy oxides as highly stable oxygen evolution reaction catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.237967","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Changyu Hu","Huidong Xie","Cheng Chen","Xiaoyu Liu","Hao Chen","Lingyi Meng"],"o":"回填","why":["shock synthesis"],"zt":"快速碳热冲击合成高熵氧化物作为高度稳定的析氧反应催化剂","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jelechem.2025.119425","t":"Joule Heating Synthesis of Ptnico Nanoparticles-Loaded Carbon Fibers for Hydrogen Evolution Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jelechem.2025.119425","s":"Journal of Electroanalytical Chemistry","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Song Li","Miaomiao Geng","Jiajun Tang","Qun Zou","Lina Wang","Baochun Guo"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"焦耳热合成负载Ptnico纳米颗粒的碳纤维用于析氢反应","ob":"析氢反应｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.isci.2025.113649","t":"Broad anti-sarbecovirus responses elicited by a single administration of mosaic-8 RBD-nanoparticle vaccine prepared using atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isci.2025.113649","s":"iScience","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Atomic layer deposition (ALD), a new vaccine technology, permits multiple dosing with a single administration by pulsatile release of one or more immunogens. We evaluated ALD delivery of mosaic-8b [60-mer nanoparticles presenting 8 different SARS-like betacoronavirus (sarbecovirus) receptor-binding domains (RBDs)] that elicit broadly cross-reactive antibodies and protect against mismatched sarbecoviruses not represented by RBDs on mosaic-8b. Compared with conventional prime-boost immunizations, ALD-delivered mosaic-8b RBD-nanoparticles elicited antibodies in both naive and pre-vaccinated mice with improved mismatched binding and neutralization. Results of the RBD epitope mapping of serum antibodies from ALD-delivered mosaic-8b were consistent with broader coverage of RBD epitopes compared to conventional immunizations, and systems serology revealed distinct IgG subclass and FcγR-binding ","au":["Alexander A. Cohen","Jennifer R. Keeffe","Annie V. Rorick","Semi Rho","Ange-Célia Priso Fils","Lusineh Manasyan"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"单次给药激发广泛的抗Sarbecovirus反应：使用原子层沉积制备的嵌合-8 RBD-纳米颗粒疫苗","zb":"原子层沉积（ALD）是一种新的疫苗技术，通过脉冲释放一种或多种免疫原，允许单次给药多次剂量。评估了ALD递送的嵌合-8b（60-mer纳米颗粒呈递8种不同的SARS样β冠状病毒（Sarbecovirus）受体结合域（RBDs））激发广泛交叉反应性抗体并保护不受嵌合-8b上未表示的RBDs代表的错配Sarbecovirus。与传统的prime-boost免疫相比，ALD递送的嵌合-8b RBD-纳米颗粒在未免疫和预先免疫的小鼠中激发抗体，改善了错配结合和中和。ALD递送的嵌合-8b血清抗体的RBD表位图谱结果与传统的免疫相比，RBD表位覆盖更广一致，系统血清学揭示了不同的IgG亚类和FcγR结合IgG分布。这些结果表明，ALD是一种有前景的技术，用于与嵌合-8b RBD-纳米颗粒疫苗一起使用，以保护未来Sarbecovirus溢出，并支持ALD疫苗递送的应用，以激发对快速突变或多样化病原体的","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1016/j.energy.2025.138673","t":"The graphene formation via flash Joule heating: The effect of cooling rate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.energy.2025.138673","s":"Energy","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Mingfan Zhang","Dikun Hong","Tong Xu","Yao Zhang","Mengyang Sun","Chunbo Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过闪焦耳热形成石墨烯：冷却速率的影响","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.colsurfa.2025.137567","t":"Optimizing electron transfer and catalytic oxidation by decorating Au nanoparticles on fast Joule heating synthesized In2O3 nanocubes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.colsurfa.2025.137567","s":"Colloids and Surfaces A: Physicochemical and Engineering Aspects","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Chunbao Liu","Jiawei Xiong","Yanxu Feng","Chenlu Hu","Shuangming Wang","Yi Zeng"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过在快速焦耳热合成的In2O3纳米立方体上装饰Au纳米颗粒优化电子转移和催化氧化","ob":"其他催化反应｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2025.08.446","t":"Nucleation and growth of ZnAl2O4 spinel phase in double-layered Al2O3/ZnO nanopillars and nanotubes prepared by atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2025.08.446","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Nucleation and growth kinetics of ZnAl 2 O 4 spinel phase was studied between amorphous Al 2 O 3 and crystalline ZnO oxide layers grown by atomic layer deposition on a highly curved solid Pt cores with Pt)Al 2 O 3 )ZnO) sequence (double-layered nanopillars, DLNPs). The composite pillars were annealed at 700 °C in ambient atmosphere for different durations. Thin plan-view lamellae were prepared from the cross sections of the pillars to investigate the nucleation and the growth kinetics of the ZnAl 2 O 4 spinel phase in a transmission mode scanning electron microscope (TSEM). We found that similarly as in planar geometry, the growth occurs in two stages: first, islands form and grow along the interface until creating a continuous layer; then this continuous layer thickens. However, in comparison to the planar case, the first stage is extremely shortened due to the closed geometry. The grow","au":["Gergő Vecsei","János J. Tomán","István Gábor Márián","Barbara Sárközi","Laura Juhász","Péter Pekker"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"ZnAl2O4尖晶石相在原子层沉积制备的双层Al2O3/ZnO纳米棒和纳米管中的成核与生长","zb":"研究了原子层沉积在高度弯曲的Pt核上生长的Pt)Al2O3)ZnO双层纳米柱中，ZnAl2O4尖晶石相的成核与生长动力学。700 °C退火后，TSEM观察发现生长分为两阶段，但闭口几何结构使第一阶段显著缩短。连续相的生长速率受核心类型影响，在双层纳米柱中呈抛物线增长且比纳米管慢。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.168972","t":"The role of induction heating in catalytic propane dehydrogenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.168972","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Electrifying catalytic processes offers a promising route for reducing carbon emissions by replacing fossil fuel combustion with efficient, renewable energy-driven heating. Among emerging approaches, induction heating enables volumetric and spatially resolved energy delivery within catalyst beds. This study investigates the impact of induction heating on propane dehydrogenation over Pt/Al 2 O 3 and Pt-Co/Al 2 O 3 compared to conventional furnace heating. At 600 °C, induction heating increased propylene selectivity by up to 20 % and reduced side product formation, with comparable propane conversion. Spent catalyst analysis indicated a moderate reduction in coke accumulation under induction heating consistently in both Pt/Al 2 O 3 and Pt-Co/Al 2 O 3 catalysts. Propylene temperature-programmed desorption revealed a 33 °C lower desorption temperature for Pt/Al 2 O 3 , indicating enhanced des","au":["Ben Ko","Han Wang","Jian-Ping Chen","Carlos Lizandara-Pueyo","Roel S. Sanchez-Carrera","Erdem Sasmaz"],"o":"回填","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"感应加热在丙烷脱氢催化中的作用","zb":"研究比较了感应加热与传统炉加热在Pt/Al2O3和Pt-Co/Al2O3催化剂上进行丙烷脱氢的效果。在600 °C下，感应加热使丙烯选择性提高了20%，并减少了副产物生成。表征表明，感应加热下积碳减少，丙烯脱附温度降低了33 °C。模拟显示局部热点和电流波动引起的温度波动（最高22 °C）是性能提升的原因。","ob":"其他催化反应｜表征温程（TPR/TPD/TPO 等，不等于反应供热）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.168415","t":"Efficient leaching of precious metals from spent automotive three-way catalysts by TiO2 derived from Joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.168415","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Shunlong Yan","Ke Zhou","Chao Liang","Xiyang Zhang","Fang Yuan","Chunquan Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"通过焦耳热产生的TiO2高效浸出废旧汽车三元催化器中的贵金属","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.168242","t":"Ultra-fast synthesis of high-performance sulfide-solid-electrolytes via high-temperature shock for all-solid-state lithium batteries","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.168242","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Yuzhe Zhang","Shijie Xu","Xinyu Wang","Shuai Hao","Yujiang Sun","Yifan Yan"],"o":"回填","why":["high-temperature shock"],"zt":"高温冲击快速合成高性能硫化物固态电解质用于全固态锂电池","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115400","t":"Efficient CeO2 decoration of Fischer-Tropsch catalysts through atomic layer deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115400","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Andrés A. García Blanco","M. Amine Lwazzani","Martí Biset-Peiró","Jordi Guilera"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积高效CeO2修饰费托合成催化剂","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.envres.2025.122351","t":"Photocatalytic oxidation of ammonia using copper-mediated phosphotungstic acid intercalated sulfonated bentonite for sustainable eutrophication control: A case study from Lake Qarun","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.envres.2025.122351","s":"Environmental Research","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"This study introduces a novel photocatalyst-copper-mediated phosphotungstic acid intercalated acidified bentonite (Cu@PTA/SB)-for the efficient oxidation of ammonia in both synthetic aqueous solutions and eutrophic natural waters. The catalyst was synthesized by sulfonating carbonaceous bentonite, followed by intercalation of phosphotungstic acid and in situ deposition of copper nanoparticles. Physicochemical characterization confirmed a stable mesoporous structure with a surface area of 72.26 m2/g and average pore diameter of 8.25 nm, enhancing adsorption capacity and redox activity. In synthetic ammonium solutions, the catalyst demonstrated significant efficiency, achieving ammonia removal rates of 88.4%, 81.3%, 70.5%, and 58.3% for 10-30 mg/L concentrations using 0.02 g under visible light. Increasing the dosage to 0.04 g enabled complete removal (100%) of 10 and 15 mg/L ammonia withi","au":["Mostafa Gaber Refaai","Hassan A. Rudayni","Ahmed A. Allam","Mostafa R. Abukhadra","Mahmoud S.M. Abdel Wahed"],"o":"回填","zt":"铜介导的磷钨酸插层磺化膨润土用于氨的光催化氧化：从Qarun湖的案例研究","zb":"介绍了一种新型光催化剂-Cu@PTA/SB，用于高效氧化合成水溶液和富营养化自然水中的氨。催化剂通过磺化碳质膨润土、磷钨酸插层和原位沉积铜纳米颗粒合成。物理化学表征确认了稳定的介孔结构，比表面积为72.26 m2/g，平均孔径为8.25 nm，增强了吸附能力和氧化还原活性。在合成铵溶液中，催化剂表现出显著效率，使用0.02 g在可见光下对10-30 mg/L浓度氨的去除率分别为88.4%、81.3%、70.5%和58.3%。增加剂量到0.04 g，在pH 9下，可在120分钟内完全去除10和15 mg/L氨。动力学分析表明，低浓度下（R2 = 0.996, k1 = 0.01823 min-1）遵循准一级动力学，而高浓度下由于表面饱和遵循准二级行为。量子产率随氨增加而下降，确认了中等负载下的最佳光子效率。在富营养化Qarun湖（NH4+ = 5.6 mg/L, pH 8.5）的真实水中，催","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.26599/nr.2025.94907810","t":"Intermittent pulsed electrocatalysis adjusting Cu valence states for effective nitrite reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/nr.2025.94907810","s":"Nano Research","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrite (NO2−) reduction offers a sustainable route for ammonia (NH3) synthesis while simultaneously removing contaminants in wastewater. However, its efficiency is often limited by low catalytic efficiency and the competitive hydrogen evolution reaction at low NO2− concentrations. Herein, we report an intermittent pulsed electrolysis (IPE) strategy using copper oxide (CuxO) nanowires, which significantly enhances the NH3 yield rate and Faradaic efficiency (FE) at lower reactant concentrations. In situ experiments and theoretical calculations reveal that alternating between open-circuit and cathodic potentials modulates the copper oxidation states, stabilizing the catalytically active cuprous oxide (Cu2O). Consequently, the IPE approach provides an outstanding NH3 yield rate of 115.10 mg·h−1·cm−2 and FE of 91.14% in the presence of 25 mM NO2−, markedly outperforming conve","au":["Zhe Meng","Jian-Hui Yi","Yu-Tian Zhang","Xue-Feng Sun","Xiao-Lei Huang","Miao-Miao Shi"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrite reduction"],"zt":"间歇脉冲电催化调节 Cu 价态以有效将亚硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"电化学亚硝酸盐 (NO2−) 还原为可持续的氨 (NH3) 合成路线，同时去除废水中的污染物。然而，其效率通常受限于低催化效率和低 NO2− 浓度下竞争性的析氢反应。本研究报道了一种使用氧化铜 (CuxO) 纳米线的间歇脉冲电解 (IPE) 策略，显著提高了低反应物浓度下的 NH3 产率速率和法拉第效率 (FE)。原位实验和理论计算表明，在开路和阴极电位之间交替调节铜的氧化态，稳定了催化活性的亚氧化铜 (Cu2O)。因此，IPE 方法在 25 mM NO2− 存在下提供了 115.10 mg·h−1·cm−2 的 NH3 产率速率和 91.14% 的 FE，明显优于传统的恒电位电解。","ob":"电化学亚硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/s1872-2067(25)64808-x","t":"Construction of ultrathin BiVO4 nanosheets with bismuth-oxygen dual vacancies for photocatalytic nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1872-2067(25)64808-x","s":"Chinese Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jiahui Chen","Yue Meng","Bo Xie","Zheming Ni","Shengjie Xia"],"o":"回填","why":["photocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"构建具有铋氧双空位的超薄 BiVO4 纳米片用于光催化氮还原","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2025.133428","t":"Enhanced photocatalytic ammonia oxidation over Ag/WO3 via simultaneously steering the activation for N–H bonds and oxygen species","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2025.133428","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Kunfeng Zhang","Hongxia Chen","Yifan Liu","Bo Peng","Jinxia Liang"],"o":"回填","why":["photocatalytic ammonia"],"zt":"通过同时调控 N–H 键活化与氧物种活化增强 Ag/WO3 的光催化氨氧化","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2025.115455","t":"Role of Metallic Oxide Supports and Alkali Metal Modification Over Active Ruthenium Sites for Low-Temperature Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2025.115455","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yuan Li","Bin Guan","Lei Zhu","Tiankui Zhu","Zhongqi Zhuang","Xuehan Hu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"金属氧化物载体和碱金属改性对活性 Ruthenium 位点在低温氨分解中的作用","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mcat.2025.115390","t":"Research progress of single-atom, dual-atom and nanocluster electrocatalysts for sustainable ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mcat.2025.115390","s":"Molecular Catalysis","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mengqi Liao","Meiling Liu","Qiang Xiong","Mingwei Chen","Chao Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"单原子、双原子和纳米团簇电催化剂用于可持续氨合成的研究进展","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.238222","t":"Carbon-constrained CoRu bimetallic catalysts enabling efficient electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.238222","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Fengchen Zhou","Binxin Lv","Yifan Zhang","Yang Wu","Yong Wang","Wen Luo"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate to ammonia"],"zt":"碳受限的 CoRu 双金属催化剂实现高效的硝酸还原为氨的电催化","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.238065","t":"Efficient One-Step Electrochemical Synthesis of Ammonia-Hydrogen Fuel for Clean Energy Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.238065","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zhongmei Yang","Xiaoyang Wang","Congjie Hong","Xiaojiang Mu","Lei Miao"],"o":"回填","why":["Synthesis of Ammonia"],"zt":"高效一步电化学合成氨-氢燃料用于清洁能源应用","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jes.2024.12.037","t":"Fe/N modified porous carbon nanofibers with encapsulated FeCo nanoparticles for efficient electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jes.2024.12.037","s":"Journal of Environmental Sciences","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The efficient electrocatalytic nitrate (NO3-) reduction to ammonia (NRA) offers a sustainable alternative for both environmental remediation and ammonia synthesis. Developing advanced electrocatalysts with rationally designed spatial arrangement of active sites and optimizing the synergetic effect among components are crucial for high efficiency and selectivity. Herein, we present Fe/N active sites decorated on porous carbon nanofibers (CNFs) with encapsulated FeCo nanoparticles (FeCo@CNFs-Fe/N) as electrocatalysts for NRA. The FeCo@CNFs-Fe/N catalyst demonstrates exceptional performance, achieving a high ammonia yield of 498.18 µmol/(h·gcat). Meanwhile, the enhanced reduction activity, especially the reduction in overpotential by 0.565 V, is 3-10 times higher than that of FeCo-encapsulated and Fe/N-modified CNFs-based catalysts. The enhanced catalytic activity is attributed to the effic","au":["Jiayu Chen","Anni Wu","Jixiang Li","Chengyi Hong","Wenxiang Tang","Hu Zheng"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"Fe/N 修饰的多孔碳纳米纤维包覆 FeCo 纳米颗粒用于高效的硝酸还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为硝酸还原为氨的电催化过程，采用 Fe/N 修饰的多孔碳纳米纤维包覆 FeCo 纳米颗粒（FeCo@CNFs-Fe/N）作为催化剂，通过原子层沉积制备，并利用闪蒸焦耳热进行加热。该催化剂表现出优异性能，氨产率高达 498.18 µmol/(h·gcat)，过电位降低 0.565 V，活性比 FeCo 包覆和 Fe/N 修饰的 CNFs 催化剂高 3-10 倍。活性增强归因于高效的结构设计和活性位点空间分布优化，促进了电子转移速率和降低了反应能垒。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jelechem.2025.119420","t":"Electrocatalytic reduction of N2 for ammonia synthesis by two-dimensional transition metal N,N′-dicyanoquinonediimine monolayers","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jelechem.2025.119420","s":"Journal of Electroanalytical Chemistry","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xiaolin Wang","Zhibo Zheng","Jiashu Zhang","Dehua Kong","Shaowei Jin","Debing Long"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"二维过渡金属N,N′-二氰基醌二亚胺单层电催化N2还原合成氨","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2025.07.015","t":"High-throughput screening of trimetallic dual-atom alloy catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2025.07.015","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yuanyuan Wang","Chunmei Tang","Ting Xiao","Fujian Xiong","Xiaofeng Zhou","Kaixiao Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"三金属双原子合金催化剂的高通量筛选用于电催化硝酸还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2025.06.052","t":"Reconstructing active sites in Ni-Co double hydroxides to enhance electrocatalytic efficiency for nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2025.06.052","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jian Zhou","Yunteng Wang","Dandan Wu","Ying Wang","Tao Zhou","Terence Xiaoteng Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"在Ni-Co双氢氧化物中重构活性位点以增强电催化效率将硝酸还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116386","t":"MoS2 nanoparticles/MIL-100(Fe) heterojunction with Type II interfacial charge transfer for efficient photocatalytic nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116386","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qi Chen","Xingxing Huang","Cheng Liu","Yueling Chen","Jionghua Wu","Jimmy C. Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["photocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"MoS2 纳米颗粒/MIL-100(Fe) 异质结具有 II 型界面电荷转移用于高效光催化氮还原","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152471","t":"A density functional theory and experimental investigation of ammonia decomposition using mesoporous cobalt-based nanocatalysts for hydrogen production","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152471","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Vahideh Sarvari","Hassan Hadadzadeh","Hossein Farrokhpour"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"密度泛函理论和实验研究使用介孔钴基纳米催化剂分解氨生产氢气","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152101","t":"Transition metals decorated holey graphyne as a potential catalyst for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.152101","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Single-atom catalysts (SACs) supported on two-dimensional carbon-based materials offer a sustainable alternative to the Haber-Bosch process for ammonia production via electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction (eNRR). First-principles density functional theory simulations were employed to investigate transition metal-decorated holey graphyne (TM@HGY; TM: Sc, Cu, Mo, Ru) SACs for eNRR. Interaction energy and ab initio molecular dynamics simulations confirm their thermodynamic and thermal stability (300 – 500 K). Bader charge analysis reveals electron transfer of 0.50 – 1.53 e from TMs to HGY, while density of states and electron localization function analyses indicate metallic conductivity and efficient charge delocalization. N ––– N bond elongation (1.11 – 1.19 Å) shows effective N 2 activation over the designed catalysts. Gibbs free energy profiles identify Ru@HGY as the most active catalyst, ","au":["Ali Hussain","Ibrahim Khan","Imran Mahmood Khan","Nicholas Musyoka","J. Andreas Larsson","Muhammad Sajjad"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"过渡金属修饰的孔洞图炔作为电催化氮还原合成氨的潜在催化剂","zb":"研究采用第一性原理密度泛函理论模拟过渡金属修饰的孔洞图炔（TM@HGY；TM：Sc、Cu、Mo、Ru）单原子催化剂（SACs）用于电催化氮还原（eNRR）。相互作用能和从头算分子动力学模拟证实其热力学和热稳定性（300–500 K）。Bader 电荷分析显示 TMs 向 HGY 转移 0.50–1.53 e 的电子，而态密度和电子局域函数分析表明金属导电性和有效电荷离域。N–N 键伸长（1.11–1.19 Å）表明在设计的催化剂上有效活化 N2。吉布斯自由能曲线确定 Ru@HGY 为最活性催化剂，交替和远程路径均需 0.54 V 的施加电位。所有 SACs 对析氢反应表现出显著抑制，在 0.80 V 至 1.26 V 的电位范围内具有大量潜力，确保对氨生产的高选择性。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.151825","t":"Improvement in ammonia production efficiency via collision of fine water droplets with a nitrogen plasma jet","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.151825","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Plasma-based methods enable the one-step production of ammonia from water under ambient temperatures and pressures without CO 2 emissions, making them a crucial technology for achieving a carbon-neutral society. In the present study, ammonia is produced with a novel technique, mist and plasma (MAP), which enhances the energy efficiency of ammonia production by colliding fine water droplets (mist) with a nitrogen plasma jet. The efficiency of MAP is 57.6 mg-NH 3 /MJ, representing 8-36-fold improvement in efficiency compared with conventional in-liquid plasma techniques and interfacial reactions between nitrogen plasma and static bulk water. This performance is high-level reported efficiency for catalyst-free one-step ammonia production using water under ambient conditions. The efficiency depends on the surface area per unit space volume of the mist, nitrogen gas flow rate, and electrical ","au":["Ryoya Shiraishi","Yuya Kuwaki","Taiji Hatayama","Shuntaro Sakamoto","Chihiro Yamasaki","Yasutaka Hayamizu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"通过细水滴与氮等离子体射流碰撞提高氨生产效率","zb":"研究采用雾化等离子体（MAP）技术，通过细水滴与氮等离子体射流碰撞实现氨的一步法生产，在环境温度和压力下无需 CO2 排放。MAP 效率为 57.6 mg-NH3/MJ，比传统浸液等离子体技术和氮等离子体与静态水 bulk 反应提高 8-36 倍。该性能是催化剂免费、环境条件下用水一步法生产氨的最高效率报道。效率受水雾单位空间体积表面积、氮气流速和电放电频率影响。进一步研究和优化有望实现高效可持续的氨生产技术。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuproc.2025.108292","t":"Multi-hollow dielectric barrier discharge plasma: An energy-efficient strategy towards mild ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuproc.2025.108292","s":"Fuel Processing Technology","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Renewable-driven non-thermal plasma (NTP) technology provides a potentially sustainable alternative for ammonia (NH 3 ) production. Nonetheless, energy efficiency remains a critical bottleneck in NTP reactors. Herein, we propose a multi-hollow dielectric barrier discharge (MDBD) plasma reactor to realize nitrogen hydrogenation towards ambient NH 3 synthesis, with the physicochemical characteristics systematically explored for the first time. Transient discharge dynamics were captured by electrical characterization, meanwhile the active intermediate species and the low-temperature properties of MDBD were unveiled by optical spectrum diagnosis. Effects of feed gas, flow rate and specific energy input (SEI) on reaction activity were investigated in terms of energy efficiency (EE) and energy consumption (EC). Notably, remarkable reaction efficacy was realized under low driving powers. For a ","au":["Shanzhi Liu","Jiabao Lv","Zhikai Lang","Xingqi Li","Jianhua Yan","Xiaodong Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"多空隙介质阻挡放电等离子体：一种温和氨合成的高效策略","zb":"研究采用多空隙介质阻挡放电（MDBD）等离子体反应器实现氮氢化合成氨，首次系统探索了其物理化学特性。通过电学表征捕捉瞬态放电动力学，光学光谱诊断揭示活性中间物种和低温特性。研究考察了进料气体、流速和比能量输入对反应活性的影响，以能量效率和能量消耗评估反应效能。在完全发展的稳态放电下，3.20 W 功率下实现 1.32 g/kWh 的能量效率和 46.44 MJ/mol 的能量消耗。在脉冲式闪烁模式下，1.15 W 功率下能量效率和能量消耗分别提升至 1.78 g/kWh 和 34.35 MJ/mol，凸显了 MDBD 的能量有效性。该工作为高效、环保、分布式氨生产提供了一种新方法。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2025.135632","t":"Exploring the synergistic effects of CO2 in N2 gliding arc plasma for enhanced green ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2025.135632","s":"Fuel","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Indumathy Balakrishnan","Nanditta Nandy","Amarnath Pasupathi","Yugeswaran Subramaniam","Santhanamoorthi Nachimuthu","Jyh-Chiang Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"探索 CO2 在 N2 闪蒸等离子体中对绿色氨合成协同效应的研究","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.epsr.2025.111887","t":"Double-layer power optimisation and regulation method for hydro-photovoltaic hydrogen production ammonia synthesis coupling system","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.epsr.2025.111887","s":"Electric Power Systems Research","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"To achieve a balance between economic performance and operational reliability in a coupled hydro–photovoltaic hydrogen-to-ammonia system, and to improve its operational flexibility, this paper proposes a double-layer power optimisation and control strategy based on model predictive control (MPC). In the upper-layer economic optimisation and scheduling module, a cost-benefit optimisation model is developed that considers internal revenue, operation and maintenance costs, and the start-up/shutdown costs of the hydrogen production units, aiming to maximise the overall economic benefits of system operation. In the lower-layer real-time control module, a real-time power optimisation method is introduced, which leverages the MPC framework to track multiple operational targets under dynamic constraints, using the economically optimised baseline power as a reference. The effectiveness of the pro","au":["Yang Shihui","Zhengang LU","Zhao Liu","Guoliang Zhao","Haijun Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"水电光氢氨耦合系统双层功率优化与调节方法","zb":"为在水电光氢氨耦合系统中平衡经济性能与运行可靠性，并提出基于模型预测控制 (MPC) 的双层功率优化与控制策略。上层经济优化调度模块开发考虑内部收益、运行维护成本和氢气生产单元启停成本的成本效益优化模型，以最大化系统运行的整体经济效益。下层实时控制模块引入基于 MPC 框架的实时功率优化方法，在动态约束下跟踪多重运行目标，以经济优化基线功率为参考。案例研究验证了该方法在典型运行日的有效性。结果表明，提出的双层控制框架使集成电-氢-氨系统运行灵活高效，为可再生能源深度集成和可持续能源系统发展提供宝贵见解。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.energy.2025.138068","t":"Techno-economic evaluation of green ammonia synthesis for renewable energy storage using rigorous models","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.energy.2025.138068","s":"Energy","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Advanced technologies utilising renewable energies have been advanced rapidly to achieve the Net Zero target, leading to significant cost reduction. However, the intermittency of renewable energy results in unstable power supply, which could be mitigated through renewable energy storage. Ammonia stands out as a promising energy carrier, distinguished by its cost-effective transportation and storage, high energy density, well-established infrastructure, and versatile applications. In this work, we design a green ammonia production system including H 2 generation by using proton electrolyte membrane (PEM) electrolysis, N 2 recovered from off gas, and NH 3 synthesis by using Haber-Bosch Process. An amine-based carbon capture is also integrated to further reduce carbon emissions and nitrogen enrichment. We then develop rigorous process models of reactive equipment to enhance the accuracy of ","au":["Ruitao Sun","Li Sun","Jie Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"利用严格模型对可再生能源存储绿色氨合成的技术经济评估","zb":"设计包含 PEM 电解制 H2、回收 N2 和哈伯-博施合成 NH3 的绿色氨生产系统，并集成胺基碳捕集以减少碳排放和氮富集。开发反应设备的严格过程模型以增强模拟精度，敏感性分析研究关键参数对性能的影响，获得最优操作条件以实现最大节能。计算结果证明模型预测与实验和工厂数据良好吻合。提出的系统绿色氨生产等效能耗为 37.6 GJ t −1 NH 3，能量效率 48.8%。技术经济评估显示系统氨平准化成本为 1169 $ t −1 NH 3，预计 2050 年在 130 $ t −1 CO 2 碳税、20 $ MWh −1 电价和 H2 子系统资本成本降低 90% 的条件下降至 410.5 $ t −1 NH 3，与 IRENA 预测一致。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120180","t":"Techno-economic performance optimization and energy integration analysis of ammonia synthesis system with different electrolyzers","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enconman.2025.120180","s":"Energy Conversion and Management","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Luyao Liu","Hanfei Zhang","Qiushi Wang","Yumeng Zhang","Arianna Baldinelli","Mingjia Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"不同电解槽的氨合成系统技术经济性能优化与能量集成分析","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.169473","t":"Synergizing Ru nanoparticles with Ni3S2 nanosheets to modulate active hydrogen supply for ultralow-potential ammonia synthesis from nitrite hydrogenation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.169473","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qiyao Zeng","Lunhong Ai","Xingyu Liu","Aike Liu","Jing Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"协同 Ru 纳米颗粒与 Ni3S2 纳米片调节活性氢供应实现超低电位亚硝酸氢化氨合成","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.169332","t":"Construction of multiple active sites for energy-efficient ammonia production by nitrate reduction coupling with urea oxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.169332","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Ruchun Li","Ling Bao","Jingwei Li","Ting Yang","Kun Wang","Sanping Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"通过硝酸还原与尿素氧化耦合构建多重活性位点实现高效氨合成","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.169131","t":"Toward sustainable ammonia: A techno-economic and environmental assessment of emerging electrochemical ammonia synthesis pathways","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.169131","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Juyeon Kim","Sangwoo Lee","Woong Choi","Jonggeol Na"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"可持续氨：新兴电化学氨合成路径的技术经济和环境评估","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115381","t":"Boron nitride supported copper single atom catalyst for nitrate reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115381","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Siming Huo","Kyung-Won Jeon","Lingzhe Fang","Ruben Arjan Kjell de Graaf","Briana I. Espinosa","Parker T. Santo Domingo"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"氮化硼负载的铜单原子催化剂用于硝酸盐还原反应","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2025.163773","t":"Light-driven in-plane single atom convert to out-of-plane double-atom photocatalysts featuring normal/inverse sandwich structure enable spontaneous dinitrogen fixation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2025.163773","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yali Lu","Yuanshuai Fang","Chenglong Shi","Qingjun Zhou","Yuling Song","Qiang Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"光驱动的平面单原子转化为垂直双原子光催化剂，具有正常/逆嵌套结构，实现自发氮气固定","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apsusc.2025.163675","t":"Anderson-Type Polyoxometalate/Mxene Heterostructures for Efficient Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apsusc.2025.163675","s":"Applied Surface Science","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qingyu Zhou","Xinming Wang","Shuang Rong","Gang Li","Haijun Pang","Huiyuan Ma"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"安德森型多金属氧酸盐/Mxene异质结构用于高效电化学硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.applthermaleng.2025.127215","t":"Technical feasibility of replacing refrigeration cooling system by supersonic separator for ammonia separation in the haber-bosch process","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.applthermaleng.2025.127215","s":"Applied Thermal Engineering","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Seyed Heydar Rajaee Shooshtari"],"o":"回填","why":["haber-bosch"],"zt":"在哈伯-博施过程中用超音速分离器替代制冷冷却系统的技术可行性","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125513","t":"Enhanced solar-driven semiconductor–Bacteria biohybrids system for N2 reduction into ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125513","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Shixu Zhou","Jun Duan","Jugong Shi","Shiying Fan","Guohua Chen","Xinyong Li"],"o":"回填","why":["N2 reduction"],"zt":"增强的太阳能驱动半导体-细菌生物杂化系统用于 N2 还原成氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.psep.2025.107865","t":"Study on the rapid titanium–iron separation mechanism in titanomagnetite driven by flash Joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.psep.2025.107865","s":"Process Safety and Environmental Protection","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Sheng Dou","Shiteng Qin","Shijie Ma","Jun Chen","Budeebazar Avid","Hongyu Zhao"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"闪蒸焦耳热驱动下钛铁矿中快速钛-铁分离机理研究","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.microc.2025.115423","t":"Highly selective ammonia gas sensing response by hybrid Laponite-sodium alginate hydrogel films on flexible substrates","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.microc.2025.115423","s":"Microchemical Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Tanay Saha","Paramesh Gadige"],"o":"回填","zt":"柔性基材上混合 Laponite-海藻酸钠水凝胶薄膜的高选择性氨气传感响应","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jwpe.2025.108850","t":"Enhanced dye degradation using flash Joule heating-modified natural magnetite for peroxymonosulfate activation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jwpe.2025.108850","s":"Journal of Water Process Engineering","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Yu Zhang","Hongwen Liu","Weijun Peng","Yijun Cao","Chongqing Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"使用闪蒸焦耳热改性天然磁铁矿增强染料降解通过过一硫酸盐活化","ob":"其他催化反应｜焦耳热用于制备","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jmgm.2025.109136","t":"Engineering graphyne-supported single-atom catalysts for efficient nitrogen reduction to ammonia: First-principles investigation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jmgm.2025.109136","s":"Journal of Molecular Graphics and Modelling","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (N2RR) offers a sustainable route to ammonia production under ambient conditions but remains limited by inert N ≡ N bond activation and competitive hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). Herein, we employ first-principles density functional theory (DFT) to systematically investigate the N2RR activity of graphyne (GY) doped with single-atom transition metals (Fe, Mo, Ru, W). Structural analysis reveals strong binding and minimal distortion of the TM dopants on the porous, π-conjugated GY scaffold, with Fe-GY and W-GY exhibiting the highest stability. TM doping induces substantial bandgap narrowing and introduces localized d-orbital states near the Fermi level, enhancing charge transfer and catalytic potential. Adsorption studies show that TM sites effectively activate N2 via π-backdonation, with W-GY inducing the greatest N ≡ N bond elongation. ","au":["Nahed H. Teleb","Yasmeen G. Abou El-Reash","Nuha Y. Elamin","Mahmoud A.S. Sakr","Mohamed A. Saad","Hazem Abdelsalam"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"工程石墨炔支撑的单原子催化剂用于高效氮还原制氨：第一性原理研究","zb":"本研究利用第一性原理密度泛函理论系统研究了掺杂单原子过渡金属（Fe、Mo、Ru、W）的石墨炔（GY）在电化学氮还原反应中的活性，发现 Fe-GY 和 W-GY 具有最高的稳定性和最适宜的极限电位。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2025.07.052","t":"Dynamic oxidation synthesis of medium/high-entropy oxide catalysts with ultrahigh coordination disorder: Efficient ammonia borane hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2025.07.052","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Nuo Lei","Panpan Zhou","Junrui Zhang","Fei Chu","Changjun Cheng","Lixin Chen"],"o":"回填","zt":"具有超高频序和超高频乱配位的氧化催化剂的动态氧化合成：高效的氨硼烷水解","ob":"氨硼烷水解","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2025.138122","t":"Multi-heterostructure and surface free radicals induced enhanced ammonia gas sensing performance of polyaniline/tin phosphide/nitrogen-doped reduced graphene oxide at room temperature","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2025.138122","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Exploration of novel sensing materials and sensing strategies to provide highly sensitive and selective ammonia (NH3) gas detection is imperative for environmental pollution monitoring. Herein, a multi-heterostructure and surface free radical activation strategy is employed to enhance the NH3 sensing performance of tin phosphide (SnPx) at room temperature (RT). Characterizations confirm the uniform dispersion of SnPx on nitrogen-doped reduced graphene oxide (N-rGO) and the effective coating of polyaniline (PANI) film. The PANI/SnPx/N-rGO sensors show a well sensing ability to NH3 gas with a high sensitivity (3.1 @ 40 ppm) at RT, good selectivity and a low detection limit of 36.8 ppb. The multi-heterostructure can enable precise modulation of electronic properties and energy barriers. Additionally, the sensing material shows enhanced responses with increasing relative humidity, exhibiting","au":["Xiao Wang","Yao Fu","Feifei Li","Zhaokun Sun","Cunguang Zhu","Gang Zhao"],"o":"回填","zt":"多异质结构和表面自由基诱导的室温氨气传感性能增强的聚苯胺/磷化锡/氮掺杂还原石墨烯氧化物","zb":"探索新型传感材料和传感策略以提供高灵敏度和选择性的氨（NH3）气体检测对环境污染监测至关重要。本文采用多异质结构和表面自由基活化策略来增强室温（RT）磷化锡（SnPx）的NH3传感性能。表征证实SnPx在氮掺杂还原石墨烯氧化物（N-rGO）上均匀分散，并有效覆盖了聚苯胺（PANI）薄膜。PANI/SnPx/N-rGO传感器在室温下对NH3气表现出良好的传感能力，灵敏度高达3.1 @ 40 ppm，具有良好的选择性和低检测限36.8 ppb。多异质结构可以实现电子性质和能垒的精确调制。此外，传感材料在相对湿度增加时表现出增强的响应，在相对湿度为70%时对10 ppm NH3的响应为2.7。这种改进归因于表面吸附水分子的解离形成的羟基自由基，这促进了表面气体吸附。这项研究为制造高灵敏度传感材料提供了有效策略，并推进了新传感机制的研究。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcis.2025.137897","t":"Alkaline functional chromium carbide: Immobilization of ultrafine ruthenium copper nanoparticles for efficient hydrogen evolution from ammonia borane hydrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcis.2025.137897","s":"Journal of Colloid and Interface Science","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Designing cost-effective and high-performance heterogeneous nanocatalysts for ammonia borane hydrolysis is of extreme significance for hydrogen energy application, yielding a great challenge. Recently, MXene, a broad family of two-dimensional layered materials consisted of transition metal carbide/nitride materials, have garnered considerable attention for energy-related applications. Herein, for the first time, we introduce a facile strategy for designing a novel alkaline MXene chromium carbide (Cr3C2) coordinating ruthenium-copper nanoparticles (RuCu NPs) with optimal geometric configuration by introducing diamine species. The introduction of diamine species can efficiently tune the coordinating environment of two-dimensional Cr3C2 (MXene) surface, resulting in a uniform distribution of RuCu NPs with the size of 1.7 nm on Cr3C2 surface. The resulting alkaline Cr3C2 coordinating RuCu na","au":["Haotian Qin","Siyuan Tang","Linlin Xu","Aosong Li","Quanjiang Lv","Jianling Dong"],"o":"回填","zt":"碱性功能铬碳化物：将超细钌铜纳米颗粒固定用于高效的氨硼烷水解制氢","zb":"设计低成本、高性能的非均相纳米催化剂用于氨硼烷水解对氢能源应用至关重要。本文首次引入一种简便策略，通过引入二胺物种设计新型碱性MXene铬碳化物（Cr3C2）配位钌铜纳米颗粒（RuCu NPs），具有最优几何构型。二胺物种的引入能有效调节二维Cr3C2（MXene）表面的配位环境，导致1.7 nm大小的RuCu NPs在Cr3C2表面均匀分布。所得碱性Cr3C2配位RuCu纳米催化体系在无添加剂的情况下表现出优异的氨硼烷水解（ABH）催化动力学，在室温下提供高达1102 molH2molRu-1min-1的周转频率（TOF）和100%的氢选择性。这种增强归因于碱性二胺物种，它不仅修改了配位环境，还优化了活性位点的局域电荷分布和d中心，实现了合适的焓力学能垒和有利于吸附/脱附行为，从而加速氨硼烷水解。这项工作为构建作为路易斯体系的非均相MXene基纳米催化剂提供了新策略。","ob":"氨硼烷水解；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1016/j.fuel.2025.135599","t":"Preparation of hierarchical porous materials using coal gasification fine slag and the ammonia nitrogen adsorption performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.fuel.2025.135599","s":"Fuel","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Weiwei Xuan","Wanshu Liu","Shiying Yan","Erzhou Zhang","Qi Wang"],"o":"回填","zt":"利用煤液化细渣制备分级多孔材料及其氨氮吸附性能","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.169087","t":"Like-enzyme cascades of copper–cobalt oxides heterojunction boosts highly efficient nitrate electroreduction to ammonia for agriculture application","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.169087","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Bin Li","Peng-Yu Zhang","Wei-Kang Wang","Qi-Nian Wang","Yang-Yang Yu","Chang Liu"],"o":"回填","zt":"铜-钴氧化物异质结的类酶级联反应高效硝酸盐电还原为氨用于农业应用","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125477","t":"Ammonia-mediated CO2 adsorption for ammonium bicarbonate production via simultaneous CO2 capture and nitrate electroreduction in a flow cell with all sputtered thin film electrodes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125477","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Quoc-Nam Ha","Yu-Chan Chan","Dong-Hau Kuo"],"o":"回填","zt":"通过在具有所有溅射薄膜电极的流动池中同时进行 CO2 捕获和硝酸盐电还原，以氨介导的 CO2 吸附生产碳酸氢铵","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.agwat.2025.109857","t":"Water and nitrogen management strategies for stable-yield cotton in Northern Xinjiang under reduced nitrogen conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.agwat.2025.109857","s":"Agricultural Water Management","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Currently, cotton production faces challenges such as excessive nitrogen fertilization and water scarcity, which affect yield, quality, and environmental sustainability. Adequate water and nitrogen supply was shown to enhance cotton growth, and moderate nitrogen application could partly offset yield losses caused by water deficit. However, nitrogen rates above critical thresholds led to diminishing returns, while excessive water and nitrogen inputs reduced water use efficiency (WUE) and nitrogen partial factor productivity (NPFP, kg kg −1 ). A synergistic effect on NPFP was observed between irrigation quota and nitrogen application rate, with a 10 % reduction in irrigation quota under conventional nitrogen use significantly improving WUE, and marked regulatory effects of irrigation on NPFP under low-nitrogen conditions (N4). To verify these findings, three irrigation regimes（W1:488 mm、W2","au":["Sijia Wang","Jinghua Zhao","Chunxia Wang"],"o":"回填","zt":"在新疆北部减少氮条件下稳定产量的棉花的水和氮管理策略","zb":"研究对象为新疆北部棉花生产面临过量氮肥和水资源短缺问题，关键方法是田间实验，设置了三种灌溉制度（W1:488 mm、W2:444 mm、W3:400 mm）和四种氮肥施用水平（N1:440 kg ha −1 、N2:387 kg ha −1 、N3:336 kg ha −1 、N4:294 kg ha −1 ），主要结果为评估了灌溉成本、农艺性状和经济回报等九项指标，表明 400–444 mm 灌溉配额与 387–440 kg ha −1 氮肥施用量的最佳组合适合在膜覆盖滴灌条件下支持氮减排策略的同时维持产量。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1002/adsu.70216","t":"Electrocatalytic Reduction of Nitrate/Nitrite to Ammonia on CuCo Nanoparticles Decorated N‐doped Carbon (Adv. Sustainable Syst. 11/2025)","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adsu.70216","s":"Advanced Sustainable Systems","d":"2025-11","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia Synthesis In their Research Article (10.1002/adsu.202500523), Haoquan Zheng and co-workers demonstrate CuCo nanoparticles on N-doped carbon, derived from a ZIF material with a cross-shaped leaf morphology, for electrocatalytic nitrate-to-ammonia conversion. This design enables the efficient reduction of nitrate and nitrite to ammonia, marking a notable advance in sustainable nitrogen cycle electrochemistry. The work inspires further interest in environmental protection and electrochemical technology.","au":["Chuanfei Cang","Rong Hua","Guoqing Shen","Mengxue Ma","Yu Chen","Haoquan Zheng"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"CuCo 纳米颗粒装饰的 N-掺杂碳电催化硝酸盐/亚硝酸盐至氨转化","zb":"研究对象为 CuCo 纳米颗粒在 N-掺杂碳上的电催化硝酸盐至氨转化，关键方法是使用源自具有十字形叶形态的 MOF 材料的催化剂，主要结果为实现了硝酸盐和亚硝酸盐的高效还原至氨，标志着在可持续氮循环电化学方面的显著进步。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"}]);
